"],"fr":["comment utiliser Compose Hooks","qu''est-ce que Compose Hooks","Compose Hooks vs React Hooks","installation de Compose Hooks","guide de configuration de Compose Hooks","outils IA pour développeurs","gestion d''état dans Compose Multiplatform","alternatives à Compose Hooks"],"de":["wie man Compose Hooks verwendet","was ist Compose Hooks","Compose Hooks vs React Hooks","Installation von Compose Hooks","Konfigurationsanleitung für Compose Hooks","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Zustandsverwaltung in Compose Multiplatform","Alternativen zu Compose Hooks"],"pt":["como usar Compose Hooks","o que é Compose Hooks","Compose Hooks vs React Hooks","instalar Compose Hooks","guia de setup Compose Hooks","alternativas para Compose Hooks","desenvolvimento de aplicações com Compose Hooks","React Compose Hooks","Compose Multiplatform"],"ru":["как использовать Compose Hooks","что такое Compose Hooks","Compose Hooks vs React Hooks","установить Compose Hooks","руководство по настройке Compose Hooks","альтернативы Compose Hooks","разработка приложений с Compose Hooks","React Compose Hooks","Compose Multiplatform"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Compose Hooks","ما هي Compose Hooks","Compose Hooks مقابل React Hooks","تثبيت Compose Hooks","دليل إعداد Compose Hooks","بديل للCompose Hooks","تطوير التطبيقات مع Compose Hooks","React Compose Hooks","Compose Multiplatform"]}},"owner":"junerver","repo":"ComposeHooks","repoPath":"junerver/ComposeHooks","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.943Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compose-hooks","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# ComposeHooks 使用指南\n\nComposeHooks 是一个为 Jetpack Compose/Compose Multiplatform 设计的 Hooks 库，灵感来自 React Hooks 和 ahooks。\n\n## 核心概念\n\n所有 `useXxx` 函数都有对应的 `rememberXxx` 别名，选择你喜欢的命名风格。\n\n## 快速参考\n\n### 状态管理 Hooks\n\n| Hook | 用途 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `useState` | 基础状态管理（推荐用 by 委托） | `var state by useState(\"\")` |\n| `useGetState` | 解构使用的状态管理（推荐） | `val (state, setState, getState) = useGetState(0)` |\n| `useBoolean` | 布尔状态管理 | `val (state, toggle, setValue, setTrue, setFalse) = useBoolean(false)` |\n| `use","body":"# ComposeHooks 使用指南\n\nComposeHooks 是一个为 Jetpack Compose/Compose Multiplatform 设计的 Hooks 库，灵感来自 React Hooks 和 ahooks。\n\n## 核心概念\n\n所有 `useXxx` 函数都有对应的 `rememberXxx` 别名，选择你喜欢的命名风格。\n\n## 快速参考\n\n### 状态管理 Hooks\n\n| Hook | 用途 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `useState` | 基础状态管理（推荐用 by 委托） | `var state by useState(\"\")` |\n| `useGetState` | 解构使用的状态管理（推荐） | `val (state, setState, getState) = useGetState(0)` |\n| `useBoolean` | 布尔状态管理 | `val (state, toggle, setValue, setTrue, setFalse) = useBoolean(false)` |\n| `useReducer` | Redux 风格状态管理 | `val (state, dispatch) = useReducer(reducer, initialState)` |\n| `useRef` | 不触发重组的引用 | `val ref = useRef(0)` |\n| `useList` | 列表状态管理 | `val list = useList(1, 2, 3)` |\n| `useMap` | Map 状态管理 | `val map = useMap(\"key\" to \"value\")` |\n\n### 副作用 Hooks\n\n| Hook | 用途 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `useEffect` | 副作用处理 | `useEffect(dep) { /* effect */ }` |\n| `useMount` | 组件挂载时执行 | `useMount { loadData() }` |\n| `useUnmount` | 组件卸载时执行 | `useUnmount { cleanup() }` |\n| `useUpdateEffect` | 跳过首次执行的 Effect | `useUpdateEffect(dep) { /* effect */ }` |\n\n### 网络请求\n\n| Hook | 用途 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `useRequest` | 网络请求管理 | `val (data, loading, error, request) = useRequest(requestFn)` |\n\n### 工具 Hooks\n\n| Hook | 用途 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `useDebounce` | 防抖值 | `val debouncedValue = useDebounce(value)` |\n| `useThrottle` | 节流值 | `val throttledValue = useThrottle(value)` |\n| `useInterval` | 定时器 | `useInterval { tick() }` |\n| `useTimeoutFn` | 延时执行 | `useTimeoutFn(fn, 1.seconds)` |\n| `useUndo` | 撤销/重做 | `val (state, set, reset, undo, redo) = useUndo(initial)` |\n\n## 详细参考\n\n- **状态管理 Hooks**: 见 [references/state-hooks.md](references/state-hooks.md)\n- **副作用 Hooks**: 见 [references/effect-hooks.md](references/effect-hooks.md)\n- **工具 Hooks**: 见 [references/utility-hooks.md](references/utility-hooks.md)\n- **网络请求 Hooks**: 见 [references/request-hooks.md](references/request-hooks.md)\n- **Table 相关 Hooks**: 见 [references/table-hooks.md](references/table-hooks.md)\n\n## 常见模式\n\n### 1. 受控组件\n\n```kotlin\n// 推荐：使用 useGetState 解构\nval (text, setText) = useGetState(\"\")\nOutlinedTextField(\n    value = text.value,\n    onValueChange = setText,\n    label = { Text(\"输入\") }\n)\n\n// 或使用 by 委托\nvar text by useState(\"\")\nOutlinedTextField(\n    value = text,\n    onValueChange = { text = it },\n    label = { Text(\"输入\") }\n)\n```\n\n### 2. 解决闭包问题（来自 UseStateExample.kt）\n\n```kotlin\n// 方式1: 使用 useGetState 函数式更新\nval (state, setState) = useGetState(\"initial\")\nLaunchedEffect(Unit) {\n    repeat(10) {\n        delay(1.seconds)\n        setState { \"$it.\" }  // 函数式更新，避免闭包问题\n    }\n}\n\n// 方式2: 使用 by 委托\nvar byState by useState(\"initial\")\nLaunchedEffect(Unit) {\n    repeat(10) {\n        delay(1.seconds)\n        byState += \".\"  // 直接修改，无闭包问题\n    }\n}\n\n// 方式3: 使用 useLatestRef\nval (state, setState) = useState(\"initial\")\nval stateRef = useLatestRef(state)\nLaunchedEffect(Unit) {\n    repeat(10) {\n        delay(1.seconds)\n        setState(\"${stateRef.current}.\")  // 通过 ref 获取最新值\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 网络请求（来自 Auto&Manual.kt）\n\n```kotlin\n// 自动请求\nval (userInfoState, loadingState, errorState) = useRequest(\n    requestFn = { NetApi.userInfo(it) },\n    optionsOf = {\n        defaultParams = \"junerver\"  // 自动请求必须设置默认参数\n    }\n)\nval userInfo by userInfoState\nval loading by loadingState\n\nif (loading) {\n    Text(text = \"loading ...\")\n}\nuserInfo?.let { Text(text = it.toString()) }\n\n// 手动请求\nval (repoInfoState, loadingState, errorState, request) = useRequest(\n    requestFn = { it: Tuple2<String, String> ->\n        NetApi.repoInfo(it.first, it.second)\n    },\n    optionsOf = {\n        manual = true\n        defaultParams = tuple(\"junerver\", \"ComposeHooks\")\n    }\n)\nTButton(text = \"request\") { request() }\n```\n\n### 4. Redux 风格状态管理（来自 UseReducerExample.kt）\n\n```kotlin\n// 定义 State 和 Action\ndata class SimpleData(val name: String, val age: Int)\n\nsealed interface SimpleAction {\n    data class ChangeName(val newName: String) : SimpleAction\n    data object AgeIncrease : SimpleAction\n}\n\n// 定义 Reducer\nval simpleReducer: Reducer<SimpleData, SimpleAction> = { prevState, action ->\n    when (action) {\n        is SimpleAction.ChangeName -> prevState.copy(name = action.newName)\n        is SimpleAction.AgeIncrease -> prevState.copy(age = prevState.age + 1)\n    }\n}\n\n// 使用\nval (state, dispatch) = useReducer(\n    simpleReducer,\n    initialState = SimpleData(\"default\", 18),\n    middlewares = arrayOf(logMiddleware())\n)\n\nTButton(text = \"Change Name\") { dispatch(SimpleAction.ChangeName(\"Alice\")) }\nTButton(text = \"Increase Age\") { dispatch(SimpleAction.AgeIncrease) }\nText(text = \"State: ${state.value}\")\n```\n\n### 5. 列表操作（来自 UseListExample.kt）\n\n```kotlin\nval listState = useList(1, 2, 3)\n\n// 操作方法\nlistState.add(4)              // 添加\nlistState.add(0, 0)           // 插入\nlistState.removeAt(0)         // 删除\nlistState.removeLast()        // 删除最后一个\nlistState[0] = 10             // 修改\nlistState.clear()             // 清空\nlistState.shuffle()           // 打乱\n\n// 配合 useListReduce\nval sum by useListReduce(listState) { a, b -> a + b }\n```\n\n### 6. 防抖输入（来自 UseDebounceExample.kt）\n\n```kotlin\nvar inputValue by useState(\"\")\nval debouncedValue by useDebounce(\n    value = inputValue,\n    optionsOf = {\n        wait = 500.milliseconds\n    }\n)\n\nOutlinedTextField(\n    value = inputValue,\n    onValueChange = { inputValue = it },\n    label = { Text(\"Type something...\") }\n)\n\nText(text = \"Debounced: $debouncedValue\")\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:40:13.659Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multiplatform Agents needing streamlined state management with React-style hooks in Jetpack Compose","zh":"适用于需要使用React风格钩子进行流畅状态管理的多平台代理，特别是在Jetpack Compose中","ja":"Reactスタイルのフックを使用したスムーズな状態管理が必要なマルチプラットフォームエージェントに最適、特にJetpack Composeで","ko":"리액트 스타일의 훅을 사용한 매끄러운 상태 관리가 필요한 멀티플랫폼 에이전트에 적합, 특히 Jetpack Compose에서","es":"Ideal para agentes multiplataforma que necesitan una gestión de estado optimizada con ganchos de estilo React en Jetpack Compose","fr":"Idéal pour les agents multiplateformes nécessitant une gestion d''état rationalisée avec des crochets de style React dans Jetpack Compose","de":"Ideal für Multiplatform-Agents, die eine optimierte Zustandsverwaltung mit React-Style-Hooks in Jetpack Compose benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Multiplataforma que necessitam de gerenciamento de estado otimizado com ganchos no estilo React no Jetpack Compose","ru":"Идеально для Мультиплатформенных Агентов, которым необходим оптимизированный управление состоянием с крючками в стиле React в Jetpack Compose","ar":"مثالي لعميل متعدد المنصات الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة الحالة المتدفقة باستخدام Hooks على طراز React في Jetpack Compose"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage state efficiently using ComposeHooks, providing a library inspired by React Hooks and ahooks, with features like useState, useGetState, and useBoolean for comprehensive state control in Compose Multiplatform","zh":"赋予代理高效管理状态的能力，使用ComposeHooks提供的库，灵感来自React Hooks和ahooks，具有useState、useGetState和useBoolean等功能，提供全面状态控制的Compose Multiplatform","ja":"エージェントが状態を効率的に管理できるようにする、ComposeHooksによって提供されるライブラリは、React Hooksとahooksからインスピレーションを得ており、useState、useGetState、useBooleanなどの機能を備え、Compose Multiplatformでの包括的な状態管理を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 상태를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하는데, ComposeHooks가 제공하는 라이브러리는 리액트 훅스와 ahooks에서 영감을 얻었으며, useState, useGetState, useBoolean 등의 기능을 제공하여 컴포즈 멀티플랫폼에서 포괄적인 상태 관리를 제공한다","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar el estado de forma eficiente utilizando ComposeHooks, proporcionando una biblioteca inspirada en React Hooks y ahooks, con características como useState, useGetState y useBoolean para un control de estado integral en Compose Multiplatform","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état de manière efficace en utilisant ComposeHooks, en fournissant une bibliothèque inspirée de React Hooks et ahooks, avec des fonctionnalités comme useState, useGetState et useBoolean pour un contrôle d''état complet dans Compose Multiplatform","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, den Zustand effizient zu verwalten, indem sie ComposeHooks verwenden, und bietet eine Bibliothek, die von React Hooks und ahooks inspiriert ist, mit Funktionen wie useState, useGetState und useBoolean für eine umfassende Zustandskontrolle in Compose Multiplatform","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar estado de forma eficiente usando ComposeHooks, fornecendo uma biblioteca inspirada em React Hooks e ahooks, com recursos como useState, useGetState e useBoolean para controle abrangente de estado no Compose Multiplataforma","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять состоянием с помощью ComposeHooks, предоставляя библиотеку, вдохновленную React Hooks и ahooks, с функциями, такими как useState, useGetState и useBoolean для комплексного контроля состояния в Compose Мультиплатформа","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إدارة الحالة بفعالية باستخدام ComposeHooks ، وتوفير مكتبة مستوحاة من React Hooks و ahooks ، مع ميزات مثل useState و useGetState و useBoolean للسيطرة الشاملة على الحالة في Compose متعدد المنصات"},"useCases":{"en":["Simplifying state management in Compose Multiplatform applications","Implementing boolean state management with useBoolean","Utilizing useState and useGetState for basic and advanced state control"],"zh":["在Compose Multiplatform应用程序中简化状态管理","使用useBoolean实现布尔状态管理","使用useState和useGetState进行基本和高级状态控制"],"ja":["Compose Multiplatformアプリケーションの状態管理を簡素化する","useBooleanを使用したブール状態管理の実装","useStateとuseGetStateを使用した基本的な状態管理と高度な状態管理"],"ko":["컴포즈 멀티플랫폼 애플리케이션에서 상태 관리를 단순화하는 것","useBoolean을 사용한 불리언 상태 관리 구현","useState와 useGetState를 사용한 기본 및 고급 상태 제어"],"es":["Simplificar la gestión de estado en aplicaciones Compose Multiplatform","Implementar la gestión de estado booleano con useBoolean","Utilizar useState y useGetState para el control de estado básico y avanzado"],"fr":["Simplifier la gestion d''état dans les applications Compose Multiplatform","Mettre en œuvre la gestion d''état booléen avec useBoolean","Utiliser useState et useGetState pour le contrôle d''état de base et avancé"],"de":["Vereinfachen der Zustandsverwaltung in Compose Multiplatform-Anwendungen","Implementieren der booleschen Zustandsverwaltung mit useBoolean","Verwenden von useState und useGetState für die grundlegende und erweiterte Zustandskontrolle"],"pt":["Simplificando o gerenciamento de estado em aplicações Compose Multiplataforma","Implementando gerenciamento de estado booleano com useBoolean","Utilizando useState e useGetState para controle básico e avançado de estado"],"ru":["Упрощая управление состоянием в приложениях Compose Мультиплатформа","Реализуя управление булевым состоянием с useBoolean","Используя useState и useGetState для базового и расширенного контроля состояния"],"ar":["تبسيط إدارة الحالة في تطبيقات Compose متعددة المنصات","تنفيذ إدارة الحالة المنطقية باستخدام useBoolean","استخدام useState و useGetState للسيطرة الأساسية والمتقدمة على الحالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Jetpack Compose and Compose Multiplatform","Requires understanding of React-style hooks and their application in state management"],"zh":["仅限于Jetpack Compose和Compose Multiplatform","需要了解React风格的钩子及其在状态管理中的应用"],"ja":["Jetpack ComposeとCompose Multiplatformに限定される","Reactスタイルのフックとその状態管理への応用についての理解が必要"],"ko":["제트팩 컴포즈와 컴포즈 멀티플랫폼에만 제한됨","리액트 스타일의 훅과 상태 관리에 대한 응용에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Específico de Jetpack Compose y Compose Multiplatform","Requiere comprensión de ganchos de estilo React y su aplicación en la gestión de estado"],"fr":["Spécifique à Jetpack Compose et Compose Multiplatform","Nécessite une compréhension des crochets de style React et de leur application dans la gestion d''état"],"de":["Spezifisch für Jetpack Compose und Compose Multiplatform","Erfordert Verständnis von React-Style-Hooks und deren Anwendung in der Zustandsverwaltung"],"pt":["Específico para Jetpack Compose e Compose Multiplataforma","Exige compreensão de ganchos no estilo React e sua aplicação no gerenciamento de estado"],"ru":["Конкретно для Jetpack Compose и Compose Мультиплатформа","Требует понимания крючков в стиле React и их применения в управлении состоянием"],"ar":["محدد لجيت باك كومبوز وكومبوز متعددة المنصات","يتطلب فهم Hooks على طراز React وتطبيقها في إدارة الحالة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"aa07aa0a552ce3301c46f685579bb64e3ffc8962f84496361907c14ff165747f","qualityScore":34}');
