vs другие инструменты","установить explore","руководство по настройке explore","разработка приложений с explore","обнаружение местных служб"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام explore","ما هي مDNS","explore مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت explore","دليل إعداد explore","تطوير التطبيقات مع explore","اكتشاف الخدمات المحلية"]}},"owner":"sylin-org","repo":"koi","repoPath":"sylin-org/koi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.956Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"explore","description":"Run a mandatory pre-implementation exploration workflow before writing production code. Use when a task requires code changes and Codex must first map concerns/layers, read relevant files, check existing constants and types, identify the closest existing pattern, plan exact code placement, and confirm architectural guardrails.","bodyPreview":"# Explore\n\nBefore implementing anything for a task, complete the following steps in order.\nDo not write production code until all steps are done.\n\n## Step 1: Understand the task\n\nRestate the task in your own words. Identify:\n- What crate this touches: `koi-common`, `koi-client`, `koi-mdns`, `koi-config`, `koi-dns`, `koi-health`, `koi-proxy`, `koi-certmesh`, `koi-crypto`, `koi-truststore`, `koi-embedded`, `koi` binary\n- Which layer is involved: transport, business logic, wire format, CLI\n- Expect","body":"# Explore\n\nBefore implementing anything for a task, complete the following steps in order.\nDo not write production code until all steps are done.\n\n## Step 1: Understand the task\n\nRestate the task in your own words. Identify:\n- What crate this touches: `koi-common`, `koi-client`, `koi-mdns`, `koi-config`, `koi-dns`, `koi-health`, `koi-proxy`, `koi-certmesh`, `koi-crypto`, `koi-truststore`, `koi-embedded`, `koi` binary\n- Which layer is involved: transport, business logic, wire format, CLI\n- Expected output: new feature, refactor, bug fix, extension\n\n## Step 2: Read existing code\n\nOpen and read the 3-5 most relevant existing files.\nUse searches like:\n\n```bash\n# Find types related to the task\nrg \"struct|enum|trait\" crates/ -l | head -20\n\n# Find functions related to the task\nrg \"fn keyword_from_task\" crates/\n\n# Find the closest existing implementation to what we''re building\nrg \"similar_feature_keyword\" crates/ -l\n```\n\nFor each file read, state in one sentence what it does and whether it is relevant.\n\n## Step 3: Check for existing constants and types\n\nRun these searches explicitly and report results:\n\n```bash\n# Constants in the binary crate\nrg \"const \" crates/koi/src/\n\n# Shared types and utilities\nrg \"struct|enum\" crates/koi-common/src/\nrg \"struct|enum\" crates/koi-mdns/src/protocol/\n\n# Client types\nrg \"struct|enum\" crates/koi-client/src/\n\n# Domain crate types\nrg \"struct|enum\" crates/koi-dns/src/\nrg \"struct|enum\" crates/koi-health/src/\nrg \"struct|enum\" crates/koi-proxy/src/\nrg \"struct|enum\" crates/koi-certmesh/src/\n```\n\nFor each required piece of functionality, state clearly:\n- `Already exists`\n- `Needs to be created`\n\n## Step 4: Identify the closest pattern to follow\n\nFind the most similar existing feature in the codebase.\nExamples:\n- New HTTP endpoint: read `crates/koi/src/adapters/http.rs` or `crates/koi/src/adapters/dispatch.rs`\n- New CLI command: read a module in `crates/koi/src/commands/`\n- New shared types: read `crates/koi-common/src/types.rs` or `crates/koi-common/src/api.rs`\n- New domain logic: read the relevant domain crate (e.g., `crates/koi-mdns/`, `crates/koi-dns/`)\n- Platform integration: read `crates/koi/src/platform/`\n- Formatting: read `crates/koi/src/format.rs`\n- Client operations: read `crates/koi-client/src/lib.rs`\n\nState:\n- `Following the pattern from [specific file]`\n\n## Step 5: Plan where new code will live\n\nFor every new file, type, function, or constant, state location and justification:\n\n| New code | Location | Justification |\n|----------|----------|---------------|\n| (type/fn/const) | (exact path) | (why here and not elsewhere) |\n\nApply crate placement rules:\n- Shared types, traits, utilities: `crates/koi-common/`\n- mDNS protocol types: `crates/koi-mdns/`\n- HTTP client methods: `crates/koi-client/`\n- CLI commands / subcommands: `crates/koi/src/commands/`\n- HTTP server / adapters: `crates/koi/src/adapters/`\n- OS integration: `crates/koi/src/platform/`\n- Output formatting: `crates/koi/src/format.rs`\n- DNS domain logic: `crates/koi-dns/`\n- Health checks: `crates/koi-health/`\n- Reverse proxy: `crates/koi-proxy/`\n- Certificate mesh: `crates/koi-certmesh/`\n- Crypto primitives: `crates/koi-crypto/`\n- Configuration / breadcrumb: `crates/koi-config/`\n\n## Step 6: Check for potential violations\n\nBefore proceeding, confirm:\n\n- [ ] No `mdns-sd` imports outside `crates/koi-mdns/`\n- [ ] No new type duplicates one in `koi-common` or domain crates\n- [ ] Constants are co-located with usage (not in a centralized module)\n- [ ] New protocol types have serde round-trip tests planned\n- [ ] Cross-crate dependencies flow downward (binary -> domain crates -> koi-common)\n\n## Step 7: Present the plan\n\nSummarize findings in this exact format:\n\n**Task:** (one sentence)\n**Files read:** (list with one-sentence relevance notes)\n**Reusing:** (list what already exists)\n**Creating new:** (table from Step 5)\n**Pattern:** (which existing file you''re following)\n**Risks:** (anything you''re unsure about)\n\nThen stop and wait for approval before implementing.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:47:09.055Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured task analysis and local mDNS service discovery capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化任务分析和本地mDNS服务发现能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが構造化されたタスク分析とローカルmDNSサービス発見の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 작업 분석 및 로컬 mDNS 서비스 발견 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan análisis de tareas estructuradas y capacidades de descubrimiento de servicios mDNS locales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une analyse de tâches structurée et de capacités de découverte de services mDNS locaux.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine strukturierte Aufgabenanalyse und lokale mDNS-Diensterkennungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de análise de tarefas estruturada e capacidades de descoberta de serviço mDNS local.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется структурированный анализ задач и возможности локального обнаружения сервисов mDNS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطويين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل مهام منظم وسمات اكتشاف الخدمة mDNS المحلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically break down tasks into understandable components using crates like `koi-mdns` and `koi-common`, facilitating comprehensive content analysis and transport layer involvement.","zh":"使能够代理系统地将任务分解为可理解的组件，使用像`koi-mdns`和`koi-common`这样的库，促进全面内容分析和传输层参与。","ja":"エージェントがタスクを理解可能なコンポーネントに体系的に分解できるようにし、`koi-mdns`や`koi-common`などのクレートを使用して、包括的なコンテンツ分析とトランスポート層の関与を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 작업을 이해할 수 있는 구성 요소로 체계적으로 분해할 수 있도록 하며, `koi-mdns` 및 `koi-common`과 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 포괄적인 내용 분석 및 전송 계층 참여를促进합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descomponer sistemáticamente las tareas en componentes comprensibles utilizando crates como `koi-mdns` y `koi-common`, lo que facilita un análisis de contenido integral y la participación en la capa de transporte.","fr":"Permet aux agents de décomposer systématiquement les tâches en composants compréhensibles en utilisant des crates comme `koi-mdns` et `koi-common`, ce qui facilite une analyse de contenu complète et l''implication de la couche de transport.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Mitteln, Aufgaben systematisch in verständliche Komponenten zu zerlegen, indem sie crates wie `koi-mdns` und `koi-common` verwenden, was eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und die Beteiligung an der Transportebene erleichtert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a quebrar tarefas de forma sistemática em componentes compreensíveis usando crates como `koi-mdns` e `koi-common`, facilitando uma análise abrangente de conteúdo e envolvimento da camada de transporte.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически разбивать задачи на понятные компоненты с использованием таких crates, как `koi-mdns` и `koi-common`, что облегчает всесторонний анализ содержания и участие транспортного уровня.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تفكيك المهام بشكل منظم إلى مكونات يمكن فهمها باستخدام الحزم مثل `koi-mdns` و `koi-common`، مما يسهل تحليل المحتوى الشامل والاشتراك في層 النقل."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing task requirements","Identifying involved crates and layers","Discovering local mDNS services"],"zh":["分析任务需求","识别涉及的库和层","发现本地mDNS服务"],"ja":["タスク要件の分析","関与するクレートとレイヤーの特定","ローカルmDNSサービスの発見"],"ko":["작업 요구 사항 분석","관련 라이브러리 및 계층 식별","로컬 mDNS 서비스 발견"],"es":["Análisis de los requisitos de la tarea","Identificación de los crates y capas involucrados","Descubrimiento de servicios mDNS locales"],"fr":["Analyse des exigences de la tâche","Identification des crates et couches impliqués","Découverte de services mDNS locaux"],"de":["Analyse der Aufgabenanforderungen","Identifizierung der beteiligten crates und Ebenen","Entdeckung lokaler mDNS-Dienste"],"pt":["Analisar requisitos de tarefas","Identificar crates e camadas envolvidas","Descobrir serviços mDNS locais"],"ru":["Анализ требований задач","Определение задействованных crates и слоев","Обнаружение локальных сервисов mDNS"],"ar":["تحليل متطلبات المهام","تحديد الحزم والطبقات المشاركة","اكتشاف خدمات mDNS المحلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires completion of all steps before production code implementation","Specific to local mDNS service discovery"],"zh":["需要在生产代码实现之前完成所有步骤","仅限本地mDNS服务发现"],"ja":["生産コードの実装前にすべてのステップを完了する必要がある","ローカルmDNSサービス発見に特有"],"ko":["생산 코드 구현 전에 모든 단계를 완료해야 함","로컬 mDNS 서비스 발견에เฉพาะ함"],"es":["Requiere la finalización de todos los pasos antes de la implementación del código de producción","Específico para el descubrimiento de servicios mDNS locales"],"fr":["Nécessite la finalisation de toutes les étapes avant la mise en œuvre du code de production","Spécifique à la découverte de services mDNS locaux"],"de":["Erfordert die Fertigstellung aller Schritte vor der Implementierung des Produktionscodes","Spezifisch für die Erkennung lokaler mDNS-Dienste"],"pt":["Exige a conclusão de todas as etapas antes da implementação do código de produção","Específico para a descoberta de serviços mDNS local"],"ru":["Требует завершения всех шагов перед реализацией производственного кода","Специфичен для локального обнаружения сервисов mDNS"],"ar":["يتطلب إكمال جميع الخطوات قبل تنفيذ رمز الإنتاج","محدد لاكتشاف خدمات mDNS المحلية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"27206e323e2ea1811659ed31a031b634e61f279727f4d7f03bf156542d7dd840","qualityScore":34}');
