eact, Python и Node.js","Поддержка командной строки CLI","Легкая установка и настройка"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل OpenAI Codex CLI","تحسين إنتاجية المطورين","التكامل مع React، Python و Node.js","دعم سطر الأوامر CLI","تثبيت وتهيئة سهلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用OmX","什么是OpenAI Codex CLI","OmX替代品","OmX安装","OpenAI Codex CLI教程","AI工具下载","开发效率提升","OmX设置"],"ja":["OmXの使い方","OpenAI Codex CLIとは","OmXの代替","OmXのインストール","OpenAI Codex CLIのチュートリアル","AIエージェントのダウンロード","開発効率の向上","OmXの設定"],"ko":["OmX 사용법","OpenAI Codex CLI란","OmX 대체","OmX 설치","OpenAI Codex CLI 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 다운로드","개발 효율성 향상","OmX 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","OpenAI Codex CLI","desarrollo de aplicaciones con AI","mejora de la productividad con herramientas de AI","OmX vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de OmX","guía de configuración de OmX"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développeurs","OpenAI Codex CLI","développement d''applications avec IA","amélioration de la productivité avec des outils d''IA","OmX vs autres outils d''IA","installation d''OmX","guide de configuration d''OmX"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","OpenAI Codex CLI","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit KI","Produktivitätssteigerung mit KI-Tools","OmX vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von OmX","Konfigurationsanleitung für OmX"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","OpenAI Codex CLI","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade dos desenvolvedores","como usar OmX","OmX vs outros ferramentas de IA","instalação do OmX","guia de configuração do OmX"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","OpenAI Codex CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность разработчиков","как использовать OmX","OmX vs другие ИИ Агенты","установка OmX","руководство по настройке OmX"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","OpenAI Codex CLI","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية المطورين","كيفية استخدام OmX","OmX مقارنة بأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت OmX","دليل إعداد OmX"]}},"owner":"Yeachan-Heo","repo":"oh-my-codex","repoPath":"Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-codex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.976Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"omx-setup","description":"Setup and configure oh-my-codex using current CLI behavior","bodyPreview":"# OMX Setup\n\nUse this skill when users want to install or refresh oh-my-codex for the **current project plus user-level OMX directories**.\n\n## Command\n\n```bash\nomx setup [--force] [--dry-run] [--verbose] [--scope <user|project>]\n```\n\nSupported setup flags (current implementation):\n- `--force`: overwrite/reinstall managed artifacts where applicable\n- `--dry-run`: print actions without mutating files\n- `--verbose`: print per-file/per-step details\n- `--scope`: choose install scope (`user`, `project","body":"# OMX Setup\n\nUse this skill when users want to install or refresh oh-my-codex for the **current project plus user-level OMX directories**.\n\n## Command\n\n```bash\nomx setup [--force] [--dry-run] [--verbose] [--scope <user|project>]\n```\n\nSupported setup flags (current implementation):\n- `--force`: overwrite/reinstall managed artifacts where applicable\n- `--dry-run`: print actions without mutating files\n- `--verbose`: print per-file/per-step details\n- `--scope`: choose install scope (`user`, `project`)\n\n## What this setup actually does\n\n`omx setup` performs these steps:\n\n1. Resolve setup scope:\n   - `--scope` explicit value\n   - else persisted `./.omx/setup-scope.json` (with automatic migration of legacy values)\n   - else interactive prompt on TTY (default `user`)\n   - else default `user` (safe for CI/tests)\n2. Create directories and persist effective scope\n3. Install prompts, native agent configs, skills, and merge config.toml (scope determines target directories)\n4. Verify required team MCP comm tool exports exist in built `dist/mcp/state-server.js`\n5. Generate project-root `./AGENTS.md` from `templates/AGENTS.md` (or skip when existing and no force)\n6. Configure notify hook references and write `./.omx/hud-config.json`\n\n## Important behavior notes\n\n- `omx setup` only prompts for scope when no scope is provided/persisted and stdin/stdout are TTY.\n- Local project orchestration file is `./AGENTS.md` (project root).\n- If `AGENTS.md` exists and `--force` is not used, interactive TTY runs ask whether to overwrite. Non-interactive runs preserve the file.\n- Scope targets:\n  - `user`: user directories (`~/.codex`, `~/.agents/skills`, `~/.omx/agents`)\n  - `project`: local directories (`./.codex`, `./.agents/skills`, `./.omx/agents`)\n- If persisted scope is `project`, `omx` launch automatically uses `CODEX_HOME=./.codex` unless user explicitly overrides `CODEX_HOME`.\n- With `--force`, AGENTS overwrite may still be skipped if an active OMX session is detected (safety guard).\n- Legacy persisted scope values (`project-local`) are automatically migrated to `project` with a one-time warning.\n\n## Recommended workflow\n\n1. Run setup:\n\n```bash\nomx setup --force --verbose\n```\n\n2. Verify installation:\n\n```bash\nomx doctor\n```\n\n3. Start Codex with OMX in the target project directory.\n\n## Expected verification indicators\n\nFrom `omx doctor`, expect:\n- Prompts installed (scope-dependent: user or project)\n- Skills installed (scope-dependent: user or project)\n- AGENTS.md found in project root\n- `.omx/state` exists\n- OMX MCP servers configured in scope target `config.toml` (`~/.codex/config.toml` or `./.codex/config.toml`)\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- If using local source changes, run build first:\n\n```bash\nnpm run build\n```\n\n- If your global `omx` points to another install, run local entrypoint:\n\n```bash\nnode bin/omx.js setup --force --verbose\nnode bin/omx.js doctor\n```\n\n- If AGENTS.md was not overwritten during `--force`, stop active OMX session and rerun setup.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:16.498Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing streamlined OpenAI Codex CLI management, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code.","zh":"适合需要简化OpenAI Codex CLI管理的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code。","ja":"OpenAI Codex CLIの管理をストリームライン化する必要があるAIエージェント、たとえばCursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeに適しています。","ko":"OpenAI Codex CLI 관리를 간소화해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 예를 들어 Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 에이전트입니다.","es":"Perfecto para los agentes de IA que necesitan una gestión de OpenAI Codex CLI optimizada, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une gestion de OpenAI Codex CLI rationalisée, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine optimierte OpenAI Codex CLI-Verwaltung benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de gerenciamento de linha de comando OpenAI Codex simplificado, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется упрощенное управление OpenAI Codex CLI, например, Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة سطر أوامر OpenAI Codex مبسطة، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage oh-my-codex installations with flags like --force, --dry-run, and --verbose, streamlining project and user-level setups via the OpenAI Codex CLI, including support for protocols like CLI commands and file formats.","zh":"赋予代理高效管理oh-my-codex安装的能力，使用像--force、--dry-run和--verbose这样的标志，通过OpenAI Codex CLI简化项目和用户级别的设置，包括对像CLI命令和文件格式这样的协议的支持。","ja":"エージェントにoh-my-codexのインストールを効率的に管理する能力を付与します。--force、--dry-run、--verboseなどのフラグを使用して、OpenAI Codex CLIを介してプロジェクトとユーザーレベルの設定を簡素化します。CLIコマンドやファイル形式などのプロトコルもサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 oh-my-codex 설치를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다. --force, --dry-run, --verbose와 같은 플래그를 사용하여 OpenAI Codex CLI를 통해 프로젝트 및 사용자 수준의 설정을 간소화합니다. CLI 명령 및 파일 형식과 같은 프로토콜에 대한 지원도 포함됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de forma eficiente las instalaciones de oh-my-codex con indicadores como --force, --dry-run y --verbose, racionalizando la configuración de proyectos y usuarios a través de la CLI de OpenAI Codex, incluyendo el soporte para protocolos como comandos CLI y formatos de archivo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière efficace les installations oh-my-codex avec des indicateurs tels que --force, --dry-run et --verbose, rationalisant la configuration des projets et des utilisateurs via la CLI OpenAI Codex, y compris le support pour les protocoles tels que les commandes CLI et les formats de fichier.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, oh-my-codex-Installationen mit Flags wie --force, --dry-run und --verbose effizient zu verwalten, wodurch die Projektkonfiguration und die Benutzerebene über die OpenAI Codex CLI rationalisiert werden, einschließlich der Unterstützung für Protokolle wie CLI-Befehle und Dateiformate.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem de forma eficiente as instalações oh-my-codex com flags como --force, --dry-run e --verbose, simplificando as configurações de projeto e nível de usuário por meio da CLI OpenAI Codex, incluindo suporte a protocolos como comandos CLI e formatos de arquivo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно управлять установками oh-my-codex с флагами, такими как --force, --dry-run и --verbose, упрощая настройки проекта и пользовательского уровня через OpenAI Codex CLI, включая поддержку протоколов, таких как команды CLI и форматы файлов.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إدارة تثبيتات oh-my-codex بفعالية باستخدام علامات مثل --force و --dry-run و --verbose، وتبسيط إعدادات المستوى المشروع والمتوفر عبر CLI OpenAI Codex، بما في ذلك الدعم البروتوكولات مثل أوامر CLI وتنسيقات الملفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating oh-my-codex installations for new projects","Refreshing existing oh-my-codex setups with the latest artifacts","Debugging oh-my-codex issues using verbose mode"],"zh":["为新项目自动化oh-my-codex安装","使用最新的工件刷新现有的oh-my-codex设置","使用verbose模式调试oh-my-codex问题"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトのoh-my-codexのインストールを自動化する","最新のアーティファクトを使用して既存のoh-my-codexの設定を更新する","verboseモードを使用してoh-my-codexの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["새로운 프로젝트를 위한 oh-my-codex 설치 자동화","최신 아티팩트를 사용하여 기존 oh-my-codex 설정을 새로 고침","Verbose 모드를 사용하여 oh-my-codex 문제를 디버깅합니다."],"es":["Automatizar las instalaciones de oh-my-codex para nuevos proyectos","Actualizar las configuraciones de oh-my-codex existentes con los últimos artefactos","Depurar problemas de oh-my-codex mediante el modo verbose"],"fr":["Automatiser les installations oh-my-codex pour les nouveaux projets","Mettre à jour les configurations oh-my-codex existantes avec les derniers artefacts","Déboguer les problèmes oh-my-codex en utilisant le mode verbose"],"de":["Automatisieren der oh-my-codex-Installationen für neue Projekte","Aktualisieren der vorhandenen oh-my-codex-Konfigurationen mit den neuesten Artefakten","Fehlerbehebung bei oh-my-codex-Problemen mithilfe des Verbose-Modus"],"pt":["Automatizar instalações oh-my-codex para novos projetos","Atualizar configurações oh-my-codex existentes com os artefatos mais recentes","Depurar problemas oh-my-codex usando modo verbose"],"ru":["Автоматизировать установки oh-my-codex для новых проектов","Обновлять существующие настройки oh-my-codex с последними артефактами","Отлаживать проблемы oh-my-codex с помощью режима verbose"],"ar":["توتير تثبيتات oh-my-codex للأهداف الجديدة","تحديث إعدادات oh-my-codex الحالية مع أحدث المكونات","تصحيح أعطال oh-my-codex باستخدام وضع مفصل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI Codex CLI access","Limited to oh-my-codex tooling","Dependent on user or project scope specification"],"zh":["需要OpenAI Codex CLI访问","仅限oh-my-codex工具","依赖于用户或项目范围的指定"],"ja":["OpenAI Codex CLIへのアクセスが必要","oh-my-codexツールに限定される","ユーザーまたはプロジェクトのスコープの指定に依存する"],"ko":["OpenAI Codex CLI 액세스가 필요합니다.","oh-my-codex 툴링에만 제한됩니다.","사용자 또는 프로젝트 범위 사양에 따라 다름"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la CLI de OpenAI Codex","Limitado a la herramienta oh-my-codex","Dependiente de la especificación del alcance del usuario o proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à la CLI OpenAI Codex","Limité à l''outil oh-my-codex","Dépend de la spécification de la portée de l''utilisateur ou du projet"],"de":["Benötigt den Zugriff auf die OpenAI Codex CLI","Begrenzt auf die oh-my-codex-Tooling","Abhängig von der Benutzer- oder Projektscope-Spezifikation"],"pt":["Exige acesso à CLI OpenAI Codex","Limitado à ferramenta oh-my-codex","Dependente da especificação do escopo do usuário ou projeto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к OpenAI Codex CLI","Ограничен инструментом oh-my-codex","Зависит от указания области действия пользователя или проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى CLI OpenAI Codex","محدود بأداة oh-my-codex","يعتمد على تحديد نطاق المستخدم أو المشروع"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d1e59240645f5f556f8d35e0c73e13621847bd3b81fe4d375769b96da2f40462","qualityScore":34}');
