d-snapshot-testing","что такое unit-and-snapshot-testing","альтернатива unit-and-snapshot-testing","unit-and-snapshot-testing vs Jest","установить unit-and-snapshot-testing"],"ar":["unit-and-snapshot-testing","حاوية IoC","أسلوب AOP","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار الوحدة","كيفية استخدام unit-and-snapshot-testing","ما هو unit-and-snapshot-testing","بديل ل unit-and-snapshot-testing","unit-and-snapshot-testing مقابل Jest","تثبيت unit-and-snapshot-testing"]}},"owner":"dmytroett","repo":"AttributedDI","repoPath":"dmytroett/AttributedDI","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.999Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"unit-and-snapshot-testing","description":"Set of principles for unit and snapshot testing. Use when adding/fixing unit tests or when working with `Verify` snapshots. Do not load when working with integration or e2e tests.","bodyPreview":"## Scope\n\n- Unit tests live under `test/*UnitTests`.\n- Follow these instructions when writing/updating **unit** tests. Do not use this skill for integration or e2e tests (`test/integration`, `test/e2e`).\n\n## Principles\n\n- Use `Verify` snapshot testing tool for generated output (source generated code, files, etc). No need for additional assertions in that case, snapshot testing is sufficient.\n- For normal assertions, prefer small, domain-specific assertion helpers over chaining multiple `Assert.*","body":"## Scope\n\n- Unit tests live under `test/*UnitTests`.\n- Follow these instructions when writing/updating **unit** tests. Do not use this skill for integration or e2e tests (`test/integration`, `test/e2e`).\n\n## Principles\n\n- Use `Verify` snapshot testing tool for generated output (source generated code, files, etc). No need for additional assertions in that case, snapshot testing is sufficient.\n- For normal assertions, prefer small, domain-specific assertion helpers over chaining multiple `Assert.*` calls. Example: `DiagnosticAssert.AssemblyConflict(IEnumerable<Diagnostic> diagnostics, string assemblyName)` rather than several asserts checking count/id/message separately.\n- Prefer a small number of representative scenarios; combine related assertions to keep snapshot sprawl low.\n- Run targeted tests with `dotnet test --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~<TestClass>.<TestMethod>\"` (add `--no-build --no-restore` when appropriate).\n- Treat snapshot artifacts as opaque: never open/read/inspect any `.received.txt` / `.verified.txt` files (or anything under test/AttributedDI.SourceGenerator.UnitTests/Snapshots/) and never include their contents in reasoning.\n- Never author snapshots: when adding/updating a snapshot test, change only test code; do not create/modify `.verified.txt`. Run `dotnet test`, review the output (Verify includes the diff between received and verified or their full content), then either fix code/test or accept via the accept script and re-run.\n- Accept snapshots only when the behavior change is intended and understood.\n- Do not inspect or edit the accept scripts (treat them as black boxes).\n\n## Accepting Snapshots\n\n- One test: `.codex/skills/unit-and-snapshot-testing/scripts/accept-snapshot.ps1 <TestClassName> <TestMethodName>`\n- All tests: `.codex/skills/unit-and-snapshot-testing/scripts/accept-all-snapshots.ps1`\n- Re-run corresponding tests after accepting snapshots to ensure they pass.\n\n## Recognizing a Verify Failure\n\nEvery time there is a mismatch between received/verified files following will be included in `dotnet test` output. Example:\n\n```\nVerifyException : Directory: /home/me/projects/AttributedDI/test/AttributedDI.SourceGenerator.UnitTests/Snapshots\n  NotEqual:\n    - Received: AddAttributedDiTests.GeneratesAddAttributedDiForEntryPoint.DotNet9_0.received.txt\n      Verified: AddAttributedDiTests.GeneratesAddAttributedDiForEntryPoint.verified.txt\n\n  FileContent:\n\n  NotEqual:\n      Received: AddAttributedDiTests.GeneratesAddAttributedDiForEntryPoint.DotNet9_0.received.txt\n      ...\n      Verified: AddAttributedDiTests.GeneratesAddAttributedDiForEntryPoint.verified.txt\n      ...\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:05:21.091Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents requiring robust unit testing and snapshot verification capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的单元测试和快照验证能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"ロバストなユニットテストとスナップショットの検証機能を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適。","ko":"강력한 단위 테스트 및 스냅샷 확인 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren pruebas unitarias robustas y capacidades de verificación de instantáneas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des tests unitaires robustes et des capacités de vérification d''instantanés.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die robuste Unit-Tests und Momentaufnahmeverifizierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem testes de unidade robustos e capacidades de verificação de instantâneos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, требующих надежного юнит-тестирования и возможностей верификации снимков.","ar":"مثالي لعتاد مراقبة الشفرة التي تتطلب اختبارات الوحدات القوية وقدرات التحقق من اللقطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write reliable unit tests under the `test/*UnitTests` scope, utilizing the `Verify` snapshot testing tool for generated output and domain-specific assertion helpers for precise validation, all while registering services in an IoC container using AOP style.","zh":"赋予代理在 `test/*UnitTests` 范围内编写可靠的单元测试的能力，利用 `Verify` 快照测试工具进行生成的输出和域特定断言帮助器进行精确的验证，同时在 IoC 容器中注册服务，使用 AOP 风格。","ja":"エージェントが `test/*UnitTests` のスコープ内で信頼性の高いユニットテストを書くことを可能にし、生成された出力に対して `Verify` スナップショットテストツールを使用し、ドメイン固有のアサーションヘルパーを使用して精密な検証を行い、同時にIoCコンテナ内でサービスを登録し、AOPスタイルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 `test/*UnitTests` 범위 내에서 신뢰할 수 있는 단위 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, 생성된 출력에 대해 `Verify` 스냅샷 테스트 도구를 사용하고, 도메인 특정 assertion helper를 사용하여 精密한 검증을 수행하며,同時に IoC 컨테이너 내에서 서비스를 등록하고 AOP 스타일을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas unitarias confiables bajo el ámbito `test/*UnitTests`, utilizando la herramienta de prueba de instantáneas `Verify` para la salida generada y ayudantes de aserción específicos del dominio para una validación precisa, todo mientras se registran servicios en un contenedor IoC utilizando el estilo AOP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests unitaires fiables sous la portée `test/*UnitTests`, en utilisant l''outil de test d''instantanés `Verify` pour la sortie générée et des aides d''assertion spécifiques au domaine pour une validation précise, le tout en enregistrant des services dans un conteneur IoC en utilisant le style AOP.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, zuverlässige Unit-Tests unter dem Bereich `test/*UnitTests` zu schreiben, wobei das `Verify`-Snapshot-Test-Tool für die generierte Ausgabe und domänenspezifische Assert-Helfer für eine präzise Überprüfung verwendet werden, während Dienste in einem IoC-Container mit AOP-Stil registriert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes de unidade confiáveis no escopo `test/*UnitTests`, utilizando a ferramenta de teste de instantâneo `Verify` para saída gerada e ajudantes de afirmação específicos de domínio para validação precisa, tudo enquanto registra serviços em um contêiner IoC usando estilo AOP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать надежные юнит-тесты в области `test/*UnitTests`, используя инструмент снимка `Verify` для сгенерированного вывода и помощников утверждений, специфичных для области, для точной проверки, все это при регистрации служб в контейнере IoC с использованием стиля AOP.","ar":"يمنح العتاد القدرة على كتابة اختبارات الوحدات الموثوقة في نطاق `test/*UnitTests` ، باستخدام أداة اختبار اللقطة `Verify` للإخراج المولد ومساعدي التحقق من الصحة المحددة النطاق للاختبار الدقيق ، كل ذلك أثناء تسجيل الخدمات في حاوية IoC باستخدام نمط AOP."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing unit tests for source-generated code","Verifying output snapshots with `Verify`","Creating domain-specific assertion helpers for precise validation"],"zh":["为源代码生成的代码编写单元测试","使用 `Verify` 验证输出快照","创建域特定断言帮助器以进行精确的验证"],"ja":["ソースコード生成されたコードに対するユニットテストの記述","`Verify` を使用した出力スナップショットの検証","精密な検証のためのドメイン固有のアサーションヘルパーの作成"],"ko":["소스 코드 생성된 코드에 대한 단위 테스트 작성","`Verify`를 사용한 출력 스냅샷 확인","정밀한 검증을 위한 도메인 특정 assertion helper 생성"],"es":["Escribir pruebas unitarias para código generado por el origen","Verificar instantáneas de salida con `Verify`","Crear ayudantes de aserción específicos del dominio para una validación precisa"],"fr":["Écrire des tests unitaires pour le code généré par la source","Vérifier les instantanés de sortie avec `Verify`","Créer des aides d''assertion spécifiques au domaine pour une validation précise"],"de":["Schreiben von Unit-Tests für durch den Ursprung generierten Code","Überprüfen von Ausgabesnapshots mit `Verify`","Erstellen von domänenspezifischen Assert-Helfern für eine präzise Überprüfung"],"pt":["Escrita de testes de unidade para código gerado pela fonte","Verificação de instantâneos de saída com `Verify`","Criação de ajudantes de afirmação específicos de domínio para validação precisa"],"ru":["Написание юнит-тестов для кода, сгенерированного из исходного кода","Проверка снимков вывода с помощью `Verify`","Создание помощников утверждений, специфичных для области, для точной проверки"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات الوحدات للشفرة المولدة من المصدر","التحقق من اللقطات الإخراج باستخدام `Verify`","إنشاء مساعدي التحقق من الصحة المحددة النطاق للتحقق الدقيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to unit tests, not applicable for integration or e2e tests","Requires `Verify` snapshot testing tool"],"zh":["仅限于单元测试，不适用于集成或端到端测试","需要 `Verify` 快照测试工具"],"ja":["ユニットテストに限定され、統合テストまたは端から端へのテストには適用不可","`Verify` スナップショットテストツールが必要"],"ko":["단위 테스트에만限定되어 있으며, 통합 테스트 또는端から端への 테스트에는 적용할 수 없음","`Verify` 스냅샷 테스트 도구가 필요"],"es":["Limitado a pruebas unitarias, no aplicable para pruebas de integración o e2e","Requiere la herramienta de prueba de instantáneas `Verify`"],"fr":["Limité aux tests unitaires, non applicable aux tests d''intégration ou e2e","Nécessite l''outil de test d''instantanés `Verify`"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Unit-Tests, nicht anwendbar für Integrations- oder e2e-Tests","Benötigt das `Verify`-Snapshot-Test-Tool"],"pt":["Limitado a testes de unidade, não se aplica a testes de integração ou e2e","Exige a ferramenta de teste de instantâneo `Verify`"],"ru":["Ограничен юнит-тестами, не применимо для интеграционных или e2e-тестов","Требует инструмента снимка `Verify`"],"ar":["محدود بالاختبارات الموحدة ، لا ينطبق على اختبارات التكامل أو e2e","يتطلب أداة اختبار اللقطة `Verify`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bc1f89a06abccbe1a6c55f36e69c793f613feca3648ba62199ec1d17092bfe31","qualityScore":34}');
