stallation de Convex Migration","guide de configuration de Convex Migration","développement d''intégrations de données","outils d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man Convex Migration verwendet","was ist ein KI-Tool","Alternative zu Convex Migration","Convex Migration vs andere","Installation von Convex Migration","Konfigurationsanleitung für Convex Migration","Entwicklung von Datenintegrationslösungen","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","integração de dados","Rubic","Tripletex","como usar Convex Migration","o que é Convex Migration","alternativas ao Convex Migration","Convex Migration vs outras ferramentas","instalar Convex Migration","guias de configuração do Convex Migration"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","интеграция данных","Rubic","Tripletex","как использовать Convex Migration","что такое Convex Migration","альтернативы Convex Migration","Convex Migration vs другие инструменты","установить Convex Migration","руководства по настройке Convex Migration"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكامل البيانات","روبيك","تريبلتكس","كيفية استخدام Convex Migration","ما هو Convex Migration","بديل Convex Migration","Convex Migration مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Convex Migration","دليل إعداد Convex Migration"]}},"owner":"frodeste","repo":"rubic2tripletex","repoPath":"frodeste/rubic2tripletex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.048Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-migration","description":"Guide migration from the current Drizzle ORM / Neon Postgres stack to Convex. Use when the user asks about Convex, migrating the database, replacing Drizzle, or setting up Convex schema, functions, or queries. Provides schema translation, function patterns, and migration considerations specific to this project.","bodyPreview":"# Convex Migration Guide\n\nThis project currently uses **Drizzle ORM + Neon Postgres**. This skill guides migration to **Convex** as the backend database.\n\n## Current Stack (What We''re Migrating From)\n\n- **ORM:** Drizzle ORM 0.45.x with `drizzle-kit` for migrations\n- **Database:** Neon Postgres (serverless)\n- **Schema:** `src/db/schema.ts` -- 4 tables with enums, composite primary keys\n- **Client:** `src/db/client.ts` -- Drizzle client with Neon connection\n- **Migrations:** `src/db/migrations/` -","body":"# Convex Migration Guide\n\nThis project currently uses **Drizzle ORM + Neon Postgres**. This skill guides migration to **Convex** as the backend database.\n\n## Current Stack (What We''re Migrating From)\n\n- **ORM:** Drizzle ORM 0.45.x with `drizzle-kit` for migrations\n- **Database:** Neon Postgres (serverless)\n- **Schema:** `src/db/schema.ts` -- 4 tables with enums, composite primary keys\n- **Client:** `src/db/client.ts` -- Drizzle client with Neon connection\n- **Migrations:** `src/db/migrations/` -- SQL migration files\n\n### Current Tables\n\n| Table | Purpose | Key Fields |\n|-------|---------|------------|\n| `sync_state` | Tracks each sync run | serial PK, sync_type enum, status enum, timestamps |\n| `customer_mapping` | Rubic customerNo -> Tripletex customerId | composite PK (rubic_id, env), hash |\n| `product_mapping` | Rubic productCode -> Tripletex productId | composite PK (rubic_id, env), hash |\n| `invoice_mapping` | Rubic invoiceId -> Tripletex invoiceId | composite PK (rubic_id, env), payment_synced |\n\n### Current Enums\n\n- `sync_type`: `\"customers\" | \"products\" | \"invoices\" | \"payments\"`\n- `sync_status`: `\"running\" | \"success\" | \"failed\"`\n- `tripletex_env`: `\"sandbox\" | \"production\"`\n\n## Convex Equivalents\n\n### Schema Translation\n\nThe current Drizzle schema in `src/db/schema.ts` maps to Convex like this:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { syncType, syncStatus, tripletexEnv } from \"./validators\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n\tsyncState: defineTable({\n\t\tsyncType: syncType,\n\t\ttripletexEnv: tripletexEnv,\n\t\tlastSyncAt: v.optional(v.number()), // epoch ms\n\t\tstatus: syncStatus,\n\t\terrorMessage: v.optional(v.string()),\n\t\trecordsProcessed: v.number(),\n\t\trecordsFailed: v.number(),\n\t\tstartedAt: v.number(), // epoch ms\n\t\tcompletedAt: v.optional(v.number()),\n\t})\n\t\t.index(\"by_type_and_env\", [\"syncType\", \"tripletexEnv\"])\n\t\t.index(\"by_status\", [\"status\"]),\n\n\tcustomerMapping: defineTable({\n\t\trubicCustomerNo: v.string(),\n\t\ttripletexEnv: tripletexEnv,\n\t\ttripletexCustomerId: v.number(),\n\t\tlastSyncedAt: v.number(),\n\t\thash: v.optional(v.string()),\n\t})\n\t\t.index(\"by_rubic_and_env\", [\"rubicCustomerNo\", \"tripletexEnv\"]),\n\n\tproductMapping: defineTable({\n\t\trubicProductCode: v.string(),\n\t\ttripletexEnv: tripletexEnv,\n\t\ttripletexProductId: v.number(),\n\t\tlastSyncedAt: v.number(),\n\t\thash: v.optional(v.string()),\n\t})\n\t\t.index(\"by_rubic_and_env\", [\"rubicProductCode\", \"tripletexEnv\"]),\n\n\tinvoiceMapping: defineTable({\n\t\trubicInvoiceId: v.number(),\n\t\ttripletexEnv: tripletexEnv,\n\t\trubicInvoiceNumber: v.number(),\n\t\ttripletexInvoiceId: v.number(),\n\t\tlastSyncedAt: v.number(),\n\t\tpaymentSynced: v.boolean(),\n\t})\n\t\t.index(\"by_rubic_and_env\", [\"rubicInvoiceId\", \"tripletexEnv\"]),\n});\n```\n\n### Key Translation Rules\n\n| Drizzle / Postgres | Convex |\n|--------------------|--------|\n| `serial(\"id\").primaryKey()` | Auto-generated `_id` (no serial IDs) |\n| `pgEnum(\"name\", [...])` | `v.union(v.literal(\"a\"), v.literal(\"b\"))` |\n| Composite primary key | `.index(\"name\", [\"field1\", \"field2\"])` + unique enforcement in mutations |\n| `timestamp({ withTimezone: true })` | `v.number()` (epoch ms via `Date.now()`) |\n| `varchar(\"col\", { length: N })` | `v.string()` (no length limits in Convex) |\n| `integer(\"col\")` | `v.number()` |\n| `boolean(\"col\")` | `v.boolean()` |\n| `text(\"col\")` | `v.string()` |\n| `.notNull()` | Field is required by default |\n| `.default(value)` | Set in mutation handler, not in schema |\n| `NULL` / nullable | `v.optional(v.string())` |\n\n### Function Patterns\n\nConvex replaces raw SQL / Drizzle queries with typed functions. Extract shared validators into a `convex/validators.ts` file so they can be reused across schema and functions:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/validators.ts\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const syncType = v.union(\n\tv.literal(\"customers\"),\n\tv.literal(\"products\"),\n\tv.literal(\"invoices\"),\n\tv.literal(\"payments\"),\n);\n\nexport const syncStatus = v.union(\n\tv.literal(\"running\"),\n\tv.literal(\"success\"),\n\tv.literal(\"failed\"),\n);\n\nexport const tripletexEnv = v.union(\n\tv.literal(\"sandbox\"),\n\tv.literal(\"production\"),\n);\n```\n\nUse these validators in function args for consistent type safety (not `v.string()`):\n\n**Query (read data):**\n\n```typescript\n// convex/syncState.ts\nimport { query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { syncType, tripletexEnv } from \"./validators\";\n\nexport const getLatest = query({\n\targs: { syncType, tripletexEnv },\n\thandler: async (ctx, args) => {\n\t\treturn await ctx.db\n\t\t\t.query(\"syncState\")\n\t\t\t.withIndex(\"by_type_and_env\", (q) =>\n\t\t\t\tq.eq(\"syncType\", args.syncType).eq(\"tripletexEnv\", args.tripletexEnv),\n\t\t\t)\n\t\t\t.order(\"desc\")\n\t\t\t.first();\n\t},\n});\n```\n\n**Mutation (write data):**\n\n```typescript\n// convex/syncState.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { syncType, tripletexEnv } from \"./validators\";\n\nexport const startSync = mutation({\n\targs: { syncType, tripletexEnv },\n\thandler: async (ctx, args) => {\n\t\treturn await ctx.db.insert(\"syncState\", {\n\t\t\tsyncType: args.syncType,\n\t\t\ttripletexEnv: args.tripletexEnv,\n\t\t\tstatus: \"running\",\n\t\t\trecordsProcessed: 0,\n\t\t\trecordsFailed: 0,\n\t\t\tstartedAt: Date.now(),\n\t\t});\n\t},\n});\n```\n\n**Action (external API calls):**\n\nSync logic that calls Rubic/Tripletex APIs should use actions, since they can call external services:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/sync.ts\nimport { action } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { api } from \"./_generated/api\";\nimport { tripletexEnv } from \"./validators\";\n\nexport const syncCustomers = action({\n\targs: { tripletexEnv },\n\thandler: async (ctx, args) => {\n\t\t// Call external APIs\n\t\tconst customers = await fetchFromRubic();\n\n\t\t// Write to Convex DB via mutations\n\t\tfor (const customer of customers) {\n\t\t\tawait ctx.runMutation(api.customerMapping.upsert, {\n\t\t\t\trubicCustomerNo: customer.customerNo,\n\t\t\t\ttripletexEnv: args.tripletexEnv,\n\t\t\t\t// ...\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t}\n\t},\n});\n```\n\n### Next.js Integration\n\n```typescript\n// In Server Components or Route Handlers\nimport { fetchQuery, fetchMutation } from \"convex/nextjs\";\nimport { api } from \"@/convex/_generated/api\";\n\n// Read\nconst state = await fetchQuery(api.syncState.getLatest, {\n\tsyncType: \"customers\",\n\ttripletexEnv: \"production\",\n});\n\n// Write\nawait fetchMutation(api.syncState.startSync, {\n\tsyncType: \"customers\",\n\ttripletexEnv: \"production\",\n});\n```\n\nRequires `NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL` and `CONVEX_URL` environment variables.\n\n## Migration Steps\n\n1. **Install Convex:** `bun add convex` and `npx convex dev` to initialize\n2. **Create schema:** `convex/schema.ts` (see translation above)\n3. **Create functions:** `convex/*.ts` for queries, mutations, actions\n4. **Migrate data:** Write a one-time script to read from Neon and insert into Convex\n5. **Update API routes:** Replace Drizzle queries with Convex function calls\n6. **Update sync logic:** Move `src/sync/` orchestration to Convex actions\n7. **Remove Drizzle:** Remove `drizzle-orm`, `drizzle-kit`, `@neondatabase/serverless`, and `src/db/`\n\n## Key Differences to Keep in Mind\n\n- **No raw SQL** -- all data access is through Convex functions\n- **No migrations** -- schema changes are applied automatically by `npx convex dev` / `npx convex deploy`\n- **No connection pooling** -- Convex handles connections internally\n- **Composite uniqueness** -- enforce in mutation handlers (query by index, check existence), not at schema level\n- **Timestamps** -- use `Date.now()` (epoch ms) instead of SQL `TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE`\n- **Realtime by default** -- Convex queries are reactive; the dashboard would get live sync status updates for free\n\n## Reference\n\n- [Convex Docs](https://docs.convex.dev/)\n- [Convex Schema Docs](https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas)\n- [Convex Next.js Guide](https://docs.convex.dev/client/nextjs/app-router/)\n- [Convex Functions](https://docs.convex.dev/functions)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:24:20.238Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing seamless database migration from Drizzle ORM to Convex","zh":"适合需要从 Drizzle ORM 到 Convex 无缝迁移数据库的 Full Stack Agents","ja":"Drizzle ORM から Convex へのシームレスなデータベース移行を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Drizzle ORM에서 Convex로 무결점으로 데이터베이스를 마이그레이션해야 하는 풀 스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan una migración de base de datos sin problemas de Drizzle ORM a Convex","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''une migration de base de données transparente de Drizzle ORM à Convex","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine nahtlose Datenbankmigration von Drizzle ORM zu Convex benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de migração de banco de dados sem interrupções do Drizzle ORM para o Convex","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым требуется бесшовная миграция базы данных из Drizzle ORM в Convex","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكاملون الذين يحتاجون إلى هجرة قاعدة البيانات دون انقطاع من Drizzle ORM إلى Convex"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to migrate existing databases to Convex, leveraging Drizzle ORM and Neon Postgres, with support for complex schema migrations and enums, while utilizing Convex as the backend database for enhanced data integration","zh":"赋予代理人利用 Drizzle ORM 和 Neon Postgres 进行现有数据库迁移至 Convex 的能力，支持复杂的模式迁移和枚举，同时利用 Convex 作为后端数据库以增强数据集成","ja":"Drizzle ORM と Neon Postgres を利用して既存のデータベースを Convex に移行し、複雑なスキーマ移行や列挙型をサポートしながら、Convex をバックエンドデータベースとして使用してデータ統合を強化するエージェントの能力を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 Drizzle ORM과 Neon Postgres를 사용하여 기존 데이터베이스를 Convex로 마이그레이션할 수 있도록 하는 능력을 부여하며, 복잡한 스키마 마이그레이션 및 열거형을 지원하며, Convex를 백엔드 데이터베이스로 사용하여 데이터 통합을 강화한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a migrar bases de datos existentes a Convex, aprovechando Drizzle ORM y Neon Postgres, con soporte para migraciones de esquemas complejos y enums, mientras utiliza Convex como base de datos backend para una mejor integración de datos","fr":"Permet aux agents de migrer des bases de données existantes vers Convex, en exploitant Drizzle ORM et Neon Postgres, avec un support pour les migrations de schémas complexes et les énumérations, tout en utilisant Convex comme base de données backend pour une intégration de données améliorée","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bestehende Datenbanken zu Convex zu migrieren, indem Drizzle ORM und Neon Postgres genutzt werden, mit Unterstützung für komplexe Schemamigrationen und Enums, während Convex als Backend-Datenbank für eine verbesserte Datenintegration verwendet wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a migrar bancos de dados existentes para o Convex, utilizando Drizzle ORM e Neon Postgres, com suporte a migrações de esquema complexas e enums, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza o Convex como banco de dados back-end para integração de dados aprimorada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью мигрировать существующие базы данных в Convex, используя Drizzle ORM и Neon Postgres, с поддержкой сложных миграций схем и перечислений, а также использует Convex в качестве базы данных бэкенда для улучшения интеграции данных","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية نقل قواعد البيانات الحالية إلى Convex، مع استخدام Drizzle ORM وNeon Postgres، مع دعم هجرات مخططات معقدة والقوائم، وفي نفس الوقت استخدام Convex كقاعدة بيانات خلفية لتحسين تكامل البيانات"},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating Drizzle ORM databases to Convex","Integrating Convex with Neon Postgres for serverless database operations","Updating schema definitions for Convex compatibility"],"zh":["将 Drizzle ORM 数据库迁移至 Convex","将 Convex 与 Neon Postgres 集成以进行无服务器数据库操作","更新 Convex 兼容的模式定义"],"ja":["Drizzle ORM データベースを Convex に移行する","Convex と Neon Postgres を統合してサーバーレスデータベース操作を実行する","Convex との互換性のあるスキーマ定義を更新する"],"ko":["Drizzle ORM 데이터베이스를 Convex로 마이그레이션","Convex와 Neon Postgres를 통합하여 서버리스 데이터베이스 작동을 수행","Convex와의 호환성을 가진 스키마 정의를 업데이트"],"es":["Migrar bases de datos de Drizzle ORM a Convex","Integrar Convex con Neon Postgres para operaciones de base de datos sin servidor","Actualizar definiciones de esquema para la compatibilidad con Convex"],"fr":["Migrer des bases de données Drizzle ORM vers Convex","Intégrer Convex avec Neon Postgres pour des opérations de base de données sans serveur","Mettre à jour les définitions de schéma pour la compatibilité avec Convex"],"de":["Datenbanken von Drizzle ORM zu Convex migrieren","Convex mit Neon Postgres für serverlose Datenbankoperationen integrieren","Schemadefinitionen für die Kompatibilität mit Convex aktualisieren"],"pt":["Migrar bancos de dados do Drizzle ORM para o Convex","Integrar o Convex com o Neon Postgres para operações de banco de dados sem servidor","Atualizar definições de esquema para compatibilidade com o Convex"],"ru":["Мигрировать базы данных Drizzle ORM в Convex","Интегрировать Convex с Neon Postgres для безсерверных операций базы данных","Обновить определения схемы для совместимости с Convex"],"ar":["نقل قواعد البيانات من Drizzle ORM إلى Convex","دمج Convex مع Neon Postgres لعمليات قاعدة البيانات بدون خادم","تحديث تعريفات المخطط لتوافق Convex"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Drizzle ORM and Neon Postgres setup","Limited to migration from Drizzle ORM 0.45.x","Compatibility issues may arise with complex composite primary keys"],"zh":["需要现有的 Drizzle ORM 和 Neon Postgres 设置","仅限从 Drizzle ORM 0.45.x 迁移","复杂组合主键可能会出现兼容性问题"],"ja":["既存の Drizzle ORM と Neon Postgres の設定が必要","Drizzle ORM 0.45.x からの移行のみ","複合主キーが複雑な場合、互換性の問題が発生する可能性あり"],"ko":["기존의 Drizzle ORM과 Neon Postgres 설정이 필요","Drizzle ORM 0.45.x에서만 마이그레이션","복잡한 복합 주키의 경우 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una configuración existente de Drizzle ORM y Neon Postgres","Limitado a la migración desde Drizzle ORM 0.45.x","Pueden surgir problemas de compatibilidad con claves primarias compuestas complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration existante de Drizzle ORM et Neon Postgres","Limité à la migration depuis Drizzle ORM 0.45.x","Des problèmes de compatibilité peuvent survenir avec des clés primaires composées complexes"],"de":["Erfordert eine bestehende Einrichtung von Drizzle ORM und Neon Postgres","Begrenzt auf Migration von Drizzle ORM 0.45.x","Kompatibilitätsprobleme können bei komplexen zusammengesetzten Primärschlüsseln auftreten"],"pt":["Exige configuração existente do Drizzle ORM e Neon Postgres","Limitado à migração do Drizzle ORM 0.45.x","Pode ocorrer problemas de compatibilidade com chaves primárias compostas complexas"],"ru":["Требует существующей настройки Drizzle ORM и Neon Postgres","Ограничен миграцией из Drizzle ORM 0.45.x","Могут возникнуть проблемы совместимости с сложными составными первичными ключами"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا موجودًا ل Drizzle ORM وNeon Postgres","محدود بنقل البيانات من Drizzle ORM 0.45.x","قد ت出现 مشاكل في التوافق مع المفاتيح الرئيسية المركبة المعقدة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8f01e252a73a493f99ca7ee51a32e85395bee333053fad5e31ad130ff1a14ab1","qualityScore":34}');
