view"},"description":{"zh":"research-review 是一个 AI 驱动的开发工作流管理器，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"research-review は AI ドリブンの開発ワークフロー管理ツールで、開発者の生産性を向上","ko":"research-review 는 개발 워크플로우를 관리하는 AI 기반 도구로 개발자들의 효율성을 높입니다","es":"Research-review es un administrador de flujos de trabajo para desarrollo impulsado por IA, que mejora la productividad y la eficiencia","fr":"Research-review est un gestionnaire de flux de travail pour développement piloté par l''IA, qui améliore la productivité et l''efficacité","de":"Research-review ist ein Workflow-Manager für AI-getriebene Entwicklung, der die Produktivität und Effizienz steigert","pt":"O research-review é um gerenciador de fluxo de trabalho para desenvolvimento baseado em AI, otimizando o processo de desenvolvimento","ru":"Research-review - менеджер рабочего процесса для разработки на основе ИИ, оптимизирующий процесс разработки","ar":"research-review هو مدير تدفق العمل لتنمية مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، يُحسن من عملية التطوير","en":"Workflow manager for AI driven development"},"definition":{"en":"Workflow manager for AI driven development"},"features":{"zh":["AI 驱动的工作流管理","自动化的代码审查","实时的开发监控","智能的开发建议","集成的开发工具"],"ja":["AI ドリブンのワークフロー管理","自動化されたコードレビュー","リアルタイムの開発監視","インテリジェントな開発提案","統合された開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 기반의 워크플로우 관리","자동화된 코드 리뷰","실시간 개발 모니터링","지능형 개발 제안","통합된 개발 도구"],"es":["Administración de flujos de trabajo personalizados","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Node.js","Automatización de tareas repetitivas","Análisis de datos y visualización","Colaboración en tiempo real"],"fr":["Gestion de flux de travail personnalisés","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que React et Node.js","Automatisation de tâches répétitives","Analyse de données et visualisation","Collaboration en temps réel"],"de":["Verwaltung von benutzerdefinierten Workflows","Integration mit Entwicklertools wie React und Node.js","Automatisierung von wiederkehrenden Aufgaben","Datenanalyse und Visualisierung","Echtzeit-Kollaboration"],"pt":["Otimização do processo de desenvolvimento","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento","Análise de desempenho e relatórios","Segurança e controle de acesso"],"ru":["Оптимизация процесса разработки","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки","Анализ производительности и отчеты","Безопасность и контроль доступа"],"ar":["تحسين عملية التطوير","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشائعة","دعم بيئات متعددة للتطوير","تحليل الأداء والتقرير","الأمان وسيطرة الوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 工具","research-review 使用指南","开发工作流管理","AI 驱动的开发","自动化代码审查","research-review 安装","research-review 教程"],"ja":["AI エージェント","research-review の使い方","開発ワークフロー管理","AI ドリブンの開発","自動化されたコードレビュー","research-review のインストール","research-review チュートリアル"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","research-review 사용법","개발 워크플로우 관리","AI 기반의 개발","자동화된 코드 리뷰","research-review 설치","research-review 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo","cómo usar research-review","qué es un administrador de flujos de trabajo","research-review vs Jira","instalación de research-review","guía de configuración de research-review","desarrollo de software con IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développement","comment utiliser research-review","qu''est-ce qu''un gestionnaire de flux de travail","research-review vs Jira","installation de research-review","guide de configuration de research-review","développement de logiciels avec l''IA"],"de":["AI-Tools für Entwicklung","wie man research-review verwendet","was ist ein Workflow-Manager","research-review vs Jira","Installation von research-review","Einrichtungsanleitung für research-review","Software-Entwicklung mit KI"],"pt":["ferramentas de ai","desenvolvimento baseado em ai","gerenciador de fluxo de trabalho","otimização de processo","integração com react","integração com python","guia de instalação do research-review","configuração do research-review"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","разработка на основе ИИ","менеджер рабочего процесса","оптимизация процесса","интеграция с react","интеграция с python","руководство по установке research-review","настройка research-review"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنمية مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","مدير تدفق العمل","تحسين العملية","التكامل مع رياكت","التكامل مع بايثون","دليل تثبيت research-review","إعدادات research-review"]}},"owner":"charly-vibes","repo":"wai","repoPath":"charly-vibes/wai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T00:32:08Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research-review","description":"Iterative review of research documents using Rule of 5","bodyPreview":"# Iterative Research Review (Rule of 5)\n\nPerform thorough research document review using the Rule of 5 - iterative refinement until convergence.\n\n## Setup\n\n**If research document path provided:** Read the document completely\n\n**If no path:** Ask for the research document path or list available research documents\n\n## Process\n\nPerform 5 passes, each focusing on different aspects. After each pass (starting with pass 2), check for convergence.\n\n### PASS 1 - Accuracy & Sources\n\n**Focus on:**\n- Claims","body":"# Iterative Research Review (Rule of 5)\n\nPerform thorough research document review using the Rule of 5 - iterative refinement until convergence.\n\n## Setup\n\n**If research document path provided:** Read the document completely\n\n**If no path:** Ask for the research document path or list available research documents\n\n## Process\n\nPerform 5 passes, each focusing on different aspects. After each pass (starting with pass 2), check for convergence.\n\n### PASS 1 - Accuracy & Sources\n\n**Focus on:**\n- Claims backed by evidence\n- Source credibility and recency\n- Correct interpretation of sources\n- Factual accuracy of technical details\n- Version/date relevance (is information outdated?)\n- Code references are correct (file:line exist and match claim)\n\n**Output format:**\n```\nPASS 1: Accuracy & Sources\n\nIssues Found:\n\n[ACC-001] [CRITICAL|HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW] - Section/Paragraph\nDescription: [What''s inaccurate or unsourced]\nEvidence: [Why this is problematic]\nRecommendation: [How to fix with specific guidance]\n\n[ACC-002] ...\n```\n\n**What to look for:**\n- \"This works by...\" without code reference\n- Claims about codebase without verification\n- Outdated information (library versions, deprecated APIs)\n- Misinterpretation of source code\n- Assumptions presented as facts\n\n### PASS 2 - Completeness & Scope\n\n**Focus on:**\n- Missing important topics or considerations\n- Unanswered questions that should be addressed\n- Gaps in the analysis\n- Scope creep (irrelevant tangents)\n- Depth appropriate for the topic\n- All research questions answered\n\n**Prefix:** COMP-001, COMP-002, etc.\n\n**What to look for:**\n- Research question asked but not answered\n- Obvious related topics not explored\n- Shallow treatment of complex topics\n- Too much detail on tangential topics\n- \"Further research needed\" without followthrough\n\n### PASS 3 - Clarity & Structure\n\n**Focus on:**\n- Logical flow and organization\n- Clear definitions of terms\n- Appropriate headings and sections\n- Readability for target audience\n- Jargon explained or avoided\n- Consistent terminology\n\n**Prefix:** CLAR-001, CLAR-002, etc.\n\n**What to look for:**\n- Jumping between topics without transitions\n- Technical terms used without definition\n- Conclusions before supporting evidence\n- Redundant sections\n- Confusing or ambiguous language\n\n### PASS 4 - Actionability & Conclusions\n\n**Focus on:**\n- Clear takeaways and recommendations\n- Conclusions supported by the research\n- Practical applicability to the project\n- Trade-offs clearly articulated\n- Next steps identified\n- Decision-making guidance provided\n\n**Prefix:** ACT-001, ACT-002, etc.\n\n**What to look for:**\n- Research without recommendations\n- Conclusions that don''t follow from findings\n- \"Interesting but...\" without actionable insight\n- Missing implementation guidance\n- No clear \"what should we do?\"\n\n### PASS 5 - Integration & Context\n\n**Focus on:**\n- Alignment with existing research\n- Connections to specs and requirements\n- Relevance to current project goals\n- Contradictions with established decisions\n- Impact on existing plans\n- References to related work\n\n**Prefix:** INT-001, INT-002, etc.\n\n**What to look for:**\n- Contradicts previous research without acknowledgment\n- Ignores existing patterns in codebase\n- Doesn''t reference related specs or docs\n- Recommendations conflict with project direction\n- Missing cross-references\n\n## Convergence Check\n\nAfter each pass (starting with pass 2), report:\n\n```\nConvergence Check After Pass [N]:\n\n1. New CRITICAL issues: [count]\n2. Total new issues this pass: [count]\n3. Total new issues previous pass: [count]\n4. Estimated false positive rate: [percentage]\n\nStatus: [CONVERGED | ITERATE | NEEDS_HUMAN]\n```\n\n**Convergence criteria:**\n- **CONVERGED**: No new CRITICAL, <10% new issues vs previous pass, <20% false positives\n- **ITERATE**: Continue to next pass\n- **NEEDS_HUMAN**: Found blocking issues requiring human judgment\n\n**If CONVERGED before Pass 5:** Stop and report final findings.\n\n## Final Report\n\nAfter convergence or completing all passes:\n\n```\n## Research Review Final Report\n\n**Research:** [path/to/research.md]\n\n### Summary\n\nTotal Issues by Severity:\n- CRITICAL: [count] - Must fix before using research\n- HIGH: [count] - Should fix before using research\n- MEDIUM: [count] - Consider addressing\n- LOW: [count] - Nice to have\n\nConvergence: Pass [N]\n\n### Top 3 Most Critical Findings\n\n1. [ACC-001] [Description] - Section [N]\n   Impact: [Why this matters]\n   Fix: [What to do]\n\n2. [COMP-003] [Description] - Section [N]\n   Impact: [Why this matters]\n   Fix: [What to do]\n\n3. [ACT-002] [Description] - Conclusions\n   Impact: [Why this matters]\n   Fix: [What to do]\n\n### Recommended Revisions\n\n1. [Action 1 - specific and actionable]\n2. [Action 2 - specific and actionable]\n3. [Action 3 - specific and actionable]\n\n### Verdict\n\n[READY | NEEDS_REVISION | NEEDS_MORE_RESEARCH]\n\n**Rationale:** [1-2 sentences explaining the verdict]\n\n### Research Quality Assessment\n\n- **Accuracy**: [Excellent|Good|Fair|Poor] - [brief comment]\n- **Completeness**: [Excellent|Good|Fair|Poor] - [brief comment]\n- **Actionability**: [Excellent|Good|Fair|Poor] - [brief comment]\n- **Clarity**: [Excellent|Good|Fair|Poor] - [brief comment]\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n1. **Be specific** - Reference sections/paragraphs, provide file:line for code claims\n2. **Verify claims** - Actually check code references and factual statements\n3. **Validate actionability** - Research should drive decisions, not just inform\n4. **Prioritize correctly**:\n   - CRITICAL: Factually wrong or misleading\n   - HIGH: Significant gaps or unclear conclusions\n   - MEDIUM: Could be clearer or more complete\n   - LOW: Minor improvements\n5. **If converged before pass 5** - Stop and report, don''t continue needlessly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:50:21.543Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Research Agents requiring iterative refinement and convergence analysis.","zh":"适用于需要迭代改进和收敛分析的高级研究代理。","ja":"反復的な改良と収束分析を必要とする高度な研究エージェントに適しています。","ko":"반복적인 개선과 수렴 분석이 필요한 고급 연구 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de investigación avanzada que requieren refinamiento y análisis de convergencia iterativos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche avancée nécessitant un raffinement et une analyse de convergence itératifs.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche Forschungsagenten, die iteratives Verfeinern und Konvergenzanalyse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pesquisa Avançada que requerem refinamento iterativo e análise de convergência.","ru":"Идеально для Продвинутых Исследовательских Агентов, требующих итеративного уточнения и анализа сходимости.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثية المتقدمة الذين يتطلبون تعديل متكرر وتحليل التقارب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough research document reviews using the Rule of 5, ensuring accuracy and source validation through iterative passes, and supports convergence checks after each pass.","zh":"使代理能够使用5个规则进行彻底的研究文档审查，通过反复传递确保准确性和来源验证，并在每次传递后支持收敛检查。","ja":"エージェントが5つのルールを使用して徹底的な研究文書のレビューを実行できるようにし、反復的なパスを通じて正確性とソースの検証を保証し、各パスの後に収束チェックをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 5가지 규칙을 사용하여 철저한 연구 문서 검토를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 반복적인 전달을 통해 정확성과 출처 검증을 보장하며, 각 전달 후 수렴 확인을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones exhaustivas de documentos de investigación utilizando la Regla de 5, asegurando la precisión y la validación de fuentes a través de pasadas iterativas, y admite controles de convergencia después de cada pasada.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des examens approfondis de documents de recherche en utilisant la Règle de 5, garantissant l''exactitude et la validation des sources par des passes itératives, et prend en charge les vérifications de convergence après chaque passe.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gründliche Forschungsdokument-Prüfungen unter Verwendung der Regel der 5 durchzuführen, um Genauigkeit und Quellenvalidierung durch iterative Durchläufe sicherzustellen und unterstützt Konvergenzprüfungen nach jedem Durchlauf.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar revisões minuciosas de documentos de pesquisa usando a Regra dos 5, garantindo a precisão e a validação da fonte por meio de passos iterativos, e suporta verificações de convergência após cada passo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные обзоры исследовательских документов с помощью Правила 5, обеспечивая точность и проверку источников посредством итерационных проходов, и поддерживает проверки сходимости после каждого прохода.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إجراء مراجعات وثائق بحث شاملة باستخدام قاعدة الخمس، ضامنًا الدقة و التحقق من المصدر من خلال المرور المتكرر، ودعم فحوصات التقارب بعد كل مرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating research document analysis","Validating claims and sources in research papers","Refining research findings through iterative review"],"zh":["自动化研究文档分析","验证研究论文中的说法和来源","通过反复审查来改进研究发现"],"ja":["研究文書の分析の自動化","研究論文の中の主張とソースの検証","反復的なレビューを通じて研究結果の改善"],"ko":["연구 문서 분석 자동화","연구 논문中的 주장 및 출처 검증","반복적인 검토를 통해 연구 결과 개선"],"es":["Automatización del análisis de documentos de investigación","Validación de afirmaciones y fuentes en artículos de investigación","Perfeccionamiento de los hallazgos de investigación a través de revisiones iterativas"],"fr":["Automation de l''analyse de documents de recherche","Validation des allégations et des sources dans les articles de recherche","Affinement des résultats de recherche grâce à des examens itératifs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Analyse von Forschungsdokumenten","Validierung von Behauptungen und Quellen in Forschungsartikeln","Verfeinerung der Forschungsergebnisse durch iterative Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar a análise de documentos de pesquisa","Validar alegações e fontes em artigos de pesquisa","Aperfeiçoar os resultados de pesquisa por meio de revisão iterativa"],"ru":["Автоматизация анализа исследовательских документов","Проверка утверждений и источников в исследовательских работах","Уточнение результатов исследования посредством итерационного обзора"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحليل وثائق البحث","تحقق المطالبات والمصادر في أوراق البحث","تحسين النتائج البحثية من خلال المراجعة المتكررة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to research documents or paths","Limited to text-based research documents"],"zh":["需要访问研究文档或路径","仅限于基于文本的研究文档"],"ja":["研究文書またはパスへのアクセスが必要","テキストベースの研究文書のみに限定される"],"ko":["연구 문서 또는 경로에 대한 액세스가 필요","텍스트 기반 연구 문서에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a documentos de investigación o rutas","Limitado a documentos de investigación basados en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des documents de recherche ou des chemins","Limité aux documents de recherche basés sur du texte"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Forschungsdokumente oder Pfade","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Forschungsdokumente"],"pt":["Requer acesso a documentos de pesquisa ou caminhos","Limitado a documentos de pesquisa baseados em texto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к исследовательским документам или путям","Ограничен исследовательскими документами в текстовом формате"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق البحث أو المسارات","محدود بالوثائق البحثية القائمة على النص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4ee318840ca01f410a80764956493d6560948fbbb85bf2c95427696b132b5bb1","qualityScore":34}');
