-clean، تطبيق دردشة مفتوح ا...","en":"spring-clean"},"description":{"zh":"spring-clean是一个免费、开源的聊天应用，用于社区建设，具有高可定制性和扩展性。基于Node.js和React构建","ja":"spring-cleanはコミュニティ向けの無料・オープンソースチャットアプリです。高可定制性と拡張性を備えています。Node.jsとReactで構築されています","ko":"spring-clean은 커뮤니티를 위한 무료 오픈소스 채팅 애플리케이션으로 높은 사용자 정의 및 확장성을 제공합니다. Node.js와 React로 구축되었습니다","es":"spring-clean es una app de chat de código abierto para comunidades, diseñada para ser gratuita y accesible","fr":"spring-clean est une application de chat open source pour les communautés, conçue pour être gratuite et accessible","de":"spring-clean ist eine kostenlose, Open-Source-Chat-App für Communities, die für die kostenlose Nutzung konzipiert wurde","pt":"O spring-clean é uma ferramenta de IA open-source para comunidades, oferecendo um app de chat gratuito e personalizável","ru":"Spring-clean - это бесплатный ИИ Агент с открытым исходным кодом для сообществ, предлагающий бесплатное приложение чата","ar":"spring-clean هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي مفتوحة المصدر للمجتمعات، يقدم تطبيق دردشة مجاني ويمكن تخصيصه","en":"A free, open-source chat app for communities."},"definition":{"en":"A free, open-source chat app for communities."},"features":{"zh":["高可定制性","支持多种聊天协议","基于Node.js和React构建","支持插件扩展","免费开源"],"ja":["高可定制性","複数のチャットプロトコルをサポート","Node.jsとReactで構築","プラグイン拡張をサポート","無料・オープンソース"],"ko":["높은 사용자 정의","여러 채팅 프로토콜 지원","Node.js와 React로 구축","플러그인 확장 지원","무료 오픈소스"],"es":["Código abierto y gratuito","Diseñado para comunidades","Fácil de usar y personalizar","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Seguridad y privacidad garantizadas"],"fr":["Code open source et gratuit","Conçu pour les communautés","Facile à utiliser et personnaliser","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Sécurité et confidentialité garanties"],"de":["Kostenloser Open-Source-Code","Für Communities konzipiert","Einfach zu bedienen und anzupassen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Sicherheit und Datenschutz garantiert"],"pt":["App de chat personalizável","Código aberto e gratuito","Recursos de comunidade","Integração com outras ferramentas","Customização avançada"],"ru":["Настраиваемое приложение чата","Бесплатный и открытое исходный код","Возможности сообщества","Интеграция с другими инструментами","Расширенная настройка"],"ar":["تطبيق دردشة قابل للتخصيص","مفتوح المصدر ومجاني","ميزات المجتمع","التكامل مع أدوات أخرى","التخصيص المتقدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用spring-clean","spring-clean教程","spring-clean替代品","spring-clean和其他聊天应用的比较","spring-clean安装","spring-clean设置指南","AI聊天应用","社区建设工具"],"ja":["spring-cleanの使い方","spring-cleanチュートリアル","spring-cleanの代替","spring-cleanと他のチャットアプリの比較","spring-cleanのインストール","spring-cleanの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","コミュニティ構築ツール"],"ko":["spring-clean 사용법","spring-clean 튜토리얼","spring-clean 대체품","spring-clean과 다른 채팅 애플리케이션 비교","spring-clean 설치","spring-clean 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","커뮤니티 구축 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI","app de chat abierto","cómo usar spring-clean","alternativas a spring-clean","spring-clean vs otras herramientas","instalación de spring-clean","guía de configuración de spring-clean"],"fr":["outils IA","application de chat open source","comment utiliser spring-clean","alternatives à spring-clean","spring-clean vs autres outils","installation de spring-clean","guide de configuration de spring-clean"],"de":["KI-Tools","kostenlose Chat-App","wie man spring-clean verwendet","Alternativen zu spring-clean","spring-clean im Vergleich zu anderen Tools","Installation von spring-clean","Einrichtungsanleitung für spring-clean"],"pt":["como usar spring-clean","o que é spring-clean","ferramentas de IA para comunidades","spring-clean vs outras ferramentas","instalar spring-clean","guia de configuração do spring-clean","alternativas para spring-clean"],"ru":["как использовать spring-clean","что такое spring-clean","ИИ Агенты для сообществ","spring-clean vs другие инструменты","установить spring-clean","руководство по настройке spring-clean","альтернативы spring-clean"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام spring-clean","ما هو spring-clean","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمجتمعات","spring-clean مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت spring-clean","دليل إعداد spring-clean","بديلات spring-clean"]}},"owner":"DaccordProject","repo":"daccord","repoPath":"DaccordProject/daccord","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T23:00:10Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"spring-clean","description":"Run tests, fix lint errors, break down large files, and clean up debug artifacts","bodyPreview":"You are performing a \"spring clean\" of the daccord codebase. Work through each phase in order. Fix issues as you go rather than just reporting them.\n\n## Phase 1: Run Tests\n\nRun the unit tests (no server needed):\n\n```\n./test.sh unit\n```\n\nIf any tests fail:\n1. Read the failing test file and the source file it tests\n2. Determine whether the bug is in the source code or the test\n3. Fix the root cause (prefer fixing source code bugs; only fix tests if the test expectation is wrong)\n4. Re-run `./test.","body":"You are performing a \"spring clean\" of the daccord codebase. Work through each phase in order. Fix issues as you go rather than just reporting them.\n\n## Phase 1: Run Tests\n\nRun the unit tests (no server needed):\n\n```\n./test.sh unit\n```\n\nIf any tests fail:\n1. Read the failing test file and the source file it tests\n2. Determine whether the bug is in the source code or the test\n3. Fix the root cause (prefer fixing source code bugs; only fix tests if the test expectation is wrong)\n4. Re-run `./test.sh unit` to confirm the fix\n\nDo NOT skip failing tests or mark them as expected failures. Every test should pass.\n\n## Phase 2: Run Linter\n\nRun the project linter:\n\n```\nbash lint.sh\n```\n\nReview the output for:\n- **Naming convention violations** -- Rename files/folders to match the project convention (snake_case)\n- **gdlint errors** -- Fix GDScript static analysis issues (unused variables, naming, trailing whitespace, line length, etc.)\n- **Complexity warnings** -- Note any high-complexity functions for Phase 3\n\nFix all lint issues directly in the source files. Re-run `bash lint.sh` to confirm all issues are resolved.\n\n## Phase 3: Break Down Large Files\n\nFind all `.gd` files over 800 lines:\n\n```\nwc -l scripts/**/*.gd scenes/**/*.gd\n```\n\nFor each file over 800 lines:\n1. Read the file and identify logical groupings of functionality\n2. Extract cohesive groups into new files (helper classes, sub-components, or utility scripts)\n3. Update all references to the extracted code\n4. Keep the public API of the original file intact -- other files should not need changes beyond imports\n\nCommon extraction patterns:\n- Large `match` or `if/elif` blocks handling different cases -> separate handler functions or scripts\n- Utility/helper methods that don''t use instance state -> standalone utility script\n- Signal handler methods that form a logical group -> sub-component script\n- Data transformation / parsing logic -> dedicated parser script\n\nDo NOT extract code if it would create circular dependencies or files under ~50 lines.\n\n## Phase 4: Clean Up Debug Logs and Build Artifacts\n\n### Debug logs\nSearch for debug print statements that should not be in production code:\n\n- `print(` statements that are clearly debug/temporary (e.g., \"DEBUG\", \"TODO\", \"FIXME\", \"test\", variable dumps)\n- `print_debug(` calls\n- Commented-out `print(` statements\n\nRemove them. Keep `print(` statements that are intentional logging (error messages, warnings, startup info).\n\nUse your judgement: a `print(\"Error: ...\")` or `push_error(...)` is intentional. A `print(some_variable)` or `print(\"HERE\")` is debug noise.\n\n### Build artifacts\nSearch for and remove:\n- `.import` files for assets that no longer exist\n- Orphaned `.uid` files with no corresponding `.gd` or `.tscn`\n- Temporary files (`*.tmp`, `*.bak`, `*.orig`)\n- Empty directories under `scenes/` and `scripts/`\n\nDo NOT delete:\n- `.godot/` directory contents (managed by Godot)\n- `addons/` directory contents\n- Any file tracked by git that isn''t clearly an artifact\n\n## Phase 5: Verify\n\nAfter all phases:\n1. Run `./test.sh unit` one final time to confirm nothing is broken\n2. Run `bash lint.sh` one final time to confirm it''s clean\n3. Summarize what was done:\n   - Number of test failures fixed\n   - Number of lint issues fixed\n   - Files that were broken down (with before/after line counts)\n   - Debug logs and artifacts removed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:52:09.919Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Refactoring Agents needing advanced issue resolution capabilities in open-source codebases","zh":"非常适合需要在开源代码库中进行高级问题解决的代码重构代理","ja":"コードリファクタリングエージェントがオープンソースコードベースで高度な問題解決機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"오픈 소스 코드베이스에서 고급 문제 해결 기능이 필요한 코드 리팩토링 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Refactorización de Código que necesitan capacidades de resolución de problemas avanzadas en bases de código de código abierto","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Réfactoring de Code nécessitant des capacités de résolution de problèmes avancées dans les bases de code open-source","de":"Perfekt für Code-Refactoring-Agents, die erweiterte Problemlösungsfähigkeiten in Open-Source-Codebasen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Refatoração de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de resolução de problemas em repositórios de código de fonte aberta","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов рефакторинга кода, требующих продвинутых возможностей разрешения проблем в открытом исходном коде","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء لإعادة هيكلة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لحل المشكلات في قواعد الشفرة المفتوحة المصدر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug and fix source code issues using unit tests, providing comprehensive code analysis and validation through shell scripts like ''./test.sh unit''","zh":"赋予代理调试和修复源代码问题的能力，通过单元测试提供全面代码分析和验证，通过类似 ''./test.sh unit'' 的 shell 脚本","ja":"エージェントがソースコードの問題をデバッグして修正する機能を提供し、シェルスクリプト（例： ''./test.sh unit''）を使用して単体テストによる包括的なコード分析と検証を行う","ko":"에이전트가 소스 코드의 문제를 디버깅하고 수정할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, ''./test.sh unit''과 같은 셸 스크립트를 통해 단위 테스트를 사용한 포괄적인 코드 분석 및 검증을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar y corregir problemas de código fuente utilizando pruebas unitarias, proporcionando un análisis y validación de código integral a través de scripts de shell como ''./test.sh unit''","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer et de corriger les problèmes de code source en utilisant des tests unitaires, fournissant une analyse et une validation de code complètes via des scripts shell tels que ''./test.sh unit''","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Quellcodeprobleme mithilfe von Einheitstests zu debuggen und zu beheben, wodurch eine umfassende Codeanalyse und -validierung durch Shell-Skripte wie ''./test.sh unit'' bereitgestellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurar e corrigir problemas de código-fonte usando testes unitários, fornecendo análise e validação de código abrangentes por meio de scripts de shell como ''./test.sh unit''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отлаживать и исправлять проблемы с исходным кодом с помощью модульных тестов, обеспечивая всесторонний анализ и проверку кода через скрипты оболочки, такие как ''./test.sh unit''","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصحيح الأخطاء وإصلاح مشاكل الشفرة المصدرية باستخدام الاختبارات الوحدوية، وتقديم تحليل وتحقق شاملي للشفرة من خلال سكريبتات الجلج like ''./test.sh unit''"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging failing unit tests","Fixing source code bugs","Validating test expectations"],"zh":["调试失败的单元测试","修复源代码错误","验证测试期望"],"ja":["失敗している単体テストのデバッグ","ソースコードのバグを修正","テストの期待を検証"],"ko":["실패한 단위 테스트 디버깅","소스 코드 버그 수정","테스트 예상 값 검증"],"es":["Depuración de pruebas unitarias con errores","Corrección de errores de código fuente","Validación de expectativas de pruebas"],"fr":["Débogage des tests unitaires en échec","Correction des bogues de code source","Validation des attentes de test"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei fehlschlagenden Einheitstests","Korrektur von Quellcodefehlern","Validierung von Testerwartungen"],"pt":["Depuração de testes unitários com falha","Correção de bugs de código-fonte","Validação de expectativas de teste"],"ru":["Отладка неудачных модульных тестов","Исправление ошибок исходного кода","Проверка ожиданий тестирования"],"ar":["تصحيح اختبار الوحدات الفاشلة","إصلاح أخطاء الشفرة المصدرية","تحقق التوقعات الاختبارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the codebase","Limited to unit tests","Needs shell script execution capabilities"],"zh":["需要访问代码库","仅限于单元测试","需要 shell 脚本执行能力"],"ja":["コードベースへのアクセスが必要","単体テストに限定","シェルスクリプトの実行機能が必要"],"ko":["코드베이스에 접근할 수 있어야 함","단위 테스트에 한정","셸 스크립트 실행 기능이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código","Limitado a pruebas unitarias","Requiere capacidades de ejecución de scripts de shell"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code","Limité aux tests unitaires","Nécessite des capacités d''exécution de scripts shell"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis","Begrenzt auf Einheitstests","Benötigt Shell-Skript-Ausführungsfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório de código","Limitado a testes unitários","Necessita de capacidades de execução de scripts de shell"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию кода","Ограничен модульными тестами","Требует возможности выполнения скриптов оболочки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة","محدود بالاختبارات الوحدوية","يحتاج إلى قدرات تنفيذ سكريبتات الجلج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"da4c5dc2feaae78fa35ba28d0dd6c46dc318a54de847ac0886210abe542297f4","qualityScore":34}');
