","高性能のデータ処理","Parquet、ORC、XLS、XLSX、XMLなど形式をサポート"],"ko":["BSON, JSON, NDJSON 등 多种 데이터 형식을 지원","데이터 파일을 읽고 작성하고 변환","파이썬 라이브러리, 쉽게 통합 가능","높은 성능의 데이터 처리","Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML 등 형식을 지원"],"es":["Lectura y escritura de archivos de datos en formatos como BSON, JSON y más","Conversión de archivos de datos entre diferentes formatos","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de archivos de datos","Fácil integración con proyectos Python","Documentación detallada y soporte técnico"],"fr":["Lecture et écriture de fichiers de données dans des formats tels que BSON, JSON et plus","Conversion de fichiers de données entre différents formats","Compatibilité avec de multiples formats de fichiers de données","Intégration facile avec des projets Python","Documentation détaillée et support technique"],"de":["Lesen und Schreiben von Datendateien in Formaten wie BSON, JSON und mehr","Konvertierung von Datendateien zwischen verschiedenen Formaten","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Datendateiformaten","Einfache Integration mit Python-Projekten","Detaillierte Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Leitura e escrita de dados em vários formatos","Suporte a formatos BSON, JSON, NDJSON e mais","Fácil integração com outros projetos Python","Suporte a leitura e escrita de dados em grandes volumes","Fácil uso e configuração"],"ru":["Чтение и запись данных в различных форматах","Поддержка форматов BSON, JSON, NDJSON и больше","Легкая интеграция с другими проектами Python","Поддержка чтения и записи данных в больших объемах","Легкое использование и конфигурация"],"ar":["قراءة وكتابة بيانات في العديد من الصياغات","دعم صياغات BSON, JSON, NDJSON و更多","تسهيل تكامل مع مشاريع Python الأخرى","دعم قراءة وكتابة بيانات في حجم كبير","تسهيل استخدام وضبط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["testing-patterns","Python数据文件处理","AI工具","数据文件转换","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Parquet","ORC","XLS","XLSX","XML","如何使用testing-patterns","testing-patterns安装"],"ja":["testing-patterns","Pythonデータファイル処理","AIエージェント","データファイル変換","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Parquet","ORC","XLS","XLSX","XML","testing-patternsの使い方","testing-patternsのインストール"],"ko":["testing-patterns","파이썬 데이터 파일 처리","AI 에이전트","데이터 파일 변환","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Parquet","ORC","XLS","XLSX","XML","testing-patterns 사용법","testing-patterns 설치"],"es":["herramientas de AI para Python","cómo usar testing-patterns","qué es testing-patterns","alternativas a testing-patterns","testing-patterns vs pandas","instalación de testing-patterns","guía de configuración de testing-patterns"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour Python","comment utiliser testing-patterns","qu''est-ce que testing-patterns","alternatives à testing-patterns","testing-patterns vs pandas","installation de testing-patterns","guide de configuration de testing-patterns"],"de":["KI-Tools für Python","wie man testing-patterns verwendet","was ist testing-patterns","alternativen zu testing-patterns","testing-patterns vs pandas","installation von testing-patterns","konfigurationsanleitung für testing-patterns"],"pt":["Testing-Patterns","Biblioteca Python","Leitura e escrita de dados","Formatos de dados","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Python para leitura e escrita de dados","Como usar Testing-Patterns","Alternativas a Testing-Patterns"],"ru":["Testing-Patterns","Библиотека Python","Чтение и запись данных","Форматы данных","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Python для чтения и записи данных","Как использовать Testing-Patterns","Альтернативы к Testing-Patterns"],"ar":["Testing-Patterns","مكتبة Python","قراءة وكتابة بيانات","صياغات بيانات","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Python لقراءة وكتابة بيانات","كيف استخدام Testing-Patterns","بديلات ل Testing-Patterns"]}},"owner":"datenoio","repo":"iterabledata","repoPath":"datenoio/iterabledata","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T01:51:08.565Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-patterns","description":"Testing conventions, patterns, and best practices for IterableData. Use when writing tests, debugging test failures, or establishing test coverage.","bodyPreview":"# Testing Patterns\r\n\r\n## Test Structure\r\n\r\n### File Naming\r\n\r\n- Test files: `test_*.py` in `tests/` directory\r\n- One test file per format/feature: `test_csv.py`, `test_parquet.py`\r\n- Test classes: `Test*` (e.g., `TestCSV`, `TestParquet`)\r\n- Test functions: `test_*` (e.g., `test_read`, `test_write`)\r\n\r\n### Running Tests\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# All tests\r\npytest --verbose\r\n\r\n# Specific test file\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py -v\r\n\r\n# Specific test function\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py::TestCSV::test_read -v\r\n\r\n# Pa","body":"# Testing Patterns\r\n\r\n## Test Structure\r\n\r\n### File Naming\r\n\r\n- Test files: `test_*.py` in `tests/` directory\r\n- One test file per format/feature: `test_csv.py`, `test_parquet.py`\r\n- Test classes: `Test*` (e.g., `TestCSV`, `TestParquet`)\r\n- Test functions: `test_*` (e.g., `test_read`, `test_write`)\r\n\r\n### Running Tests\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# All tests\r\npytest --verbose\r\n\r\n# Specific test file\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py -v\r\n\r\n# Specific test function\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py::TestCSV::test_read -v\r\n\r\n# Parallel execution\r\npytest -n auto\r\n\r\n# With coverage\r\npytest --cov=iterable --cov-report=html\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Patterns\r\n\r\n### Basic Read Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_read(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''testdata/test.csv'') as source:\r\n        rows = list(source)\r\n        assert len(rows) > 0\r\n        assert isinstance(rows[0], dict)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Basic Write Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_write(self, tmp_path):\r\n    output = tmp_path / ''output.csv''\r\n    data = [{''col1'': ''val1'', ''col2'': ''val2''}]\r\n    \r\n    with open_iterable(output, ''w'') as dest:\r\n        dest.write_bulk(data)\r\n    \r\n    # Verify written data\r\n    with open_iterable(output) as source:\r\n        rows = list(source)\r\n        assert rows == data\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Compression Tests\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_gzip_compression(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''testdata/test.csv.gz'') as source:\r\n        rows = list(source)\r\n        assert len(rows) > 0\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Bulk Operations Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_read_bulk(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''testdata/test.csv'') as source:\r\n        chunks = list(source.read_bulk(size=100))\r\n        assert len(chunks) > 0\r\n        assert all(isinstance(chunk, list) for chunk in chunks)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Edge Cases\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_empty_file(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''testdata/empty.csv'') as source:\r\n        rows = list(source)\r\n        assert rows == []\r\n\r\ndef test_malformed_data(self):\r\n    with pytest.raises(ValueError):\r\n        with open_iterable(''testdata/malformed.csv'') as source:\r\n            list(source)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Missing Dependencies\r\n\r\n```python\r\n@pytest.mark.skipif(\r\n    not HAS_OPTIONAL_DEPENDENCY,\r\n    reason=\"Optional dependency not installed\"\r\n)\r\ndef test_optional_format(self):\r\n    # Test format that requires optional dependency\r\n    pass\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Data\r\n\r\n- Store test files in `testdata/` directory\r\n- Use descriptive names: `test_simple.csv`, `test_nested.json`\r\n- Include edge cases: empty files, malformed data\r\n- Test with various encodings for text formats\r\n- Test with compression: `.gz`, `.bz2`, `.zst`, etc.\r\n\r\n## Test Coverage\r\n\r\n### Required Coverage\r\n\r\n- All public methods\r\n- Error handling paths\r\n- Edge cases (empty files, malformed data)\r\n- Compression variants\r\n- Encoding variants (for text formats)\r\n\r\n### Coverage Report\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npytest --cov=iterable --cov-report=html\r\n# Opens htmlcov/index.html\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Organization\r\n\r\n### Class-Based Tests\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass TestCSV:\r\n    def test_read(self):\r\n        pass\r\n    \r\n    def test_write(self):\r\n        pass\r\n    \r\n    def test_read_bulk(self):\r\n        pass\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Fixtures\r\n\r\nUse pytest fixtures for common setup:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n@pytest.fixture\r\ndef sample_data():\r\n    return [{''col1'': ''val1'', ''col2'': ''val2''}]\r\n\r\ndef test_write_with_fixture(sample_data, tmp_path):\r\n    output = tmp_path / ''output.csv''\r\n    with open_iterable(output, ''w'') as dest:\r\n        dest.write_bulk(sample_data)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Python Version Support\r\n\r\nTests should pass for:\r\n- Python 3.10\r\n- Python 3.11\r\n- Python 3.12\r\n\r\nUse `pytest` markers if version-specific behavior needed:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n@pytest.mark.skipif(\r\n    sys.version_info < (3, 11),\r\n    reason=\"Requires Python 3.11+\"\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Best Practices\r\n\r\n1. **Always use context managers**: `with open_iterable(...) as source:`\r\n2. **Use temporary directories**: `tmp_path` fixture for write tests\r\n3. **Test both read and write**: Verify round-trip when possible\r\n4. **Test compression**: Include compressed variants\r\n5. **Test edge cases**: Empty files, single row, large files\r\n6. **Skip optional dependencies**: Use `@pytest.mark.skipif` appropriately\r\n7. **Clear assertions**: Use descriptive assert messages\r\n8. **Isolated tests**: Each test should be independent\r\n\r\n## Common Test Patterns\r\n\r\n### Round-Trip Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_round_trip(self, tmp_path):\r\n    original = [{''a'': 1, ''b'': 2}, {''a'': 3, ''b'': 4}]\r\n    output = tmp_path / ''output.csv''\r\n    \r\n    # Write\r\n    with open_iterable(output, ''w'') as dest:\r\n        dest.write_bulk(original)\r\n    \r\n    # Read back\r\n    with open_iterable(output) as source:\r\n        result = list(source)\r\n    \r\n    assert result == original\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Streaming Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_streaming(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''large_file.csv'') as source:\r\n        count = 0\r\n        for row in source:\r\n            count += 1\r\n            if count >= 100:\r\n                break\r\n        assert count == 100\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Debugging Tests\r\n\r\n### Verbose Output\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npytest -vv  # Very verbose\r\npytest -s   # Show print statements\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Run Last Failed\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npytest --lf  # Last failed\r\npytest --ff  # Failed first\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Debug Specific Test\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py::TestCSV::test_read -v -s\r\n```\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T03:09:35.871Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Testing Agents needing standardized test structures and data format compatibility.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化测试结构和数据格式兼容性的Python测试代理。","ja":"Pythonテストエージェントが標準化されたテスト構造とデータ形式の互換性を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 테스트 구조와 데이터 형식 호환성을 필요로 하는 Python 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de prueba de Python que necesitan estructuras de prueba estandarizadas y compatibilidad de formato de datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test Python nécessitant des structures de test standardisées et une compatibilité de format de données.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Testagenten, die standardisierte Teststrukturen und Datenformat-Kompatibilität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste Python que precisam de estruturas de teste padronizadas e compatibilidade de formato de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов тестирования Python, которым необходимы стандартизированные тестовые структуры и совместимость формата данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء اختبار بايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى هياكل اختبار معيارية ومتوافقة مع تنسيق البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently run tests on various data formats such as JSON, Parquet, and XML using pytest, ensuring comprehensive test coverage and validation.","zh":"使代理能够使用pytest高效地在各种数据格式（如JSON、Parquet和XML）上运行测试，确保全面测试覆盖和验证。","ja":"pytestを使用して、JSON、Parquet、XMLなどのさまざまなデータ形式でテストを効率的に実行し、包括的なテストカバレッジと検証を可能にします。","ko":"pytest를 사용하여 JSON, Parquet, XML 등의 다양한 데이터 형식에서 테스트를 효율적으로 실행하여 포괄적인 테스트 커버리지와 검증을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar pruebas de manera eficiente en varios formatos de datos como JSON, Parquet y XML utilizando pytest, garantizando una cobertura y validación de pruebas exhaustivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests de manière efficace sur différents formats de données tels que JSON, Parquet et XML en utilisant pytest, garantissant une couverture et une validation de tests exhaustives.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Tests effizient auf verschiedenen Datenformaten wie JSON, Parquet und XML mit pytest durchzuführen, um eine umfassende Testabdeckung und -validierung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes de forma eficiente em vários formatos de dados, como JSON, Parquet e XML, usando pytest, garantindo uma cobertura e validação de testes abrangentes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно запускать тесты на различных форматах данных, таких как JSON, Parquet и XML, используя pytest, обеспечивая полное покрытие и проверку тестов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تشغيل الاختبارات بفعالية على تنسيقات بيانات مختلفة مثل JSON و Parquet و XML باستخدام pytest، مما يضمن تغطية اختبارات شاملة وتصديقاً."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating tests for data-intensive applications","Generating test suites for multiple file formats","Debugging data processing pipelines with NDJSON and BSON support"],"zh":["自动化数据密集型应用程序的测试","为多种文件格式生成测试套件","使用NDJSON和BSON支持调试数据处理管道"],"ja":["データ集中アプリケーションのテストを自動化する","複数のファイル形式のテストスイートを生成する","NDJSONとBSONのサポートを使用してデータ処理パイプラインをデバッグする"],"ko":["데이터 집중형 애플리케이션의 테스트를 자동화하는 것","여러 파일 형식에 대한 테스트 스위트를 생성하는 것","NDJSON 및 BSON 지원을 사용하여 데이터 처리 파이프라인을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas para aplicaciones intensivas en datos","Generar suites de pruebas para múltiples formatos de archivo","Depurar tuberías de procesamiento de datos con soporte para NDJSON y BSON"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests pour les applications intensives en données","Générer des suites de tests pour plusieurs formats de fichiers","Déboguer les pipelines de traitement de données avec une prise en charge de NDJSON et BSON"],"de":["Automatisieren von Tests für datenintensive Anwendungen","Erstellen von Test-Suiten für mehrere Dateiformate","Debuggen von Datenverarbeitungspipelines mit Unterstützung für NDJSON und BSON"],"pt":["Automatizar testes para aplicações intensivas de dados","Gerar conjuntos de testes para vários formatos de arquivo","Depurar pipelines de processamento de dados com suporte a NDJSON e BSON"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты для приложений, интенсивно использующих данные","Генерировать наборы тестов для нескольких форматов файлов","Отлаживать конвейеры обработки данных с поддержкой NDJSON и BSON"],"ar":["تحقيق آلي للاختبارات لبرامج التطبيقات الكثيفة في البيانات","توليد مجموعات اختبارات لتنسيقات الملفات المتعددة","تصحيح خطأ خطوط أنابيب معالجة البيانات بدعم NDJSON و BSON"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pytest installation","Python environment only","Limited to specific file formats mentioned"],"zh":["需要pytest安装","仅限Python环境","仅限于所提到的特定文件格式"],"ja":["pytestのインストールが必要","Python環境のみ","特定のファイル形式にのみ限定"],"ko":["pytest 설치가 필요","Python 환경만","특정 파일 형식에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de pytest","Entorno de Python solo","Limitado a formatos de archivo específicos mencionados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pytest","Environnement Python uniquement","Limité aux formats de fichiers spécifiques mentionnés"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von pytest","Nur Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Dateiformate, die erwähnt werden"],"pt":["Requer instalação do pytest","Ambiente Python apenas","Limitado a formatos de arquivo específicos mencionados"],"ru":["Требуется установка pytest","Только среда Python","Ограничен конкретными форматами файлов, упомянутыми"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pytest","بيئة بايثون فقط","محدود بالتنسيقات المحددة المذكورة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4b5d5bf4609d8b5c990d72de4011e5d10deb92a6a458fff5f14071a58e663ef5","qualityScore":33}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tanepiper/teskooano/webgl', 'community', 'tanepiper', 'teskooano', 'tanepiper/teskooano', 'webgl', 0, 0, 33, '2026-02-27T01:51:08.565Z', '2026-02-27T03:09:31.257Z', '2dbf2ed55520f7e83fb90ae58269f752022cf43f02c61196e2c6bf93ccc1eda4', '{"id":"tanepiper/teskooano/webgl","name":"webgl","description":{"zh":"WebGL是一种基于ThreeJS的多摄像头3D N-body模拟器，能够创建复杂的3D场景和模拟","ja":"WebGLはThreeJSを使用したマルチカメラ3D N-bodyシミュレーターであり、複雑な3Dシーンとシミュレーションを作成できます","ko":"WebGL은 ThreeJS를 사용하여 만든 멀티 카메라 3D N-Body 시뮬레이터로, 복잡한 3D 장면과 시뮬레이션을 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Un simulador 3D de N-cuerpos con múltiples cámaras, impulsado por ThreeJS y WebGL, para experimentar con física avanzada","fr":"Un simulateur 3D de N-corps avec plusieurs caméras, alimenté par ThreeJS et WebGL, pour expérimenter la physique avancée","de":"Ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator mit mehreren Kameras, angetrieben von ThreeJS und WebGL, für fortschrittliche Physik","pt":"O simulador 3D N-body é uma ferramenta de IA avançada que utiliza a biblioteca ThreeJS para criar simulações realistas de sistemas complexos.","ru":"Многокамерный 3D N-тип симулятор - это передовая ИИ технология, которая использует библиотеку ThreeJS для создания реалистичных симуляций сложных систем.","ar":"محاكي N-جسم ثلاثي الأبعاد هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي متقدمة تستخدم مكتبة ThreeJS لإنشاء محاكيات واقعية لأنظمة معقدة.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能体WebGL：三维N-body模拟器","ja":"AIエージェントのWebGL：ThreeJSによる3D N-bodyシミュレーター","ko":"AI 에이전트 WebGL: 3D N-Body 시뮬레이터","es":"Simulador 3D de N-cuerpos con WebGL y ThreeJS","fr":"Simulateur 3D de N-corps avec WebGL et ThreeJS","de":"3D-N-Körper-Simulator mit WebGL und ThreeJS","pt":"Simulador 3D N-body com Multi-câmera e ThreeJS - Ferramen...","ru":"Многокамерный 3D N-тип симулятор на основе ThreeJS - ИИ А...","ar":"محاكي N-جسم ثلاثي الأبعاد مع كاميرا متعددة و ThreeJS - أد...","en":"webgl"},"description":{"zh":"WebGL是一种基于ThreeJS的多摄像头3D N-body模拟器，能够创建复杂的3D场景和模拟","ja":"WebGLはThreeJSを使用したマルチカメラ3D N-bodyシミュレーターであり、複雑な3Dシーンとシミュレーションを作成できます","ko":"WebGL은 ThreeJS를 사용하여 만든 멀티 카메라 3D N-Body 시뮬레이터로, 복잡한 3D 장면과 시뮬레이션을 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Un simulador 3D de N-cuerpos con múltiples cámaras, impulsado por ThreeJS y WebGL, para experimentar con física avanzada","fr":"Un simulateur 3D de N-corps avec plusieurs caméras, alimenté par ThreeJS et WebGL, pour expérimenter la physique avancée","de":"Ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator mit mehreren Kameras, angetrieben von ThreeJS und WebGL, für fortschrittliche Physik","pt":"O simulador 3D N-body é uma ferramenta de IA avançada que utiliza a biblioteca ThreeJS para criar simulações realistas de sistemas complexos.","ru":"Многокамерный 3D N-тип симулятор - это передовая ИИ технология, которая использует библиотеку ThreeJS для создания реалистичных симуляций сложных систем.","ar":"محاكي N-جسم ثلاثي الأبعاد هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي متقدمة تستخدم مكتبة ThreeJS لإنشاء محاكيات واقعية لأنظمة معقدة.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"definition":{"en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"features":{"zh":["基于ThreeJS的3D渲染","多摄像头支持","N-body模拟","复杂3D场景创建","高性能渲染"],"ja":["ThreeJSを使用した3Dレンダリング","マルチカメラ対応","N-bodyシミュレーション","複雑な3Dシーンの作成","高性能レンダリング"],"ko":["ThreeJS를 사용한 3D 렌더링","멀티 카메라 지원","N-Body 시뮬레이션","복잡한 3D 장면 생성","고성능 렌더링"],"es":["Simulación 3D de N-cuerpos","Tecnología WebGL para gráficos avanzados","Motor ThreeJS para renderizado 3D","Múltiples cámaras para una visión más amplia","Física avanzada para simulaciones realistas"],"fr":["Simulation 3D de N-corps","Technologie WebGL pour des graphiques avancés","Moteur ThreeJS pour le rendu 3D","Plusieurs caméras pour une vue plus large","Physique avancée pour des simulations réalistes"],"de":["3D-N-Körper-Simulation","WebGL-Technologie für fortschrittliche Grafik","ThreeJS-Motor für 3D-Renderings","Mehrere Kameras für eine breitere Sicht","Fortschrittliche Physik für realistische Simulationen"],"pt":["Simulação 3D realista","Multi-câmera para visualização de diferentes ângulos","Integração com a biblioteca ThreeJS","Suporte a sistemas complexos","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Реалистичная 3D симуляция","Многокамерная визуализация для просмотра с разных углов","Интеграция с библиотекой ThreeJS","Поддержка сложных систем","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["محاكاة 3D واقعية","كاميرا متعددة لتصوير زوايا مختلفة","التكامل مع مكتبة ThreeJS","دعم الأنظمة المعقدة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WebGL","ThreeJS","3D N-body模拟","AI智能体","如何使用WebGL","WebGL安装","ThreeJS教程","3D渲染引擎","N-body模拟器"],"ja":["WebGL","ThreeJS","3D N-bodyシミュレーション","AIエージェント","WebGLの使い方","WebGLのインストール","ThreeJSのチュートリアル","3Dレンダリングエンジン","N-bodyシミュレーター"],"ko":["WebGL","ThreeJS","3D N-Body 시뮬레이션","AI 에이전트","WebGL 사용법","WebGL 설치","ThreeJS 튜토리얼","3D 렌더링 엔진","N-Body 시뮬레이터"],"es":["cómo usar WebGL","qué es ThreeJS","simulador 3D de N-cuerpos","alternativas a ThreeJS","ThreeJS vs A-Frame","instalación de WebGL","guía de configuración de ThreeJS"],"fr":["comment utiliser WebGL","qu''est-ce que ThreeJS","simulateur 3D de N-corps","alternatives à ThreeJS","ThreeJS vs A-Frame","installation de WebGL","guide de configuration de ThreeJS"],"de":["wie man WebGL verwendet","was ist ThreeJS","3D-N-Körper-Simulator","Alternativen zu ThreeJS","ThreeJS vs A-Frame","WebGL-Installation","ThreeJS-Konfigurationsanleitung"],"pt":["como usar o simulador 3D N-body","o que é um simulador 3D N-body","simulador 3D N-body alternativa","ThreeJS vs outros motores de renderização","instalar o simulador 3D N-body","guia de configuração do simulador 3D N-body"],"ru":["как использовать многокамерный 3D N-тип симулятор","что такое многокамерный 3D N-тип симулятор","альтернатива многокамерному 3D N-тип симулятору","ThreeJS vs другие движки рендеринга","установка многокамерного 3D N-тип симулятора","руководство по настройке многокамерного 3D N-тип симулятора"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام محاكي N-جسم ثلاثي الأبعاد","ما هو محاكي N-جسم ثلاثي الأبعاد","بديل لمحاكي N-جسم ثلاثي الأبعاد","ThreeJS مقابل محركات عرض أخرى","تثبيت محاكي N-جسم ثلاثي الأبعاد","دليل إعداد محاكي N-جسم ثلاثي الأبعاد"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T01:51:08.565Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webgl","description":"WebGL shaders and effects for JARVIS 3D HUD","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WebGL Development Skill\n\n> **File Organization**: This skill uses split structure. See `references/` for advanced patterns and security examples.\n\n## 1. Overview\n\nThis skill provides WebGL expertise for creating custom shaders and visual effects in the JARVIS AI Assistant HUD. It focuses on GPU-accelerated rendering with security considerations.\n\n**Risk Level**: MEDIUM - Direct GPU access, potential for resource exhaustion, driver vulnerabilities\n\n**Primary Use Cases**:\n\n- Custom shaders for h","body":"# WebGL Development Skill\n\n> **File Organization**: This skill uses split structure. See `references/` for advanced patterns and security examples.\n\n## 1. Overview\n\nThis skill provides WebGL expertise for creating custom shaders and visual effects in the JARVIS AI Assistant HUD. It focuses on GPU-accelerated rendering with security considerations.\n\n**Risk Level**: MEDIUM - Direct GPU access, potential for resource exhaustion, driver vulnerabilities\n\n**Primary Use Cases**:\n\n- Custom shaders for holographic effects\n- Post-processing effects (bloom, glitch)\n- Particle systems with compute shaders\n- Real-time data visualization\n\n## 2. Core Responsibilities\n\n### 2.1 Fundamental Principles\n\n1. **TDD First**: Write tests before implementation - test shaders, contexts, and resources\n2. **Performance Aware**: Optimize GPU usage - batch draws, reuse buffers, compress textures\n3. **GPU Safety**: Implement timeout mechanisms and resource limits\n4. **Shader Validation**: Validate all shader inputs before compilation\n5. **Context Management**: Handle context loss gracefully\n6. **Performance Budgets**: Set strict limits on draw calls and triangles\n7. **Fallback Strategy**: Provide non-WebGL fallbacks\n8. **Memory Management**: Track and limit texture/buffer usage\n\n## 3. Technology Stack & Versions\n\n### 3.1 Browser Support\n\n| Browser | WebGL 2.0 | Notes             |\n| ------- | --------- | ----------------- |\n| Chrome  | 56+       | Full support      |\n| Firefox | 51+       | Full support      |\n| Safari  | 15+       | WebGL 2.0 support |\n| Edge    | 79+       | Chromium-based    |\n\n### 3.2 Security Considerations\n\n```typescript\n// Check WebGL support and capabilities\nfunction getWebGLContext(\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\n): WebGL2RenderingContext | null {\n  const gl = canvas.getContext(\"webgl2\", {\n    alpha: true,\n    antialias: true,\n    powerPreference: \"high-performance\",\n    failIfMajorPerformanceCaveat: true, // Fail if software rendering\n  });\n\n  if (!gl) {\n    console.warn(\"WebGL 2.0 not supported\");\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  return gl;\n}\n```\n\n## 4. Implementation Patterns\n\n### 4.1 Safe Shader Compilation\n\n```typescript\n// utils/shaderUtils.ts\n\n// ✅ Safe shader compilation with error handling\nexport function compileShader(\n  gl: WebGL2RenderingContext,\n  source: string,\n  type: number,\n): WebGLShader | null {\n  const shader = gl.createShader(type);\n  if (!shader) return null;\n\n  gl.shaderSource(shader, source);\n  gl.compileShader(shader);\n\n  if (!gl.getShaderParameter(shader, gl.COMPILE_STATUS)) {\n    const error = gl.getShaderInfoLog(shader);\n    console.error(\"Shader compilation error:\", error);\n    gl.deleteShader(shader);\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  return shader;\n}\n\n// ✅ Safe program linking\nexport function createProgram(\n  gl: WebGL2RenderingContext,\n  vertexShader: WebGLShader,\n  fragmentShader: WebGLShader,\n): WebGLProgram | null {\n  const program = gl.createProgram();\n  if (!program) return null;\n\n  gl.attachShader(program, vertexShader);\n  gl.attachShader(program, fragmentShader);\n  gl.linkProgram(program);\n\n  if (!gl.getProgramParameter(program, gl.LINK_STATUS)) {\n    const error = gl.getProgramInfoLog(program);\n    console.error(\"Program linking error:\", error);\n    gl.deleteProgram(program);\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  return program;\n}\n```\n\n### 4.2 Context Loss Handling\n\n```typescript\n// composables/useWebGL.ts\nexport function useWebGL(canvas: Ref<HTMLCanvasElement | null>) {\n  const gl = ref<WebGL2RenderingContext | null>(null);\n  const contextLost = ref(false);\n\n  onMounted(() => {\n    if (!canvas.value) return;\n\n    // ✅ Handle context loss\n    canvas.value.addEventListener(\"webglcontextlost\", (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      contextLost.value = true;\n      console.warn(\"WebGL context lost\");\n    });\n\n    canvas.value.addEventListener(\"webglcontextrestored\", () => {\n      contextLost.value = false;\n      initializeGL();\n      console.info(\"WebGL context restored\");\n    });\n\n    initializeGL();\n  });\n\n  function initializeGL() {\n    gl.value = getWebGLContext(canvas.value!);\n    // Reinitialize all resources\n  }\n\n  return { gl, contextLost };\n}\n```\n\n### 4.3 Holographic Shader\n\n```glsl\n// shaders/holographic.frag\n#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\n\nuniform float uTime;\nuniform vec3 uColor;\nuniform float uScanlineIntensity;\n\nin vec2 vUv;\nout vec4 fragColor;\n\nvoid main() {\n  // Scanline effect\n  float scanline = sin(vUv.y * 200.0 + uTime * 2.0) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n  scanline = mix(1.0, scanline, uScanlineIntensity);\n\n  // Edge glow\n  float edge = smoothstep(0.0, 0.1, vUv.x) *\n               smoothstep(1.0, 0.9, vUv.x) *\n               smoothstep(0.0, 0.1, vUv.y) *\n               smoothstep(1.0, 0.9, vUv.y);\n\n  vec3 color = uColor * scanline * edge;\n  float alpha = edge * 0.8;\n\n  fragColor = vec4(color, alpha);\n}\n```\n\n### 4.4 Resource Management\n\n```typescript\n// utils/resourceManager.ts\nexport class WebGLResourceManager {\n  private textures: Set<WebGLTexture> = new Set();\n  private buffers: Set<WebGLBuffer> = new Set();\n  private programs: Set<WebGLProgram> = new Set();\n\n  private textureMemory = 0;\n  private readonly MAX_TEXTURE_MEMORY = 256 * 1024 * 1024; // 256MB\n\n  constructor(private gl: WebGL2RenderingContext) {}\n\n  createTexture(width: number, height: number): WebGLTexture | null {\n    const size = width * height * 4; // RGBA\n\n    // ✅ Enforce memory limits\n    if (this.textureMemory + size > this.MAX_TEXTURE_MEMORY) {\n      console.error(\"Texture memory limit exceeded\");\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    const texture = this.gl.createTexture();\n    if (texture) {\n      this.textures.add(texture);\n      this.textureMemory += size;\n    }\n    return texture;\n  }\n\n  dispose(): void {\n    this.textures.forEach((t) => this.gl.deleteTexture(t));\n    this.buffers.forEach((b) => this.gl.deleteBuffer(b));\n    this.programs.forEach((p) => this.gl.deleteProgram(p));\n    this.textureMemory = 0;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4.5 Uniform Validation\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Type-safe uniform setting\nexport function setUniforms(\n  gl: WebGL2RenderingContext,\n  program: WebGLProgram,\n  uniforms: Record<string, number | number[] | Float32Array>,\n): void {\n  for (const [name, value] of Object.entries(uniforms)) {\n    const location = gl.getUniformLocation(program, name);\n    if (!location) {\n      console.warn(`Uniform ''${name}'' not found`);\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    if (typeof value === \"number\") {\n      gl.uniform1f(location, value);\n    } else if (Array.isArray(value)) {\n      switch (value.length) {\n        case 2:\n          gl.uniform2fv(location, value);\n          break;\n        case 3:\n          gl.uniform3fv(location, value);\n          break;\n        case 4:\n          gl.uniform4fv(location, value);\n          break;\n        case 16:\n          gl.uniformMatrix4fv(location, false, value);\n          break;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. Implementation Workflow (TDD)\n\n### 5.1 Step-by-Step Process\n\n1. **Write failing test** -> 2. **Implement minimum** -> 3. **Refactor** -> 4. **Verify**\n\n```typescript\n// Step 1: tests/webgl/shaderCompilation.test.ts\nimport { describe, it, expect, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { compileShader } from \"@/utils/shaderUtils\";\n\ndescribe(\"WebGL Shader Compilation\", () => {\n  let gl: WebGL2RenderingContext;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    gl = document.createElement(\"canvas\").getContext(\"webgl2\")!;\n  });\n\n  it(\"should compile valid shader\", () => {\n    const source = `#version 300 es\n      in vec4 aPosition;\n      void main() { gl_Position = aPosition; }`;\n    expect(compileShader(gl, source, gl.VERTEX_SHADER)).not.toBeNull();\n  });\n\n  it(\"should return null for invalid shader\", () => {\n    expect(compileShader(gl, \"invalid\", gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER)).toBeNull();\n  });\n});\n\n// Step 2-3: Implement and refactor (see section 4.1)\n// Step 4: npm test && npm run typecheck && npm run build\n```\n\n### 5.2 Testing Context and Resources\n\n```typescript\ndescribe(\"WebGL Context\", () => {\n  it(\"should handle context loss\", async () => {\n    const { gl, contextLost } = useWebGL(ref(canvas));\n    gl.value?.getExtension(\"WEBGL_lose_context\")?.loseContext();\n    await nextTick();\n    expect(contextLost.value).toBe(true);\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Resource Manager\", () => {\n  it(\"should enforce memory limits\", () => {\n    const manager = new WebGLResourceManager(gl);\n    expect(manager.createTexture(1024, 1024)).not.toBeNull();\n    expect(manager.createTexture(16384, 16384)).toBeNull(); // Exceeds limit\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## 6. Performance Patterns\n\n### 6.1 Buffer Reuse\n\n```typescript\n// Bad - Creates new buffer every frame\nconst buffer = gl.createBuffer();\ngl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, data, gl.DYNAMIC_DRAW);\ngl.deleteBuffer(buffer);\n\n// Good - Reuse buffer, update only data\ngl.bufferSubData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, 0, data); // Update existing buffer\n```\n\n### 6.2 Draw Call Batching\n\n```typescript\n// Bad - One draw call per object\nobjects.forEach(obj => {\n  gl.useProgram(obj.program)\n  gl.drawElements(...)\n})\n\n// Good - Batch by material/shader\nconst batches = groupByMaterial(objects)\nbatches.forEach(batch => {\n  gl.useProgram(batch.program)\n  batch.objects.forEach(obj => gl.drawElements(...))\n})\n```\n\n### 6.3 Texture Compression\n\n```typescript\n// Bad - Always uncompressed RGBA\ngl.texImage2D(gl.TEXTURE_2D, 0, gl.RGBA, gl.RGBA, gl.UNSIGNED_BYTE, image)\n\n// Good - Use compressed formats when available\nconst ext = gl.getExtension(''WEBGL_compressed_texture_s3tc'')\nif (ext) gl.compressedTexImage2D(gl.TEXTURE_2D, 0, ext.COMPRESSED_RGBA_S3TC_DXT5_EXT, ...)\n```\n\n### 6.4 Instanced Rendering\n\n```typescript\n// Bad - Individual draw calls for particles\nparticles.forEach((p) => {\n  gl.uniform3fv(uPosition, p.position);\n  gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 6);\n});\n\n// Good - Single instanced draw call\ngl.drawArraysInstanced(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 6, particles.length);\n```\n\n### 6.5 VAO Usage\n\n```typescript\n// Bad - Rebind attributes every frame\ngl.enableVertexAttribArray(0);\ngl.vertexAttribPointer(0, 3, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n// Good - Use VAO to store attribute state\nconst vao = gl.createVertexArray();\ngl.bindVertexArray(vao);\n// Set up once, then just bind VAO for rendering\n```\n\n## 7. Security Standards\n\n### 7.1 Known Vulnerabilities\n\n| CVE            | Severity | Description                      | Mitigation                 |\n| -------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| CVE-2024-11691 | HIGH     | Apple M series memory corruption | Update browser, OS patches |\n| CVE-2023-1531  | HIGH     | Chrome use-after-free            | Update Chrome              |\n\n### 7.2 OWASP Top 10 Coverage\n\n| OWASP Category            | Risk | Mitigation                   |\n| ------------------------- | ---- | ---------------------------- |\n| A06 Vulnerable Components | HIGH | Keep browsers updated        |\n| A10 SSRF                  | LOW  | Context isolation by browser |\n\n### 7.3 GPU Resource Protection\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Implement resource limits\nconst LIMITS = {\n  maxDrawCalls: 100,\n  maxTriangles: 1_000_000,\n  maxTextures: 32,\n  maxTextureSize: 4096,\n};\n\nfunction checkLimits(stats: RenderStats): boolean {\n  if (stats.drawCalls > LIMITS.maxDrawCalls) {\n    console.error(\"Draw call limit exceeded\");\n    return false;\n  }\n  if (stats.triangles > LIMITS.maxTriangles) {\n    console.error(\"Triangle limit exceeded\");\n    return false;\n  }\n  return true;\n}\n```\n\n## 8. Common Mistakes & Anti-Patterns\n\n### 8.1 Critical Security Anti-Patterns\n\n#### Never: Skip Context Loss Handling\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ DANGEROUS - App crashes on context loss\nconst gl = canvas.getContext(\"webgl2\");\n// No context loss handler!\n\n// ✅ SECURE - Handle gracefully\ncanvas.addEventListener(\"webglcontextlost\", handleLoss);\ncanvas.addEventListener(\"webglcontextrestored\", handleRestore);\n```\n\n#### Never: Unlimited Resource Allocation\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ DANGEROUS - GPU memory exhaustion\nfor (let i = 0; i < userCount; i++) {\n  textures.push(gl.createTexture());\n}\n\n// ✅ SECURE - Enforce limits\nif (textureCount < MAX_TEXTURES) {\n  textures.push(gl.createTexture());\n}\n```\n\n### 8.2 Performance Anti-Patterns\n\n#### Avoid: Excessive State Changes\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ BAD - Unbatched draw calls\nobjects.forEach(obj => {\n  gl.useProgram(obj.program)\n  gl.bindTexture(gl.TEXTURE_2D, obj.texture)\n  gl.drawElements(...)\n})\n\n// ✅ GOOD - Batch by material\nbatches.forEach(batch => {\n  gl.useProgram(batch.program)\n  gl.bindTexture(gl.TEXTURE_2D, batch.texture)\n  batch.objects.forEach(obj => gl.drawElements(...))\n})\n```\n\n## 9. Pre-Implementation Checklist\n\n### Phase 1: Before Writing Code\n\n- [ ] Write failing tests for shaders, context, and resources\n- [ ] Define performance budgets (draw calls <100, memory <256MB)\n- [ ] Identify required WebGL extensions\n\n### Phase 2: During Implementation\n\n- [ ] Context loss handling with recovery\n- [ ] Resource limits and memory tracking\n- [ ] Shader validation before compilation\n- [ ] Use VAOs, batch draws, reuse buffers\n- [ ] Instanced rendering for particles\n\n### Phase 3: Before Committing\n\n- [ ] Tests pass: `npm test -- --run tests/webgl/`\n- [ ] Type check: `npm run typecheck`\n- [ ] Build: `npm run build`\n- [ ] Performance verified (draws, memory)\n- [ ] Fallback for no WebGL tested\n\n## 10. Summary\n\nWebGL provides GPU-accelerated graphics for JARVIS HUD. Key principles: handle context loss, enforce resource limits, validate shaders, track memory, batch draw calls, minimize state changes.\n\n**Remember**: WebGL bypasses browser sandboxing - always protect against resource exhaustion.\n**References**: `references/advanced-patterns.md`, `references/security-examples.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T03:09:31.257Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graphics Agents needing advanced WebGL capabilities for custom shader development and 3D simulations.","zh":"非常适合需要高级WebGL功能的图形代理，用于自定义着色器开发和3D模拟。","ja":"グラフィックスエージェントがカスタムシェーダ開発と3Dシミュレーションのために高度なWebGL機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 WebGL 기능을 필요로 하는 그래픽 에이전트에게 적합하며, 사용자 지정 셰이더 개발 및 3D 시뮬레이션을 위한 것입니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Gráficos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de WebGL para el desarrollo de shaders personalizados y simulaciones 3D.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents graphiques nécessitant des capacités WebGL avancées pour le développement de shaders personnalisés et de simulations 3D.","de":"Perfekt für Grafikagenten, die erweiterte WebGL-Fähigkeiten für die Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Shadern und 3D-Simulationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Gráficos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de WebGL para desenvolvimento de shaders personalizados e simulações 3D.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Графических Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности WebGL для создания пользовательских шейдеров и 3D-симуляций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الرسومات الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة من WebGL لتنمية شفرات مخصصة ومحاكاة 3D."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create immersive GPU-accelerated rendering experiences using ThreeJS, with a focus on security and performance optimization, including multi-camera support and N-body simulations.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用ThreeJS的沉浸式GPU加速渲染体验的能力，重点关注安全性和性能优化，包括多摄像头支持和N体模拟。","ja":"ThreeJSを使用した没入型GPUアクセラレーションレンダリング体験を作成するエージェントの能力を提供し、セキュリティとパフォーマンスの最適化に重点を置き、複数カメラサポートとN体シミュレーションを含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 ThreeJS를 사용하여 보안 및 성능 최적화를 중점으로 한 몰입형 GPU 가속 렌더링ประสบ을 만들 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 다중 카메라 지원 및 N-체 시뮬레이션을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias de renderizado aceleradas por GPU de inmersión utilizando ThreeJS, con un enfoque en la optimización de la seguridad y el rendimiento, incluyendo soporte para múltiples cámaras y simulaciones N-cuerpo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences de rendu immersive accélérées par GPU en utilisant ThreeJS, avec un focus sur la sécurité et l''optimisation des performances, y compris la prise en charge de plusieurs caméras et des simulations N-corps.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, immersive GPU-accelerierte Rendering-Erfahrungen mit ThreeJS zu erstellen, mit Fokus auf Sicherheit und Leistungsoptimierung, einschließlich Unterstützung für mehrere Kameras und N-Körper-Simulationen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem experiências de renderização imersivas com aceleração por GPU usando ThreeJS, com foco em segurança e otimização de desempenho, incluindo suporte a multi-câmera e simulações N-body.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать иммерсивные trải nghiệm 