"pt":["Integração com a API do WhatsApp","Servidor MCP para desenvolvedores","Funcionalidades de mensagens instantâneas","Facilidade de uso e configuração","Compatibilidade com plataformas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Интеграция с WhatsApp API","Сервер MCP для разработчиков","Функции мгновенного обмена сообщениями","Легкость использования и конфигурации","Совместимость с платформами разработки"],"ar":["التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات واتساب","خادم مسيح لمكتبة برامج واتساب للمطورين","ميزات المراسلة الفورية","سهولة الاستخدام والتكوين","التوافق مع منصات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Prayer-Agent 服务器","Whatsp API","MCP 服务器","如何使用 Prayer-Agent","Prayer-Agent 代替品","Prayer-Agent 安装","Prayer-Agent 设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Prayer-Agent サーバー","Whatsp API","MCP サーバー","Prayer-Agent の使い方","Prayer-Agent の代替","Prayer-Agent のインストール","Prayer-Agent の設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Prayer-Agent 서버","Whatsp API","MCP 서버","Prayer-Agent 사용법","Prayer-Agent 대체","Prayer-Agent 설치","Prayer-Agent 설정 가이드"],"es":["agente de oración","servidor MCP","API de WhatsApp","cómo utilizar el agente de oración","alternativas al agente de oración","agente de oración vs otros agentes","instalación del agente de oración","guía de configuración del agente de oración"],"fr":["agent de prière","serveur MCP","API WhatsApp","comment utiliser l''agent de prière","alternatives à l''agent de prière","agent de prière vs autres agents","installation de l''agent de prière","guide de configuration de l''agent de prière"],"de":["Gebetsagent","MCP-Server","WhatsApp-API","wie man den Gebetsagenten verwendet","Alternativen zum Gebetsagenten","Gebetsagenten vs andere Agenten","Installation des Gebetsagenten","Konfigurationsanleitung für den Gebetsagenten"],"pt":["como usar agente de oração","o que é agente de oração","agente de oração alternative","agente de oração vs outros","instalar agente de oração","guia de configuração do agente de oração","desenvolvimento com agente de oração","agente de oração para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент Молитвы","что такое ИИ Агент Молитвы","ИИ Агент Молитвы альтернатива","ИИ Агент Молитвы vs другие","установить ИИ Агент Молитвы","руководство по конфигурации ИИ Агента Молитвы","разработка с ИИ Агентом Молитвы","ИИ Агент Молитвы для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الصلاة","ما هو وكيل الصلاة","وكيل الصلاة بديل","وكيل الصلاة مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت وكيل الصلاة","دليل إعداد وكيل الصلاة","التطوير مع وكيل الصلاة","وكيل الصلاة للمطورين"]}},"owner":"itmeGirish","repo":"BoardingMcp-Server","repoPath":"itmeGirish/BoardingMcp-Server","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T16:04:12Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prayer-agent","description":"Generates correct prayers/reliefs (primary, alternative, interim) based on doc_type and issues.","bodyPreview":"# Prayer Agent\n\n## Goal\nGenerate PRAYER_PACK.json.\n\n## HARD RULES\n- Prayer must match doc_type.\n- Do not request illegal relief.\n- Always include \"such other orders\" clause.\n\n## OUTPUT CONTRACT (STRICT JSON ONLY)\nReturn ONLY:\n\n{\n  \"doc_type\": \"string\",\n  \"reliefs_primary\": [],\n  \"reliefs_alternative\": [],\n  \"interim_reliefs\": [],\n  \"costs_interest_clause\": \"string\"\n}\n\n## PRAYER STANDARDS\n- Use formal court language.\n- Use \"this Hon''ble Court\" phrasing.\n- Avoid aggressive accusations unless facts","body":"# Prayer Agent\n\n## Goal\nGenerate PRAYER_PACK.json.\n\n## HARD RULES\n- Prayer must match doc_type.\n- Do not request illegal relief.\n- Always include \"such other orders\" clause.\n\n## OUTPUT CONTRACT (STRICT JSON ONLY)\nReturn ONLY:\n\n{\n  \"doc_type\": \"string\",\n  \"reliefs_primary\": [],\n  \"reliefs_alternative\": [],\n  \"interim_reliefs\": [],\n  \"costs_interest_clause\": \"string\"\n}\n\n## PRAYER STANDARDS\n- Use formal court language.\n- Use \"this Hon''ble Court\" phrasing.\n- Avoid aggressive accusations unless facts support.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:12:24.931Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Legal AI Agents requiring structured prayer generation in JSON format.","zh":"适合需要以JSON格式生成结构化祈祷的Legal AI Agents。","ja":"JSON形式で構造化された祈祷を生成する必要があるLegal AI Agentsに適しています。","ko":"JSON 형식으로 구조화된 祈祷를 생성해야 하는 Legal AI Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Legales que requieren generación de oraciones estructuradas en formato JSON.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA juridiques nécessitant une génération de prières structurées au format JSON.","de":"Ideal für juristische KI-Agents, die eine strukturierte Gebetsgenerierung im JSON-Format erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for Legal AI Agents requiring structured prayer generation in JSON format.","ru":"Ideal for Legal AI Agents requiring structured prayer generation in JSON format.","ar":"Ideal for Legal AI Agents requiring structured prayer generation in JSON format."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate compliant PRAYER_PACK.json files using strict JSON output, adhering to prayer standards and hard rules, including matching doc_type and incorporating ''such other orders'' clauses.","zh":"赋予代理生成符合祈祷标准和严格规则的PRAYER_PACK.json文件的能力，包括匹配doc_type和包含''其他命令''子句，使用严格的JSON输出。","ja":"祈祷標準と厳格なルールに従ったPRAYER_PACK.jsonファイルを生成するエージェントをEmpowerすることができます。厳格なJSON出力を使用し、doc_typeをマッチさせ、''その他の命令''子句を含めます。","ko":"祈祷 표준과 엄격한 규칙을 준수하는 PRAYER_PACK.json 파일을 생성하는 에이전트를 Empower할 수 있습니다. 엄격한 JSON 출력을 사용하고, doc_type을 일치시키고, ''他の命令'' 子句를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar archivos PRAYER_PACK.json compatibles utilizando una salida JSON estricta, ajustándose a los estándares de oración y reglas estrictas, incluyendo la coincidencia de doc_type y la incorporación de cláusulas ''tales otras órdenes''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers PRAYER_PACK.json conformes en utilisant une sortie JSON stricte, en respectant les normes de prière et les règles strictes, y compris la correspondance de doc_type et l''incorporation de clauses ''telles autres ordres''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, konforme PRAYER_PACK.json-Dateien unter Verwendung von strenger JSON-Ausgabe zu generieren, die den Gebetsstandards und harten Regeln entsprechen, einschließlich der Übereinstimmung von doc_type und der Einbeziehung von ''solchen anderen Anordnungen''-Klauseln.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate compliant PRAYER_PACK.json files using strict JSON output, adhering to prayer standards and hard rules, including matching doc_type and incorporating ''such other orders'' clauses.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate compliant PRAYER_PACK.json files using strict JSON output, adhering to prayer standards and hard rules, including matching doc_type and incorporating ''such other orders'' clauses.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate compliant PRAYER_PACK.json files using strict JSON output, adhering to prayer standards and hard rules, including matching doc_type and incorporating ''such other orders'' clauses."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating prayer packs for legal documents","Automating relief requests with formal court language","Creating interim relief petitions with precise costs_interest_clause"],"zh":["为法律文件生成祈祷包","使用正式法庭语言自动化救济请求","创建临时救济请愿书，包含精确的costs_interest_clause"],"ja":["法的文書向けの祈祷パックを生成する","正式な法廷言語を使用して救済の要求を自動化する","精密なcosts_interest_clauseを含む臨時救済請願書を作成する"],"ko":["법률 문서를 위한 祈祷 패키지를 생성하는 것","공식 법원 언어를 사용하여 구제 요청을 자동화하는 것","정확한 costs_interest_clause를 포함하는 임시 구제 청원서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generación de paquetes de oraciones para documentos legales","Automatización de solicitudes de ayuda con lenguaje formal de tribunal","Creación de peticiones de ayuda interina con cláusula de costos_interés precisa"],"fr":["Génération de packs de prières pour des documents juridiques","Automatisation des demandes de secours avec un langage de tribunal formel","Création de pétitions de secours interimaire avec une clause de coûts_intérêts précise"],"de":["Generierung von Gebetspaketen für juristische Dokumente","Automatisierung von Hilfsanfragen mit formalem Gerichtssprachgebrauch","Erstellung von Zwischenhilfeanträgen mit präziser Kosten_Zinsen-Klausel"],"pt":["Generating prayer packs for legal documents","Automating relief requests with formal court language","Creating interim relief petitions with precise costs_interest_clause"],"ru":["Generating prayer packs for legal documents","Automating relief requests with formal court language","Creating interim relief petitions with precise costs_interest_clause"],"ar":["Generating prayer packs for legal documents","Automating relief requests with formal court language","Creating interim relief petitions with precise costs_interest_clause"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specific prayer standards and hard rules","Limited to generating PRAYER_PACK.json files in strict JSON format","Must include ''such other orders'' clause in all outputs"],"zh":["需要遵守特定的祈祷标准和严格规则","仅限生成严格JSON格式的PRAYER_PACK.json文件","必须在所有输出中包含''其他命令''子句"],"ja":["特定の祈祷標準と厳格なルールに従う必要がある","厳格なJSON形式のPRAYER_PACK.jsonファイルのみを生成できる","すべての出力に''その他の命令''子句を含める必要がある"],"ko":["특정 祈祷 표준과 엄격한 규칙을 준수해야 함","엄격한 JSON 형식의 PRAYER_PACK.json 파일만 생성할 수 있음","모든 출력에 ''他の命令'' 子句를 포함해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a estándares de oración específicos y reglas estrictas","Limitado a la generación de archivos PRAYER_PACK.json en formato JSON estricto","Debe incluir la cláusula ''tales otras órdenes'' en todas las salidas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à des normes de prière spécifiques et des règles strictes","Limité à la génération de fichiers PRAYER_PACK.json au format JSON strict","Doit inclure la clause ''telles autres ordres'' dans toutes les sorties"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung spezifischer Gebetsstandards und harter Regeln","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von PRAYER_PACK.json-Dateien im strengen JSON-Format","Muss die Klausel ''solchen anderen Anordnungen'' in allen Ausgaben enthalten"],"pt":["Requires adherence to specific prayer standards and hard rules","Limited to generating PRAYER_PACK.json files in strict JSON format","Must include ''such other orders'' clause in all outputs"],"ru":["Requires adherence to specific prayer standards and hard rules","Limited to generating PRAYER_PACK.json files in strict JSON format","Must include ''such other orders'' clause in all outputs"],"ar":["Requires adherence to specific prayer standards and hard rules","Limited to generating PRAYER_PACK.json files in strict JSON format","Must include ''such other orders'' clause in all outputs"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"066e217b6c9fcb73b9ca6d26fa22701d7960c893c112d036b1b73345f84e5812","qualityScore":33}');
