れるAIエージェントです。高性能のビデオ生成と処理能力を提供します","ko":"varg-video-generation은 비디오 도구의 개발과 통합에 사용되는 AI 에이전트입니다. 높은 성능의 비디오 생성과 처리 능력을 제공합니다","es":"El SDK de inteligencia artificial varg-video-generation es una herramienta de vanguardia para la creación de videos","fr":"Le SDK d''intelligence artificielle varg-video-generation est un outil de pointe pour la création de vidéos","de":"Das KI-SDK varg-video-generation ist ein Spitzen-Tool für die Erstellung von Videos","pt":"A varg-video-generation é uma SDK de ferramentas de vídeo IA nativa para desenvolvedores","ru":"varg-video-generation - это ИИ-ориентированная SDK для инструментов видео для разработчиков","ar":"varg-video-generation هي SDK أصلية لأدوات الفيديو الذكية للمطورين","en":"AI-native SDK for video tooling"},"definition":{"en":"AI-native SDK for video tooling"},"features":{"zh":["AI原生SDK","视频工具开发和集成","高效视频生成和处理","支持多种视频格式","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ビデオツールの開発と統合","高性能のビデオ生成と処理","多種のビデオ形式をサポート","使用と統合が簡単"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","비디오 도구의 개발과 통합","高い 성능의 비디오 생성과 처리","다양한 비디오 형식을 지원","사용과 통합이 쉽습니다"],"es":["SDK de inteligencia artificial para la creación de videos","Herramientas de video de vanguardia","Integración con tecnologías de desarrollo como React y Node.js","Compatibilidad con CLI","Agentes de inteligencia artificial para la automatización de tareas"],"fr":["SDK d''intelligence artificielle pour la création de vidéos","Outils de vidéo de pointe","Intégration avec des technologies de développement comme React et Node.js","Compatibilité avec CLI","Agents d''intelligence artificielle pour l''automatisation de tâches"],"de":["KI-SDK für die Erstellung von Videos","Video-Tools der Spitzenklasse","Integration mit Entwicklungstechnologien wie React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI","KI-Agents für die Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações de vídeo com IA","SDK de ferramentas de vídeo IA nativa","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para automação de tarefas","Agent de vídeo para processamento de mídia"],"ru":["Разработка приложений видео с ИИ","ИИ-ориентированная SDK для инструментов видео","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для автоматизации задач","Агент видео для обработки мультимедиа"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الفيديو بالذكاء الاصطناعي","SDK أصلية لأدوات الفيديو الذكية","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","CLI للautomaton من المهام","وكيل الفيديو لمعالجة الوسائط المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能视频生成","varg-video-generation","视频工具开发","AI原生SDK","如何使用varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation安装","varg-video-generation设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用したビデオ生成","varg-video-generation","ビデオツールの開発","AIエージェント","varg-video-generationの使い方","varg-video-generationのインストール","varg-video-generationの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 사용한 비디오 생성","varg-video-generation","비디오 도구의 개발","AI 에이전트","varg-video-generation 사용법","varg-video-generation 설치","varg-video-generation 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar varg-video-generation","qué es la inteligencia artificial","alternativas a varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs otros SDK","instalación de varg-video-generation","guía de configuración de varg-video-generation"],"fr":["comment utiliser varg-video-generation","qu''est-ce que l''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs d''autres SDK","installation de varg-video-generation","guide de configuration de varg-video-generation"],"de":["wie man varg-video-generation verwendet","was ist künstliche Intelligenz","Alternativen zu varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs andere SDK","Installation von varg-video-generation","Konfigurationshandbuch für varg-video-generation"],"pt":["como usar varg-video-generation","o que é varg-video-generation","alternativas para varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs outros","instalar varg-video-generation","guia de configuração varg-video-generation"],"ru":["как использовать varg-video-generation","что такое varg-video-generation","альтернативы для varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs другие","установить varg-video-generation","руководство по настройке varg-video-generation"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام varg-video-generation","ما هي varg-video-generation","بديلات لبرنامج varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation مقابل البرامج الأخرى","تثبيت varg-video-generation","دليل إعداد varg-video-generation"]}},"owner":"vargHQ","repo":"sdk","repoPath":"vargHQ/sdk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.887Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"varg-video-generation","description":"Generate AI videos using varg SDK React engine. Use when creating videos, animations, talking characters, slideshows, or social media content.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Video Generation with varg React Engine\n\nGenerate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax with automatic caching and parallel generation.\n\n## Quick Setup\n\nInitialize a new project:\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai init\n```\n\nOr just create hello.tsx starter:\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai hello\n```\n\nCheck existing API keys:\n\n```bash\ncat .env 2>/dev/null | grep -E \"^(FAL_KEY|ELEVENLABS_API_KEY)=\" || echo \"No API keys found\"\n```\n\n## Required API Keys\n\n### FAL_KEY (Required)\n\n| Detail | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Prov","body":"# Video Generation with varg React Engine\n\nGenerate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax with automatic caching and parallel generation.\n\n## Quick Setup\n\nInitialize a new project:\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai init\n```\n\nOr just create hello.tsx starter:\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai hello\n```\n\nCheck existing API keys:\n\n```bash\ncat .env 2>/dev/null | grep -E \"^(FAL_KEY|ELEVENLABS_API_KEY)=\" || echo \"No API keys found\"\n```\n\n## Required API Keys\n\n### FAL_KEY (Required)\n\n| Detail | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Provider | Fal.ai |\n| Get it | https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys |\n| Free tier | Yes (limited credits) |\n| Used for | Image generation (Flux), Video generation (Wan 2.5, Kling) |\n\nIf user doesn''t have `FAL_KEY`:\n1. Direct them to https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys\n2. Create account and generate API key\n3. Add to `.env` file: `FAL_KEY=fal_xxxxx`\n\n### Optional Keys\n\n| Feature | Key | Provider | URL |\n|---------|-----|----------|-----|\n| Music/Voice | `ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` | ElevenLabs | https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys |\n| Lipsync | `REPLICATE_API_TOKEN` | Replicate | https://replicate.com/account/api-tokens |\n| Transcription | `GROQ_API_KEY` | Groq | https://console.groq.com/keys |\n\n**Warn user about missing optional keys but continue with available features.**\n\n## Available Features by API Key\n\n**FAL_API_KEY only:**\n- Image generation (Flux models)\n- Image-to-video animation (Wan 2.5, Kling)\n- Text-to-video generation\n- Slideshows with transitions\n- Ken Burns zoom effects\n\n**FAL + ELEVENLABS:**\n- All above, plus:\n- AI-generated background music\n- Text-to-speech voiceovers\n- Talking character videos\n\n**All keys:**\n- Full production pipeline with lipsync and auto-captions\n\n## Quick Templates\n\n### Simple Slideshow (FAL only)\n\n```tsx\n/** @jsxImportSource vargai */\nimport { Render, Clip, Image } from \"vargai/react\";\n\nconst SCENES = [\"sunset over ocean\", \"mountain peaks\", \"city at night\"];\n\nexport default (\n  <Render width={1080} height={1920}>\n    {SCENES.map((prompt, i) => (\n      <Clip key={i} duration={3} transition={{ name: \"fade\", duration: 0.5 }}>\n        <Image prompt={prompt} zoom=\"in\" />\n      </Clip>\n    ))}\n  </Render>\n);\n```\n\n### Animated Video (FAL + ElevenLabs)\n\n```tsx\n/** @jsxImportSource vargai */\nimport { Render, Clip, Image, Video, Music } from \"vargai/react\";\nimport { fal, elevenlabs } from \"vargai/ai\";\n\nconst cat = Image({ prompt: \"cute cat on windowsill\" });\n\nexport default (\n  <Render width={1080} height={1920}>\n    <Music prompt=\"upbeat electronic\" model={elevenlabs.musicModel()} />\n    <Clip duration={5}>\n      <Video\n        prompt={{ text: \"cat turns head, blinks slowly\", images: [cat] }}\n        model={fal.videoModel(\"wan-2.5\")}\n      />\n    </Clip>\n  </Render>\n);\n```\n\n### Talking Character\n\n```tsx\n/** @jsxImportSource vargai */\nimport { Render, Clip, Image, Video, Speech, Captions } from \"vargai/react\";\nimport { fal, elevenlabs } from \"vargai/ai\";\n\nconst robot = Image({ prompt: \"friendly robot, blue metallic\", aspectRatio: \"9:16\" });\n\nconst voiceover = Speech({\n  model: elevenlabs.speechModel(\"eleven_multilingual_v2\"),\n  voice: \"adam\",\n  children: \"Hello! I''m your AI assistant. Let''s create something amazing!\",\n});\n\nexport default (\n  <Render width={1080} height={1920}>\n    <Clip duration={5}>\n      <Video\n        prompt={{ text: \"robot talking, subtle head movements\", images: [robot] }}\n        model={fal.videoModel(\"wan-2.5\")}\n      />\n    </Clip>\n    <Captions src={voiceover} style=\"tiktok\" />\n  </Render>\n);\n```\n\n\n\n## Running Videos\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai render your-video.tsx\n```\n\n## Key Components\n\n| Component | Purpose | Required Key |\n|-----------|---------|--------------|\n| `<Render>` | Root container | - |\n| `<Clip>` | Sequential segment | - |\n| `<Image>` | AI image | FAL |\n| `<Animate>` | Image-to-video | FAL |\n| `<Music>` | Background music | ElevenLabs |\n| `<Speech>` | Text-to-speech | ElevenLabs |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Character Consistency\n\n```tsx\nconst character = Image({ prompt: \"blue robot\" });\n// Reuse same reference = same generated image\n<Animate image={character} motion=\"waving\" />\n<Animate image={character} motion=\"dancing\" />\n```\n\n### Transitions\n\n```tsx\n<Clip transition={{ name: \"fade\", duration: 0.5 }}>\n// Options: fade, crossfade, wipeleft, cube, slideup, etc.\n```\n\n### Aspect Ratios\n\n- `9:16` - TikTok, Reels, Shorts (vertical)\n- `16:9` - YouTube (horizontal)\n- `1:1` - Instagram (square)\n\n### Zoom Effects\n\n```tsx\n<Image prompt=\"landscape\" zoom=\"in\" />   // Zoom in\n<Image prompt=\"landscape\" zoom=\"out\" />  // Zoom out\n<Image prompt=\"landscape\" zoom=\"left\" /> // Pan left\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"FAL_KEY not found\"\n- Check `.env` file exists in project root\n- Ensure no spaces around `=` sign\n- Restart terminal after adding keys\n\n### \"Rate limit exceeded\"\n- Free tier has limited credits\n- Wait or upgrade plan\n- Use caching to avoid regenerating\n\n### \"Video generation failed\"\n- Check prompt doesn''t violate content policy\n- Try simpler motion descriptions\n- Reduce video duration\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Run `bunx vargai init` to initialize project\n2. Add your FAL_KEY to `.env`\n3. Run `bunx vargai render hello.tsx`\n4. Or ask the agent: \"create a 10 second tiktok video about cats\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:25.596Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Media Generation Agents needing advanced video creation capabilities with JSX syntax.","zh":"Perfect for Media Generation Agents needing advanced video creation capabilities with JSX syntax.","ja":"Media Generation Agents Advanced video creation capabilities JSX syntax.","ko":"Media Generation Agents advanced video JSX .","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Medios que necesitan capacidades de creación de video avanzadas con sintaxis JSX.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Génération de Médias nécessitant des capacités de création de vidéo avancées avec une syntaxe JSX.","de":"Perfekt für Media Generation Agents, die erweiterte Videoerstellungsfunktionen mit JSX-Syntax benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Mídia que precisam de capacidades avançadas de criação de vídeo com sintaxe JSX.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации медиа, которым необходимы расширенные возможности создания видео с синтаксисом JSX.","ar":"مثالي لعميل генера génMedia الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء الفيديو باستخدام بناء جملة JSX."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax with automatic caching and parallel generation, leveraging the varg React Engine and supporting protocols like bunx for initialization and API key management.","zh":"Empowers agents to generate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax with automatic caching and parallel generation, leveraging the varg React Engine and supporting protocols like bunx for initialization and API key management.","ja":"Empowers agents to generate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax automatic caching parallel generation, leveraging the varg React Engine and supporting protocols like bunx initialization API key management.","ko":"Empowers agents to generate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax automatic caching parallel generation, leveraging the varg React Engine and supporting protocols like bunx initialization API .","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar videos de IA utilizando sintaxis JSX declarativa con caché automática y generación paralela, aprovechando el motor React varg y admitiendo protocolos como bunx para la inicialización y la gestión de claves API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des vidéos IA en utilisant une syntaxe JSX déclarative avec un cache automatique et une génération parallèle, en exploitant le moteur React varg et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que bunx pour l''initialisation et la gestion des clés API.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, AI-Videos mit deklarativer JSX-Syntax zu generieren, mit automatischer Zwischenspeicherung und paralleler Generierung, unter Ausnutzung des React-Motors varg und mit Unterstützung von Protokollen wie bunx für Initialisierung und API-Schlüsselverwaltung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar vídeos de IA usando sintaxe JSX declarativa com cache automático e geração paralela, aproveitando o mecanismo varg React e apoiando protocolos como bunx para inicialização e gerenciamento de chave API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать видео ИИ с помощью декларативной синтаксиса JSX с автоматическим кэшированием и параллельной генерацией, используя двигатель varg React и поддерживая протоколы, такие как bunx, для инициализации и управления ключом API.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على生成 مقاطع فيديو للذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام بناء جملة JSX الإعلاني مع ذاكرة مؤقتة تلقائية وتوليد متوازي، مستفيدا من محرك varg React وداعما لبروتوكولات مثل bunx لإعداد وتشغيل مفتاح API."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating explainer videos with automatic caching","Creating video content using parallel generation","Initializing new video projects with bunx vargai"],"zh":["Using automatic caching to generate explainer videos","Using parallel generation to create video content","Using bunx vargai to initialize new video projects"],"ja":["Automatic caching explainer videos","Parallel generation video content","bunx vargai new video projects"],"ko":["automatic caching ","parallel generation video ","bunx vargai "],"es":["Generación de videos explicativos con caché automática","Creación de contenido de video mediante generación paralela","Inicialización de nuevos proyectos de video con bunx vargai"],"fr":["Génération de vidéos explicatives avec un cache automatique","Création de contenu vidéo à l''aide d''une génération parallèle","Initialisation de nouveaux projets de vidéo avec bunx vargai"],"de":["Erstellung von Erklärungsvideos mit automatischer Zwischenspeicherung","Erstellung von Videoinhalten unter Verwendung von paralleler Generierung","Initialisierung neuer Videoprojekte mit bunx vargai"],"pt":["Gerar vídeos explicativos com cache automático","Criar conteúdo de vídeo usando geração paralela","Inicializar novos projetos de vídeo com bunx vargai"],"ru":["Генерировать видео-объяснения с автоматическим кэшированием","Создавать видеоконтент с помощью параллельной генерации","Инициализировать новые видеопроекты с bunx vargai"],"ar":["توليد مقاطع فيديو توضيحية مع ذاكرة مؤقتة تلقائية","إنشاء محتوى فيديو باستخدام توليد متوازي","تشغيل مشاريع فيديو جديدة مع bunx vargai"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires FAL_KEY API key","Dependent on bunx vargai for project setup"],"zh":["Requires FAL_KEY API key","Dependent on bunx vargai for project setup"],"ja":["FAL_KEY API key","bunx vargai project setup"],"ko":["FAL_KEY API key","bunx vargai "],"es":["Requiere clave API FAL_KEY","Dependiente de bunx vargai para la configuración del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé API FAL_KEY","Dépendant de bunx vargai pour la configuration du projet"],"de":["Benötigt FAL_KEY-API-Schlüssel","Von bunx vargai abhängig für die Projektkonfiguration"],"pt":["Requer chave API FAL_KEY","Dependente de bunx vargai para configuração do projeto"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API FAL_KEY","Зависит от bunx vargai для настройки проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح API FAL_KEY","يعتمد على bunx vargai لإعداد المشروع"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4de8747f229526a82f3e558c90e6db3c94e3a9a22cd8c944b7fd0dfec3da1e53","qualityScore":33}');
