언어 지원"],"es":["Arquitectura de eventos","Integración con Temporal","Soporte para React","Desarrollo full-stack","Escalabilidad y flexibilidad"],"fr":["Architecture orientée événements","Intégration avec Temporal","Prise en charge de React","Développement full-stack","Évolutivité et flexibilité"],"de":["Ereignisgesteuerte Architektur","Integration mit Temporal","Unterstützung für React","Full-Stack-Entwicklung","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität"],"pt":["Arquitetura orientada a eventos","Integração com React","Desenvolvimento full-stack","Temporização de workflows","Suporte a Node.js"],"ru":["Событийно-ориентированная архитектура","Интеграция с React","Разработка полноценных приложений","Тайминг рабочих процессов","Поддержка Node.js"],"ar":["هندسة موجهة بالأحداث","التكامل مع React","التطوير كامل الطول","توقيت سير العمل","دعم Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["nestjs是什么","如何使用nestjs","nestjs与React集成","nestjs工作流管理","nestjs全栈开发","nestjs安装","nestjs教程","nestjs vs express"],"ja":["nestjsとは","nestjsの使い方","nestjsとReactの統合","nestjsワークフローマネジメント","nestjsフルスタック開発","nestjsのインストール","nestjsチュートリアル","nestjs vs express"],"ko":["nestjs是什么","nestjs 사용법","nestjs와 React 통합","nestjs 워크플로우 관리","nestjs 풀스택 개발","nestjs 설치","nestjs 튜토리얼","nestjs vs express"],"es":["Cómo usar NestJS","Qué es la arquitectura de eventos","NestJS vs Express","Instalación de NestJS","Guía de configuración de NestJS","Desarrollo de aplicaciones full-stack con NestJS"],"fr":["Comment utiliser NestJS","Qu''est-ce que l''architecture orientée événements","NestJS vs Express","Installation de NestJS","Guide de configuration de NestJS","Développement d''applications full-stack avec NestJS"],"de":["Wie man NestJS verwendet","Was ist die ereignisgesteuerte Architektur","NestJS vs Express","Installation von NestJS","Konfigurationsanleitung für NestJS","Entwicklung von Full-Stack-Anwendungen mit NestJS"],"pt":["como usar NestJS","o que é NestJS","NestJS vs Express","instalar NestJS","guias de configuração do NestJS","desenvolvimento full-stack com NestJS","arquitetura orientada a eventos com NestJS","integração com React e NestJS"],"ru":["как использовать NestJS","что такое NestJS","NestJS vs Express","установить NestJS","руководства по настройке NestJS","разработка полноценных приложений с NestJS","событийно-ориентированная архитектура с NestJS","интеграция с React и NestJS"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام NestJS","ما هو NestJS","NestJS مقابل Express","تثبيت NestJS","دليل إعداد NestJS","تطوير تطبيقات كامل الطول مع NestJS","هندسة موجهة بالأحداث مع NestJS","التكامل مع React و NestJS"]}},"owner":"proyecto26","repo":"projectx","repoPath":"proyecto26/projectx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.921Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nestjs","description":"NestJS microservices development. Use when creating controllers, services, modules, guards, interceptors, or working with NestJS patterns in auth, order, or product services.","bodyPreview":"# NestJS Microservices Development\n\n## Project Structure\n\nThis project uses NestJS for three microservices:\n- `apps/auth` - Authentication (JWT, Passport)\n- `apps/order` - Order management (integrates with Temporal)\n- `apps/product` - Product catalog\n\nShared modules are in `packages/core`.\n\n## Creating a New Module\n\n### 1. Create Module File\n\n```typescript\n// feature/feature.module.ts\nimport { Module } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { FeatureController } from ''./feature.controller'';\nimport { Feat","body":"# NestJS Microservices Development\n\n## Project Structure\n\nThis project uses NestJS for three microservices:\n- `apps/auth` - Authentication (JWT, Passport)\n- `apps/order` - Order management (integrates with Temporal)\n- `apps/product` - Product catalog\n\nShared modules are in `packages/core`.\n\n## Creating a New Module\n\n### 1. Create Module File\n\n```typescript\n// feature/feature.module.ts\nimport { Module } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { FeatureController } from ''./feature.controller'';\nimport { FeatureService } from ''./feature.service'';\n\n@Module({\n  controllers: [FeatureController],\n  providers: [FeatureService],\n  exports: [FeatureService],\n})\nexport class FeatureModule {}\n```\n\n### 2. Create Service with Repository Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// feature/feature.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { PrismaService } from ''@projectx/db'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class FeatureService {\n  constructor(private readonly prisma: PrismaService) {}\n\n  async findAll() {\n    return this.prisma.feature.findMany();\n  }\n\n  async findOne(id: string) {\n    return this.prisma.feature.findUnique({ where: { id } });\n  }\n\n  async create(data: CreateFeatureDto) {\n    return this.prisma.feature.create({ data });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Create Controller with Swagger\n\n```typescript\n// feature/feature.controller.ts\nimport { Controller, Get, Post, Body, Param } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { ApiTags, ApiOperation, ApiResponse } from ''@nestjs/swagger'';\nimport { FeatureService } from ''./feature.service'';\n\n@ApiTags(''features'')\n@Controller(''features'')\nexport class FeatureController {\n  constructor(private readonly featureService: FeatureService) {}\n\n  @Get()\n  @ApiOperation({ summary: ''Get all features'' })\n  @ApiResponse({ status: 200, description: ''Returns all features'' })\n  findAll() {\n    return this.featureService.findAll();\n  }\n\n  @Get('':id'')\n  @ApiOperation({ summary: ''Get feature by ID'' })\n  findOne(@Param(''id'') id: string) {\n    return this.featureService.findOne(id);\n  }\n\n  @Post()\n  @ApiOperation({ summary: ''Create a feature'' })\n  create(@Body() createFeatureDto: CreateFeatureDto) {\n    return this.featureService.create(createFeatureDto);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## DTOs with Validation\n\n```typescript\n// feature/dto/create-feature.dto.ts\nimport { IsString, IsNotEmpty, IsOptional } from ''class-validator'';\nimport { ApiProperty, ApiPropertyOptional } from ''@nestjs/swagger'';\n\nexport class CreateFeatureDto {\n  @ApiProperty({ description: ''Feature name'' })\n  @IsString()\n  @IsNotEmpty()\n  name: string;\n\n  @ApiPropertyOptional({ description: ''Feature description'' })\n  @IsString()\n  @IsOptional()\n  description?: string;\n}\n```\n\n## Authentication Guards\n\nUse guards from `@projectx/core`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { UseGuards } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { JwtAuthGuard } from ''@projectx/core'';\n\n@Controller(''protected'')\n@UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard)\nexport class ProtectedController {\n  // All routes require authentication\n}\n```\n\n## Exception Handling\n\n```typescript\nimport { NotFoundException, BadRequestException } from ''@nestjs/common'';\n\n// In service\nasync findOne(id: string) {\n  const item = await this.prisma.feature.findUnique({ where: { id } });\n  if (!item) {\n    throw new NotFoundException(`Feature with ID ${id} not found`);\n  }\n  return item;\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Services\n\n```typescript\nimport { Test, TestingModule } from ''@nestjs/testing'';\nimport { FeatureService } from ''./feature.service'';\nimport { PrismaService } from ''@projectx/db'';\n\ndescribe(''FeatureService'', () => {\n  let service: FeatureService;\n  let prisma: PrismaService;\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    const module: TestingModule = await Test.createTestingModule({\n      providers: [\n        FeatureService,\n        {\n          provide: PrismaService,\n          useValue: {\n            feature: {\n              findMany: jest.fn(),\n              findUnique: jest.fn(),\n              create: jest.fn(),\n            },\n          },\n        },\n      ],\n    }).compile();\n\n    service = module.get<FeatureService>(FeatureService);\n    prisma = module.get<PrismaService>(PrismaService);\n  });\n\n  it(''should be defined'', () => {\n    expect(service).toBeDefined();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Running Services\n\n```bash\n# Run specific service\npnpm dev:auth\npnpm dev:order\npnpm dev:product\n\n# Run all services\npnpm dev\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use DTOs** for request/response validation\n2. **Document with Swagger** decorators for API documentation\n3. **Use repository pattern** via Prisma services from `@projectx/db`\n4. **Handle errors** with NestJS built-in exceptions\n5. **Write tests** for services and controllers\n6. **Use guards** from `@projectx/core` for authentication\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:18.092Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents seeking to master event-driven architecture with NestJS microservices","zh":"适合于寻求掌握事件驱动架构的全栈代理，特别是使用NestJS微服务","ja":"イベント駆動アーキテクチャをマスターしたいフルスタックエージェントに最適、特にNestJSマイクロサービスを使用する場合","ko":"이벤트 驱动 아키텍처를掌握하려는 풀스택 에이전트에게 이상적이며, 특히 NestJS 마이크로 서비스를 사용하는 경우","es":"Ideal para agentes Full-Stack que buscan dominar la arquitectura orientada a eventos con microservicios de NestJS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack souhaitant maîtriser l''architecture orientée aux événements avec des microservices NestJS","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die die ereignisgesteuerte Architektur mit NestJS-Microservices meistern möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que buscam dominar a arquitetura orientada a eventos com microserviços NestJS","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, стремящихся овладеть событийно-ориентированной архитектурой с микросервисами NestJS","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتكاملين الذين يسعون لتحقيق التنظيم القائم على الأحداث مع خدمات микرو NestJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to tame full-stack chaos with Temporal workflows and React wizardry, leveraging JWT, Passport, and NestJS for authentication, order management, and product catalog integration, while utilizing shared modules and microservices architecture","zh":"赋予代理人利用Temporal工作流和React魔法来驯服全栈混乱的能力，利用JWT、Passport和NestJS进行身份验证、订单管理和产品目录集成，同时利用共享模块和微服务架构","ja":"TemporalワークフローとReactの魔法を使ってフルスタックの混沌を制御する力をエージェントに与え、JWT、Passport、NestJSを使用して認証、注文管理、製品カタログの統合を行い、共有モジュールとマイクロサービスアーキテクチャを利用する","ko":"에이전트에게 Temporal 워크플로와 React 마법을 사용하여 풀스택 혼돈을 제어하는 힘을 부여하며, JWT, Passport, NestJS를 사용하여 인증, 주문 관리, 제품 카탈로그 통합을 수행하고, 공유 모듈 및 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 활용한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para dominar el caos full-stack con flujos de trabajo Temporal y magia de React, aprovechando JWT, Passport y NestJS para la autenticación, la gestión de pedidos y la integración del catálogo de productos, mientras utiliza módulos compartidos y arquitectura de microservicios","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser le chaos full-stack avec des flux de travail Temporal et des sorts de React, en exploitant JWT, Passport et NestJS pour l''authentification, la gestion des commandes et l''intégration du catalogue de produits, tout en utilisant des modules partagés et une architecture de microservices","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Full-Stack-Chaos mit Temporal-Workflows und React-Zauberei zu bändigen, indem es JWT, Passport und NestJS für Authentifizierung, Bestellmanagement und Produktkatalogintegration nutzt, während es gemeinsam genutzte Module und Mikroservices-Architektur verwendet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a controlar o caos de pilha completa com fluxos de trabalho Temporal e magia React, utilizando JWT, Passport e NestJS para autenticação, gerenciamento de pedidos e integração de catálogo de produtos, enquanto utiliza módulos compartilhados e arquitetura de microserviços","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью укротить полнофункциональный хаос с помощью рабочих процессов Temporal и волшебства React, используя JWT, Passport и NestJS для аутентификации, управления заказами и интеграции каталога продуктов, а также использует общие модули и архитектуру микросервисов","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من ترويض الفوضى المتكامل مع سلاسل عمل Temporal وسحر React، مستخدمين JWT و Passport و NestJS للتحقق من الشخصية وإدارة الطلبات وتكامل فهرس المنتجات، بينما يستفيدون من الوحدات المشتركة وعمارة خدمات Микرو"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing scalable microservices with NestJS","Implementing authentication and authorization using JWT and Passport","Integrating Temporal workflows for efficient order management"],"zh":["使用NestJS开发可扩展的微服务","使用JWT和Passport实现身份验证和授权","将Temporal工作流集成到订单管理中"],"ja":["NestJSを使用したスケーラブルなマイクロサービスの開発","JWTとPassportを使用した認証と認可の実装","Temporalワークフローの注文管理への統合"],"ko":["NestJS를 사용하여 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스 개발","JWT와 Passport를 사용하여 인증 및 인가 구현","Temporal 워크플로의 주문 관리 통합"],"es":["Desarrollar microservicios escalables con NestJS","Implementar autenticación y autorización utilizando JWT y Passport","Integrar flujos de trabajo Temporal para una gestión de pedidos eficiente"],"fr":["Développer des microservices évolutifs avec NestJS","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation en utilisant JWT et Passport","Intégrer des flux de travail Temporal pour une gestion des commandes efficace"],"de":["Entwicklung von skalierbaren Microservices mit NestJS","Implementierung von Authentifizierung und Autorisierung unter Verwendung von JWT und Passport","Integration von Temporal-Workflows für effizientes Bestellmanagement"],"pt":["Desenvolver microserviços escaláveis com NestJS","Implementar autenticação e autorização usando JWT e Passport","Integrar fluxos de trabalho Temporal para gerenciamento eficiente de pedidos"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых микросервисов с помощью NestJS","Реализация аутентификации и авторизации с помощью JWT и Passport","Интеграция рабочих процессов Temporal для эффективного управления заказами"],"ar":["تطوير خدمات микرو قابلة للتوسيع مع NestJS","تنفيذ التحقق من الشخصية والتصريح باستخدام JWT و Passport","دمج سلاسل عمل Temporal من أجل إدارة الطلبات الفعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript and NestJS framework","Dependent on Temporal workflows for event-driven architecture","Microservices architecture may add complexity"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和NestJS框架的知识","依赖于Temporal工作流进行事件驱动架构","微服务架构可能会增加复杂性"],"ja":["TypeScriptとNestJSフレームワークの知識が必要","イベント駆動アーキテクチャにTemporalワークフローに依存","マイクロサービスアーキテクチャは複雑性を増す可能性がある"],"ko":["TypeScript와 NestJS 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","이