","Installation von oauth-integrations"],"pt":["como usar oauth-integrations","o que é Hipótese de Riemann Ética","oauth-integrations alternativa","oauth-integrations vs outros agentes","instalar oauth-integrations","guia de configuração do oauth-integrations"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент oauth-integrations","что такое Этическая Римановская Гипотеза","ИИ Агент oauth-integrations альтернатива","ИИ Агент oauth-integrations vs другие агенты","установить ИИ Агент oauth-integrations","руководство по настройке ИИ Агент oauth-integrations"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي oauth-integrations","ما هي فرضية ريمان الأخلاقية","بديل أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي oauth-integrations","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي oauth-integrations مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي oauth-integrations","دليل إعداد أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي oauth-integrations"]}},"owner":"dennislee928","repo":"Ethic-Latex","repoPath":"dennislee928/Ethic-Latex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.942Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"oauth-integrations","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authoriz","body":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}`,\n    ''User-Agent'': ''MyApp/1.0'',  // Required!\n    ''Accept'': ''application/vnd.github+json'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Private Email Handling\n\nGitHub users can set email to private (`/user` returns `email: null`).\n\n```typescript\nif (!userData.email) {\n  const emails = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user/emails'', { headers })\n    .then(r => r.json());\n  userData.email = emails.find(e => e.primary && e.verified)?.email;\n}\n```\n\nRequires `user:email` scope.\n\n### Token Exchange\n\nToken exchange returns form-encoded by default. Add Accept header for JSON:\n\n```typescript\nconst tokenResponse = await fetch(''https://github.com/login/oauth/access_token'', {\n  method: ''POST'',\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/x-www-form-urlencoded'',\n    ''Accept'': ''application/json'',  // Get JSON response\n  },\n  body: new URLSearchParams({ code, client_id, client_secret, redirect_uri }),\n});\n```\n\n### GitHub OAuth Notes\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Callback URL | Must be EXACT - no wildcards, no subdirectory matching |\n| Token exchange returns form-encoded | Add `''Accept'': ''application/json''` header |\n| Tokens don''t expire | No refresh flow needed, but revoked = full re-auth |\n\n## Microsoft Entra (Azure AD) OAuth\n\n### Why MSAL Doesn''t Work in Workers\n\nMSAL.js depends on:\n- Browser APIs (localStorage, sessionStorage, DOM)\n- Node.js crypto module\n\nCloudflare''s V8 isolate runtime has neither. Use manual OAuth instead:\n1. Manual OAuth URL construction\n2. Direct token exchange via fetch\n3. JWT validation with `jose` library\n\n### Required Scopes\n\n```typescript\n// For user identity (email, name, profile picture)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read'';\n\n// For refresh tokens (long-lived sessions)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read offline_access'';\n```\n\n**Critical**: `User.Read` is required for Microsoft Graph `/me` endpoint. Without it, token exchange succeeds but user info fetch returns 403.\n\n### User Info Endpoint\n\n```typescript\n// Microsoft Graph /me endpoint\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me'', {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}` },\n});\n\n// Email may be in different fields\nconst email = data.mail || data.userPrincipalName;\n```\n\n### Tenant Configuration\n\n| Tenant Value | Who Can Sign In |\n|--------------|-----------------|\n| `common` | Any Microsoft account (personal + work) |\n| `organizations` | Work/school accounts only |\n| `consumers` | Personal Microsoft accounts only |\n| `{tenant-id}` | Specific organization only |\n\n### Azure Portal Setup\n\n1. App Registration → New registration\n2. Platform: **Web** (not SPA) for server-side OAuth\n3. Redirect URIs: Add both `/callback` and `/admin/callback`\n4. Certificates & secrets → New client secret\n\n### Token Lifetimes\n\n| Token Type | Default Lifetime | Notes |\n|------------|------------------|-------|\n| Access token | 60-90 minutes | Configurable via token lifetime policies |\n| Refresh token | 90 days | Revoked on password change |\n| ID token | 60 minutes | Same as access token |\n\n**Best Practice**: Always request `offline_access` scope and implement refresh token flow for sessions longer than 1 hour.\n\n## Common Corrections\n\n| If Claude suggests... | Use instead... |\n|----------------------|----------------|\n| GitHub fetch without User-Agent | Add `''User-Agent'': ''AppName/1.0''` (REQUIRED) |\n| Using MSAL.js in Workers | Manual OAuth + jose for JWT validation |\n| Microsoft scope without User.Read | Add `User.Read` scope |\n| Fetching email from token claims only | Use Graph `/me` endpoint |\n\n## Error Reference\n\n### GitHub Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| 403 Forbidden | Missing User-Agent header | Add User-Agent header |\n| `email: null` | User has private email | Fetch `/user/emails` with `user:email` scope |\n\n### Microsoft Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| AADSTS50058 | Silent auth failed | Use interactive flow |\n| AADSTS700084 | Refresh token expired | Re-authenticate user |\n| 403 on Graph /me | Missing User.Read scope | Add User.Read to scopes |\n\n## Reference\n\n- GitHub API: https://docs.github.com/en/rest\n- GitHub OAuth: https://docs.github.com/en/apps/oauth-apps\n- Microsoft Graph permissions: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/permissions-reference\n- AADSTS error codes: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/reference-error-codes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:39:33.228Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Edge Runtime Agents requiring secure authentication via GitHub and Microsoft OAuth","zh":"适用于需要通过 GitHub 和 Microsoft OAuth 进行安全认证的 Edge Runtime Agents","ja":"GitHub および Microsoft OAuth を使用したセキュア認証を必要とする Edge Runtime エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth를 통한 보안 인증이 필요한 Edge Runtime 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de tiempo de ejecución de Edge que requieren autenticación segura a través de GitHub y Microsoft OAuth","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de runtime Edge nécessitant une authentification sécurisée via GitHub et Microsoft OAuth","de":"Idealerweise für Edge Runtime Agents, die eine sichere Authentifizierung über GitHub und Microsoft OAuth erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Tempo de Execução de Borda que exigem autenticação segura via GitHub e Microsoft OAuth","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов среды Edge, требующих безопасную аутентификацию через GitHub и Microsoft OAuth","ar":"مثالي لعميل تشغيل الحواف الذي يتطلب مصادقة آمنة عبر GitHub و Microsoft OAuth"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to authenticate with GitHub and Microsoft using OAuth protocols, enabling secure data access and manipulation via Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes, with required headers such as `User-Agent` and `Accept` in `application/vnd.github+json` format","zh":"赋予代理使用 OAuth 协议通过 GitHub 和 Microsoft 进行认证的能力，启用通过 Cloudflare Workers 及其他边缘运行时进行安全的数据访问和操作，需要包含 `User-Agent` 和 `Accept` 等头部信息，以 `application/vnd.github+json` 格式","ja":"エージェントが OAuth プロトコルを使用して GitHub および Microsoft で認証を行うことを可能にし、Cloudflare Workers や他のエッジ ランタイムを使用したセキュアなデータ アクセスおよび操作を実現することができます。必要なヘッダーとして `User-Agent` および `Accept` が含まれ、`application/vnd.github+json` フォーマットで","ko":"에이전트가 OAuth 프로토콜을 사용하여 GitHub 및 Microsoft에서 인증을 수행할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 Cloudflare Workers 및 기타 에지 런타임을 사용한 보안 데이터 액세스 및 조작을 가능하게 하며, `User-Agent` 및 `Accept`와 같은 필수 헤더가 포함되며 `application/vnd.github+json` 형식으로","es":"Habilita a los agentes a autenticarse con GitHub y Microsoft utilizando protocolos OAuth, lo que permite el acceso y la manipulación de datos seguros a través de Cloudflare Workers y otros entornos de ejecución de Edge, con encabezados requeridos como `User-Agent` y `Accept` en formato `application/vnd.github+json`","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''authentifier auprès de GitHub et Microsoft en utilisant les protocoles OAuth, ce qui permet un accès et une manipulation de données sécurisés via Cloudflare Workers et d''autres environnements de runtime de Edge, avec des en-têtes requis tels que `User-Agent` et `Accept` au format `application/vnd.github+json`","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sich bei GitHub und Microsoft mithilfe von OAuth-Protokollen zu authentifizieren, wodurch sicherer Datenzugriff und -manipulation über Cloudflare Workers und andere Edge-Laufzeiten ermöglicht werden, mit erforderlichen Headern wie `User-Agent` und `Accept` im `application/vnd.github+json`-Format","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se autenticarem com o GitHub e a Microsoft usando protocolos OAuth, permitindo o acesso e manipulação de dados seguros por meio de Cloudflare Workers e outras execuções de borda, com cabeçalhos necessários como `User-Agent` e `Accept` no formato `application/vnd.github+json`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью аутентифицироваться с GitHub и Microsoft с помощью протоколов OAuth, обеспечивая безопасный доступ и манипулирование данными через Cloudflare Workers и другие среды Edge, с необходимыми заголовками, такими как `User-Agent` и `Accept`, в формате `application/vnd.github+json`","ar":"تمكين العميل من المصادقة مع GitHub و Microsoft باستخدام بروتوكولات OAuth، وتمكين الوصول الآمن وتعديل البيانات من خلال Cloudflare Workers وتنفيذات الحواف الأخرى، مع رؤوس مطلوبة مثل `User-Agent` و `Accept` بالتنسيق `application/vnd.github+json`"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing GitHub OAuth for edge environment authentication","Authenticating Microsoft services using OAuth in Cloudflare Workers","Handling required headers for GitHub API requests"],"zh":["边缘环境中实现 GitHub OAuth 认证","在 Cloudflare Workers 中使用 OAuth 认证 Microsoft 服务","处理 GitHub API 请求的必需头部信息"],"ja":["エッジ環境での GitHub OAuth 認証の実装","Cloudflare Workers での OAuth を使用した Microsoft サービスの認証","GitHub API リクエストの必須ヘッダーを処理"],"ko":["에지 환경에서 GitHub OAuth 인증을 구현","Cloudflare Workers에서 OAuth를 사용하여 Microsoft 서비스를 인증","GitHub API 요청의 필수 헤더를 처리"],"es":["Implementar GitHub OAuth para la autenticación del entorno de Edge","Autenticar servicios de Microsoft mediante OAuth en Cloudflare Workers","Controlar los encabezados requeridos para las solicitudes de la API de GitHub"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre GitHub OAuth pour l''authentification de l''environnement Edge","Authentifier les services Microsoft à l''aide d''OAuth dans Cloudflare Workers","Gérer les en-têtes requis pour les demandes d''API GitHub"],"de":["Implementierung von GitHub OAuth für die Authentifizierung der Edge-Umgebung","Authentifizierung von Microsoft-Diensten mithilfe von OAuth in Cloudflare Workers","Verwaltung der erforderlichen Header für GitHub-API-Anfragen"],"pt":["Implementação do OAuth do GitHub para autenticação de ambiente de borda","Autenticação de serviços da Microsoft usando OAuth no Cloudflare Workers","Manipulação de cabeçalhos necessários para solicitações de API do GitHub"],"ru":["Реализация OAuth GitHub для аутентификации среды Edge","Аутентификация сервисов Microsoft с помощью OAuth в Cloudflare Workers","Обработка необходимых заголовков для запросов к API GitHub"],"ar":["تنفيذ OAuth من GitHub للمصادقة في بيئة الحواف","المصادقة على خدمات Microsoft باستخدام OAuth في Cloudflare Workers","معالجة الرؤوس المطلوبة لطلبات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific header requirements for GitHub API","Limited to GitHub and Microsoft OAuth implementations","Dependent on Cloudflare Workers or other edge runtimes"],"zh":["需要特定的 GitHub API 头部要求","仅限 GitHub 和 Microsoft OAuth 实现","依赖于 Cloudflare Workers 或其他边缘运行时"],"ja":["GitHub API には特定のヘッダー要件が必要","GitHub および Microsoft OAuth の実装のみ","Cloudflare Workers またはその他のエッジ ランタイムに依存"],"ko":["GitHub API에는 특정 헤더 요구 사항이 필요","GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth 구현만","Cloudflare Workers 또는 기타 에지 런타임에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de encabezado específicos para la API de GitHub","Limitado a implementaciones de OAuth de GitHub y Microsoft","Dependiente de Cloudflare Workers u otros entornos de ejecución de Edge"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences d''en-tête spécifiques pour l''API GitHub","Limité aux implémentations OAuth de GitHub et Microsoft","Dépendant de Cloudflare Workers ou d''autres environnements de runtime de Edge"],"de":["Erfordert spezifische Header-Anforderungen für die GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf OAuth-Implementierungen von GitHub und Microsoft","Abhängig von Cloudflare Workers oder anderen Edge-Laufzeiten"],"pt":["Exige requisitos de cabeçalho específicos para a API do GitHub","Limitado às implementações do OAuth do GitHub e da Microsoft","Dependente de Cloudflare Workers ou outras execuções de borda"],"ru":["Требует специфических требований к заголовкам для API GitHub","Ограничен реализациями OAuth GitHub и Microsoft","Зависит от Cloudflare Workers или других сред Edge"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات رأس محددة لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","محدود بالتنفيذات OAuth من GitHub و Microsoft","يعتمد على Cloudflare Workers أو تنفيذات الحواف الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"75affa91dcec597c0b04ac93e5d3f91aa4ff91a3e266deacc2d61f8e537021fa","qualityScore":33}');
