turing autonomous Tambo agents, Model Context ..."},"definition":{"en":"The Agentic Generative UI Platform: Transform natural language into production-ready React apps in seconds. Featuring autonomous Tambo agents, Model Context Protocol (MCP) for codebase grounding, and secure E2B sandboxed execution."},"features":{"zh":["自治的Tambo代理","安全的E2B沙盒执行","Model Context Protocol（MCP）","生产就绪的React应用","自然语言转换","快速开发"],"ja":["自律的なTamboエージェント","安全なE2Bサンドボックス実行","Model Context Protocol（MCP）","プロダクションレディのReactアプリ","自然言語変換","迅速な開発"],"ko":["자율적인 Tambo 에이전트","안전한 E2B 샌드박스 실행","Model Context Protocol（MCP）","생산 준비된 React 애플리케이션","자연어 변환","迅速한 개발"],"es":["Transformación de lenguaje natural en aplicaciones de React","Ejecución sandboxed segura","Protocolo de contexto de modelo (MCP) para anclaje de código","Agents Tambo autónomos","Creación de wrappers personalizados"],"fr":["Transformation de langage naturel en applications React","Exécution sandboxed sécurisée","Protocole de contexte de modèle (MCP) pour ancrage de code","Agents Tambo autonomes","Création de wrappers stylisés"],"de":["Umwandlung von natürlicher Sprache in React-Anwendungen","Sichere sandboxed-Ausführung","Modell-Kontext-Protokoll (MCP) für Code-Anker","Autonome Tambo-Agents","Erstellung von gestylten Wrappern"],"pt":["Transforme linguagem natural em aplicativos React de produção em segundos","Tambo agents para execução autônoma","Model Context Protocol para codebase grounding","Secure E2B sandboxed execution"],"ru":["Transforme linguagem natural em aplicativos React de produção em segundos","Tambo agents para execução autônoma","Model Context Protocol para codebase grounding","Secure E2B sandboxed execution"],"ar":["Transforme linguagem natural em aplicativos React de produção em segundos","Tambo agents para execução autônoma","Model Context Protocol para codebase grounding","Secure E2B sandboxed execution"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","React应用开发","自然语言转换","Agentic Generative UI Platform","Tambo代理","E2B沙盒执行","Model Context Protocol","创建样式包装器","快速开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Reactアプリ開発","自然言語変換","Agentic Generative UI Platform","Tamboエージェント","E2Bサンドボックス実行","Model Context Protocol","スタイルラッパーの作成","迅速な開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","React 애플리케이션 개발","자연어 변환","Agentic Generative UI Platform","Tambo 에이전트","E2B 샌드박스 실행","Model Context Protocol","스타일 래퍼 생성","迅速한 개발"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a Agentic","Agentic vs competidores","instalación de Agentic","guía de configuración de Agentic","desarrollo de aplicaciones de React con agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternatives à Agentic","Agentic vs concurrents","installation d''Agentic","guide de configuration d''Agentic","développement d''applications React avec des agents IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Agentic","Agentic vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Agentic","Konfigurationsanleitung für Agentic","Entwicklung von React-Anwendungen mit KI-Agents"],"pt":["criar wrappers estilosos","agentic generative ui","react aplicativos","tambo agents","model context protocol","secure e2b sandboxed execution"],"ru":["создать стильные обертки","агентик генеративный.ui","реакт приложения","тамбо агенты","модель контекстный протокол","безопасное е2б sandboxed execution"],"ar":["إنشاءWrappers Styled","agentic generative ui","react تطبيقات","tambo agents","model context protocol","secure e2b sandboxed execution"]}},"owner":"Sri-Krishna-V","repo":"Derived-WMD","repoPath":"Sri-Krishna-V/Derived-WMD","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.985Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"creating-styled-wrappers","description":"Creates styled wrapper components that compose headless/base compound components. Use when refactoring styled components to use base primitives, implementing opinionated design systems on top of headless components, or when the user mentions use base components, compose primitives, styled wrapper, or refactor to use base.","bodyPreview":"# Styling Compound Wrappers\n\nCreate styled wrapper components that compose headless base compound components. This skill complements `building-compound-components` (which builds the base primitives) by focusing on **how to properly consume and wrap them** with styling and additional behavior.\n\n**Real-world example**: See [references/real-world-example.md](references/real-world-example.md) for a complete before/after MessageInput refactoring.\n\n## Core Principle: Compose, Don''t Duplicate\n\nStyled w","body":"# Styling Compound Wrappers\n\nCreate styled wrapper components that compose headless base compound components. This skill complements `building-compound-components` (which builds the base primitives) by focusing on **how to properly consume and wrap them** with styling and additional behavior.\n\n**Real-world example**: See [references/real-world-example.md](references/real-world-example.md) for a complete before/after MessageInput refactoring.\n\n## Core Principle: Compose, Don''t Duplicate\n\nStyled wrappers should **compose** base components, not **re-implement** their logic.\n\n```tsx\n// WRONG - re-implementing what base already does\nconst StyledInput = ({ children, className }) => {\n  const { value, setValue, submit } = useTamboThreadInput(); // Duplicated!\n  const [isDragging, setIsDragging] = useState(false); // Duplicated!\n  const handleDrop = useCallback(/* ... */); // Duplicated!\n\n  return (\n    <form onDrop={handleDrop} className={className}>\n      {children}\n    </form>\n  );\n};\n\n// CORRECT - compose the base component\nconst StyledInput = ({ children, className, variant }) => {\n  return (\n    <BaseInput.Root className={cn(inputVariants({ variant }), className)}>\n      <BaseInput.Content className=\"rounded-xl data-[dragging]:border-dashed\">\n        {children}\n      </BaseInput.Content>\n    </BaseInput.Root>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n## Refactoring Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nStyled Wrapper Refactoring:\n- [ ] Step 1: Identify duplicated logic\n- [ ] Step 2: Import base components\n- [ ] Step 3: Wrap with Base Root\n- [ ] Step 4: Apply state-based styling and behavior\n- [ ] Step 5: Wrap sub-components with styling\n- [ ] Step 6: Final verification\n```\n\n### Step 1: Identify Duplicated Logic\n\nLook for patterns that indicate logic should come from base:\n\n- SDK hooks (`useTamboThread`, `useTamboThreadInput`, etc.)\n- Context creation (`React.createContext`)\n- State management that mirrors base component state\n- Event handlers (drag, submit, etc.) that base components handle\n\n### Step 2: Import Base Components\n\n```tsx\nimport { MessageInput as MessageInputBase } from \"@tambo-ai/react-ui-base/message-input\";\n```\n\n### Step 3: Wrap with Base Root\n\nReplace custom context/state management with the base Root:\n\n```tsx\n// Before\nconst MessageInput = ({ children, variant }) => {\n  return (\n    <MessageInputInternal variant={variant}>{children}</MessageInputInternal>\n  );\n};\n\n// After\nconst MessageInput = ({ children, variant, className }) => {\n  return (\n    <MessageInputBase.Root className={cn(variants({ variant }), className)}>\n      {children}\n    </MessageInputBase.Root>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n### Step 4: Apply State-Based Styling and Behavior\n\nState access follows a hierarchy — use the simplest option that works:\n\n1. **Data attributes** (preferred for styling) — base components expose `data-*` attributes\n2. **Render props** (for behavior changes) — use when rendering different components\n3. **Context hooks** (for sub-components) — OK for styled sub-components needing deep context access\n\n```tsx\n// BEST - data-* classes for styling, render props only for behavior\n// Note: use `data-[dragging]:*` syntax (v3-compatible), not `data-dragging:*` (v4 only)\nconst StyledContent = ({ children }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.Content\n    className={cn(\n      \"group rounded-xl border\",\n      \"data-[dragging]:border-dashed data-[dragging]:border-emerald-400\",\n    )}\n  >\n    {({ elicitation, resolveElicitation }) => (\n      <>\n        {/* Drop overlay uses group-data-* for styling */}\n        <div className=\"hidden group-data-[dragging]:flex absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-50/90\">\n          <p>Drop files here</p>\n        </div>\n\n        {elicitation ? (\n          <ElicitationUI\n            request={elicitation}\n            onResponse={resolveElicitation}\n          />\n        ) : (\n          children\n        )}\n      </>\n    )}\n  </BaseComponent.Content>\n);\n\n// OK - styled sub-components can use context hook for deep access\nconst StyledTextarea = ({ placeholder }) => {\n  const { value, setValue, handleSubmit, editorRef } = useMessageInputContext();\n  return (\n    <CustomEditor\n      ref={editorRef}\n      value={value}\n      onChange={setValue}\n      onSubmit={handleSubmit}\n      placeholder={placeholder}\n    />\n  );\n};\n```\n\n**When to use context hooks vs render props:**\n\n- Render props: when the parent wrapper needs state for behavior changes\n- Context hooks: when a styled sub-component needs values not exposed via render props\n\n### Step 5: Wrap Sub-Components\n\n```tsx\n// Submit button\nconst SubmitButton = ({ className, children }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.SubmitButton className={cn(\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg\", className)}>\n    {({ showCancelButton }) =>\n      children ?? (showCancelButton ? <Square /> : <ArrowUp />)\n    }\n  </BaseComponent.SubmitButton>\n);\n\n// Error\nconst Error = ({ className }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.Error className={cn(\"text-sm text-destructive\", className)} />\n);\n\n// Staged images - base pre-computes props array, just iterate\nconst StagedImages = ({ className }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.StagedImages className={cn(\"flex gap-2\", className)}>\n    {({ images }) =>\n      images.map((imageProps) => (\n        <ImageBadge key={imageProps.image.id} {...imageProps} />\n      ))\n    }\n  </BaseComponent.StagedImages>\n);\n```\n\n### Step 6: Final Verification\n\n```\nFinal Checks:\n- [ ] No duplicate context creation\n- [ ] No duplicate SDK hooks in root wrappers\n- [ ] No duplicate state management or event handlers\n- [ ] Base namespace imported and `Base.Root` used as wrapper\n- [ ] `data-*` classes used for styling (with `group-data-*` for children)\n- [ ] Render props used only for rendering behavior changes\n- [ ] Base sub-components wrapped with styling\n- [ ] Icon factories passed from styled layer to base hooks\n- [ ] Visual sub-components and CSS variants stay in styled layer\n```\n\n## What Belongs in Styled Layer\n\n### Icon Factories\n\nWhen base hooks need icons, pass a factory function:\n\n```tsx\n// Base hook accepts optional icon factory\nexport function useCombinedResourceList(\n  providers: ResourceProvider[] | undefined,\n  search: string,\n  createMcpIcon?: (serverName: string) => React.ReactNode,\n) {\n  /* ... */\n}\n\n// Styled layer provides the factory\nconst resources = useCombinedResourceList(providers, search, (serverName) => (\n  <McpServerIcon name={serverName} className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n));\n```\n\n### CSS Variants\n\n```tsx\nconst inputVariants = cva(\"w-full\", {\n  variants: {\n    variant: {\n      default: \"\",\n      solid: \"[&>div]:shadow-xl [&>div]:ring-1\",\n      bordered: \"[&>div]:border-2\",\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Layout Logic, Visual Sub-Components, Custom Data Fetching\n\nThese all stay in the styled layer. Base handles behavior; styled handles presentation.\n\n## Type Handling\n\nHandle ref type differences between base and styled components:\n\n```tsx\n// Base context may have RefObject<T | null>\n// Styled component may need RefObject<T>\n<TextEditor ref={editorRef as React.RefObject<TamboEditor>} />\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Re-implementing base logic** - if base handles it, compose it\n- **Using render props for styling** - prefer `data-*` classes; render props are for behavior changes\n- **Duplicating context in wrapper** - use base Root which provides context\n- **Hardcoding icons in base hooks** - use factory functions to keep styling in styled layer\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:59:45.124Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React component styling and composition capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级React组件样式和组合能力的前端代理。","ja":"Reactコンポーネントの高度なスタイリングと組み合わせ機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 React 컴포넌트 스타일링 및 조합 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de estilo y composición avanzadas de componentes React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de style et de composition avancées de composants React.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte React-Komponenten-Styling- und Kompositions-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades avançadas de estilização e composição de componentes React.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности стилизации и составления компонентов React.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتنسيق وتأليف مكونات React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create styled wrapper components that compose headless base compound components, utilizing Model Context Protocol (MCP) for codebase grounding and secure E2B sandboxed execution, all while following the core principle of Compose, Don''t Duplicate.","zh":"赋予代理创建样式化包装组件的能力，这些组件组合了无头基础复合组件，利用模型上下文协议（MCP）进行代码库接地和安全的E2B沙盒执行，同时遵循组合，不重复的核心原则。","ja":"ヘッドレスベースコンポウンドコンポーネントを組み合わせてスタイル化されたラッパーコンポーネントを作成するエージェントを可能にし、コードベースの接地と安全なE2Bサンドボックス実行のためにモデルコンテキストプロトコル（MCP）を使用し、組み合わせる、複製しないというコア原則に従う.","ko":"헤드리스 기반 컴파운드 컴포넌트를 조합하여 스타일링된 래퍼 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 코드베이스의 접지와 안전한 E2B 샌드박스 실행을 위해 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜(MCP)을 사용하며, 조합하고 복제하지 않는 핵심 원칙을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de wrapper con estilo que componen componentes base compuestos sin cabeza, utilizando el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP) para la base del código y la ejecución segura en sandbox E2B, siguiendo siempre el principio básico de Componer, no Duplicar.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants de wrapper stylisés qui composent des composants de base sans tête, en utilisant le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle (MCP) pour l''ancrage du codebase et l''exécution sécurisée en sandbox E2B, tout en suivant le principe de base Compose, Don''t Duplicate.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gestylte Wrapper-Komponenten zu erstellen, die headless Basis-Verbundkomponenten komponieren, unter Verwendung des Model Context Protokolls (MCP) für die Codebasis und die sichere E2B-Sandbox-Ausführung, während sie immer dem Kernprinzip Compose, Don''t Duplicate folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes de wrapper estilizados que compõem componentes compostos base headless, utilizando o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP) para fundamentação do código e execução segura em sandbox E2B, seguindo sempre o princípio central de Compor, Não Duplicar.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать стилизованные компоненты-оболочки, которые составляют головные базовые составные компоненты, используя Протокол контекста модели (MCP) для основы кода и безопасного выполнения в песочнице E2B, следуя основному принципу «Составлять, а не дублировать».","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات غلاف مميزة تؤلف مكونات مركبة قاعدة رأسية، باستخدام بروتوكول سياق النموذج (MCP) لتأسيس القاعدة والتنفيذ الآمن في حقل رمل E2B، مع اتباع المبدأ الأساسي التكوين ولا التكرار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the creation of production-ready React apps with styled wrappers","Generating reusable UI components with custom styling and behavior","Refactoring existing components to improve maintainability and reusability"],"zh":["自动创建带有样式化包装器的生产就绪React应用","生成具有自定义样式和行为的可重用UI组件","重构现有组件以提高可维护性和可重用性"],"ja":["スタイル化されたラッパーを備えた生産準備完了のReactアプリを自動的に作成する","カスタムスタイリングと動作を持つ再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを生成する","既存のコンポーネントをリファクタリングして保守性と再利用性を向上させる"],"ko":["스타일링된 래퍼가 있는 생산 준비 완료 React 애플리케이션을 자동으로 생성하는 것","사용자 정의 스타일링 및 동작을 갖춘 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","기존 컴포넌트를 리팩토링하여 유지보수성 및 재사용성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de aplicaciones React de producción con wrappers con estilo","Generar componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables con estilo y comportamiento personalizados","Reestructurar componentes existentes para mejorar la mantenibilidad y la reutilización"],"fr":["Automatiser la création d''applications React de production avec des wrappers stylisés","Générer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables avec un style et un comportement personnalisés","Réorganiser les composants existants pour améliorer la maintenabilité et la réutilisation"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Produktions-React-Apps mit gestylten Wrappern","Generieren wiederverwendbarer Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit benutzerdefiniertem Stil und Verhalten","Umstrukturieren bestehender Komponenten, um die Wartbarkeit und Wiederverwendbarkeit zu verbessern"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de aplicativos React de produção prontos com wrappers estilizados","Gerar componentes de interface do usuário reutilizáveis com estilização e comportamento personalizados","Reestruturar componentes existentes para melhorar a manutenibilidade e reutilização"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание готовых к производству приложений React с стилизованными оболочками","Генерировать многократно используемые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с индивидуальной стилизацией и поведением","Перестраивать существующие компоненты для улучшения поддерживаемости и многократного использования"],"ar":["تحسين processo自动 لإنشاء تطبيقات React جاهزة للإنتاج مع غلاف مميز","توليد مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع تنسيق وتعديل سلوك مخصص","إعادة هيكلة المكونات الحالية لتحسين الصيانة وإعادة الاستخدام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and JavaScript","Dependent on the Agentic Generative UI Platform for autonomous Tambo agents and MCP"],"zh":["需要React和JavaScript的知识","依赖于Agentic Generative UI Platform用于自主Tambo代理和MCP"],"ja":["ReactとJavaScriptの知識が必要","Agentic Generative UI Platformに依存して自主的なTamboエージェントとMCPを実現"],"ko":["React 및 JavaScript에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","자율적인 Tambo 에이전트 및 MCP를 구현하기 위해 Agentic Generative UI Platform에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y JavaScript","Dependiente de la Plataforma de interfaz de usuario generativa Agentic para agentes autónomos Tambo y MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et JavaScript","Dépend de la Plateforme d''interface utilisateur générative Agentic pour les agents autonomes Tambo et MCP"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und JavaScript","Abhängig von der Agentic Generative UI-Plattform für autonome Tambo-Agents und MCP"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e JavaScript","Depende da Plataforma de IU Generativa Agentic para agentes autônomos Tambo e MCP"],"ru":["Требует знания React и JavaScript","Зависит от Платформы генерации пользовательского интерфейса Agentic для автономных агентов Tambo и MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و JavaScript","يعتمد على منصة واجهة المستخدم التوليدية Agentic للوكلاء التامبو المستقلين و MCP"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8eb4257714e267203adf3de0f94b836fcd492c3d4a1f9779e75943e9d5c88b7f","qualityScore":33}');
