ncil-context"],"de":["wie man llm-council-context verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu llm-council-context","llm-council-context vs andere KI-Agents","Installation von llm-council-context","Konfigurationsanleitung für llm-council-context","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit llm-council-context"],"pt":["como usar llm-council-context","o que é llm-council-context","ferramentas de ia","alternativas ao llm-council-context","llm-council-context vs outros agentes de ia","instalação do llm-council-context","guias de configuração do llm-council-context"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент llm-council-context","что такое ИИ Агент llm-council-context","инструменты ИИ","альтернативы ИИ Агенту llm-council-context","ИИ Агент llm-council-context vs другие агенты ИИ","установка ИИ Агента llm-council-context","руководства по настройке ИИ Агента llm-council-context"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام عامل الذكاء الاصطناعي llm-council-context","ما هو عامل الذكاء الاصطناعي llm-council-context","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات عامل الذكاء الاصطناعي llm-council-context","عامل الذكاء الاصطناعي llm-council-context مقابل عوامل الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت عامل الذكاء الاصطناعي llm-council-context","دلائل إعداد عامل الذكاء الاصطناعي llm-council-context"]}},"owner":"Schwartz10","repo":"llm-council-mcp","repoPath":"Schwartz10/llm-council-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.985Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llm-council-context","description":"Guidance for crafting high-quality context when using the consult_llm_council MCP tool. Use when a user wants help preparing context, summarizing files, or structuring prompts for council consultations.","bodyPreview":"# LLM Council Context Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nProvide concise, high-signal context for `consult_llm_council` requests. This skill focuses on context budgeting, structuring information, and avoiding truncation or irrelevant details.\n\n## Core Guidance\n\n- Prefer a short, structured summary over raw dumps.\n- Lead with the goal and constraints.\n- Include only the most relevant excerpts.\n- Reserve budget for the model response.\n\n## Model Selection Flow\n\nIf the user requests a specific model (e.g., \"use Cl","body":"# LLM Council Context Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nProvide concise, high-signal context for `consult_llm_council` requests. This skill focuses on context budgeting, structuring information, and avoiding truncation or irrelevant details.\n\n## Core Guidance\n\n- Prefer a short, structured summary over raw dumps.\n- Lead with the goal and constraints.\n- Include only the most relevant excerpts.\n- Reserve budget for the model response.\n\n## Model Selection Flow\n\nIf the user requests a specific model (e.g., \"use Claude\" or \"use Anthropic\"), translate that intent into the `models` array for `consult_llm_council`.\n\nWhen model names are uncertain, use this flow:\n1. Call `list_models` to retrieve the exact available model names.\n2. Pass one or more returned names to `consult_llm_council` via the `models` parameter.\n\nThis avoids guessing and ensures the server accepts the model selection.\n\n## Recommended Brief\n\nUse a concise schema for repeatable structure:\n\n```typescript\ninterface ContextBrief {\n  goal: string;\n  constraints: string[];\n  relevant_facts: string[];\n  avoid: string[];\n}\n```\n\n## When To Load The Reference Guide\n\nOpen `references/CONTEXT_GUIDE.md` when:\n\n- The user asks how to share context or what to include\n- You need concrete examples (code review, PR review, architecture decision, bug fix, feature request)\n- You need truncation/budget examples or provider context limits\n\n## How To Use This Skill\n\n1. Gather the user’s goal, constraints, and the minimal relevant facts.\n2. Propose a concise ContextBrief if none is provided.\n3. Suggest what to omit or summarize to stay within budget.\n4. If the context is large, include a short summary + targeted excerpts.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `references/CONTEXT_GUIDE.md`: Full context-sharing guide with budgets, truncation examples, and scenario templates.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:59:45.976Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing efficient multi-model decision outsourcing and persistent memory management.","zh":"适合需要高效多模型决策外包和持久内存管理的高级AI代理。","ja":"高効率のマルチモデルの意思決定アウトソーシングと持続的なメモリ管理を必要とする高度なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"효율적인 멀티 모델 의사 결정 아웃소싱과 지속적인 메모리 관리가 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial avanzados que requieren una externalización de decisiones de multi-modelo eficiente y una gestión de memoria persistente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle avancés nécessitant une externalisation de décision multi-modèle efficace et une gestion de mémoire persistante.","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents, die eine effiziente Outsourcing von Multi-Modell-Entscheidungen und eine persistente Speicherung von Daten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de outsourcing de decisão de multi-modelo eficiente e gerenciamento de memória persistente.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым требуется эффективный аутсорсинг принятия решений на основе нескольких моделей и управление постоянной памятью.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى外_malloc قرارات متعدد النماذج وفعالة وإدارة الذاكرة الثابتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide concise, high-signal context for consult_llm_council requests, leveraging context budgeting, structuring information, and avoiding truncation or irrelevant details with protocols like model selection flow.","zh":"赋予代理提供简洁的、高信号的上下文以用于consult_llm_council请求，利用上下文预算、信息结构化以及避免截断或不相关的细节，使用模型选择流等协议。","ja":"エージェントに、consult_llm_councilリクエスト用の簡潔で、高信号のコンテキストを提供する能力を与え、コンテキスト予算、情報構造化、およびトランケーションや無関係な詳細を回避するプロトコル（モデル選択フローなど）を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 consult_llm_council 요청을 위해 간결하고 높은 신호의 문맥을 제공할 수 있도록 하며, 문맥 예산, 정보 구조화 및 모델 선택 흐름과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 트렁케이션 또는 관련 없는 세부 정보를 피하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar un contexto conciso y de alta señal de información para solicitudes de consult_llm_council, aprovechando el presupuesto de contexto, la estructuración de la información y evitando la truncación o detalles irrelevantes con protocolos como el flujo de selección de modelos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir un contexte concis et à haute teneur en informations pour les demandes de consult_llm_council, en exploitant le budget de contexte, la structuration des informations et en évitant la troncation ou les détails non pertinents avec des protocoles tels que le flux de sélection de modèles.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, präzise und hochwertige Kontextinformationen für Anfragen von consult_llm_council bereitzustellen, indem sie den Kontextbudget, die Strukturierung von Informationen und die Vermeidung von Trunkierung oder irrelevante Details mit Protokollen wie dem Model Selection Flow nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer contexto conciso e de alta intensidade para solicitações de consult_llm_council, aproveitando o orçamento de contexto, estruturando informações e evitando truncamento ou detalhes irrelevantes com protocolos como fluxo de seleção de modelo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью предоставлять краткий и высокоинформативный контекст для запросов consult_llm_council, используя бюджет контекста, структурируя информацию и избегая обрезания или ненужных деталей с помощью протоколов, таких как поток выбора модели.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تقديم سياق متكثف وعالية الإشارة لطلبات consult_llm_council، مستفيدة من ميزانية السياق، وهيكلة المعلومات، وتجنب القطع أو التفاصيل غير ذات الصلة بروتوكولات مثل تدفق اختيار النموذج."},"useCases":{"en":["Outsourcing decisions to a multi-member AI council","Structuring information for efficient model requests","Avoiding context truncation in large datasets"],"zh":["将决策外包给多成员AI委员会","为高效模型请求结构化信息","在大型数据集中避免上下文截断"],"ja":["多メンバーAI委員会への意思決定アウトソーシング","効率的なモデルリクエストのための情報構造化","大規模データセットでのコンテキストトランケーションの回避"],"ko":["다회원 AI위원회에 대한 의사 결정 아웃소싱","효율적인 모델 요청을 위한 정보 구조화","대규모 데이터 세트에서 문맥 트렁케이션 피하기"],"es":["Externalización de decisiones a un consejo de inteligencia artificial de varios miembros","Estructuración de la información para solicitudes de modelo eficientes","Evitación de la truncación de contexto en grandes conjuntos de datos"],"fr":["Externalisation de décisions à un conseil d''intelligence artificielle à plusieurs membres","Structuration des informations pour des demandes de modèle efficaces","Évitement de la troncation de contexte dans les grands ensembles de données"],"de":["Outsourcing von Entscheidungen an einen mehrköpfigen KI-Rat","Strukturierung von Informationen für effiziente Modellanfragen","Vermeidung von Kontext-Trunkierung in großen Datenmengen"],"pt":["Terceirização de decisões para um conselho de IA de vários membros","Estruturando informações para solicitações de modelo eficientes","Evitando truncamento de contexto em grandes conjuntos de dados"],"ru":["Аутсорсинг решений в совет ИИ с несколькими членами","Структуризация информации для эффективных запросов модели","Избежание обрезания контекста в больших наборах данных"],"ar":["التعاقد مع مجلس ذكاء اصطناعي متعددي الأعضاء للاستفادة من القرارات","هيكلة المعلومات لطلبات النموذج الفعالة","تجنب قص السياق في مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires persistent memory for context storage","Dependent on specific model availability for consult_llm_council requests"],"zh":["需要持久内存用于上下文存储","依赖于特定模型的可用性用于consult_llm_council请求"],"ja":["コンテキストストレージ用の持続的なメモリが必要","consult_llm_councilリクエスト用の特定のモデル可用性への依存"],"ko":["문맥 저장소에 대한 지속적인 메모리가 필요","consult_llm_council 요청에 대한 특정 모델 가용성에 대한 의존"],"es":["Requiere memoria persistente para el almacenamiento de contexto","Dependiente de la disponibilidad específica de modelos para solicitudes de consult_llm_council"],"fr":["Nécessite une mémoire persistante pour le stockage de contexte","Dépendante de la disponibilité spécifique de modèles pour les demandes de consult_llm_council"],"de":["Benötigt persistente Speicher für Kontextspeicherung","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit spezifischer Modelle für consult_llm_council-Anfragen"],"pt":["Requer memória persistente para armazenamento de contexto","Dependente da disponibilidade de modelos específicos para solicitações de consult_llm_council"],"ru":["Требует постоянной памяти для хранения контекста","Зависит от наличия конкретных моделей для запросов consult_llm_council"],"ar":["يتطلب ذاكرة ثابتة لتخزين السياق","يعتمد على توافر نماذج محددة لطلبات consult_llm_council"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2efe2adf448fcd9ac47ff175e94e9f8d6d05bb434deaf41cc9828c7bd4b55e0f","qualityScore":33}');
