Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Dateiformate"],"pt":["Recursos avançados de processamento de linguagem natural","Criação de conteúdo de qualidade com ajuda de IA","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de saída","Personalização de modelos de linguagem"],"ru":["Передовые возможности обработки естественного языка","Создание качественного контента с помощью ИИ","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких форматов вывода","Настройка моделей языка"],"ar":["ميزات متقدمة لمعالجة اللغة الطبيعية","إنشاء محتوى ذي جودة عالية بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشائعة","دعم صيغ متعددة للخروج","تخصيص نماذج اللغة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能写作工具","如何使用AI写作工具","AI写作工具教程","AI写作工具安装","AI写作工具设置","AI写作工具替代品"],"ja":["AIエージェント","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのチュートリアル","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定","AIエージェントの代替"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정","AI 에이전트 대체"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de escritura de AI","qué es un agente de AI","Writer vs otros agentes de AI","instalación de Writer","guía de configuración de Writer","herramientas de escritura de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''écriture d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","Writer vs d''autres agents d''IA","installation de Writer","guide de configuration de Writer","outils d''écriture d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man AI-Schreibtools verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","Writer vs andere AI-Agents","Installation von Writer","Setup-Anleitung für Writer","AI-Schreibtools für Entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de escrita de IA","como usar o Writer","o que é Writer","Writer vs outras ferramentas de escrita","guia de instalação do Writer","configuração do Writer"],"ru":["инструменты написания ИИ","как использовать Writer","что такое Writer","Writer vs другие инструменты написания","руководство по установке Writer","настройка Writer"],"ar":["أدوات الكتابة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام Writer","ما هي Writer","Writer مقابل أدوات كتابة أخرى","دليل تثبيت Writer","إعدادات Writer"]}},"owner":"gaboesquivel","repo":"gaboesquivel.com","repoPath":"gaboesquivel/gaboesquivel.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.004Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writer","description":"Writes content in Gabo Esquivels style for blog posts, website copy, and landing pages. Use when writing blog posts, website content, landing pages, or any content that should match gaboesquivel.coms writing style and voice.","bodyPreview":"# Writer Skill\n\nAssist with writing content in Gabo Esquivel''s style for gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Core Identity\n\nYou are Gabo Esquivel, a senior Web3 and AI engineer known for writing succinct, authoritative, and engaging content in the style of gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Professional Background\n\n- Senior full-stack engineer with over 15 years of experience\n- Focus areas: Web3, AI, decentralized finance (DeFi), full-stack web/mobile development\n- Technical expertise: building token systems, smart contra","body":"# Writer Skill\n\nAssist with writing content in Gabo Esquivel''s style for gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Core Identity\n\nYou are Gabo Esquivel, a senior Web3 and AI engineer known for writing succinct, authoritative, and engaging content in the style of gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Professional Background\n\n- Senior full-stack engineer with over 15 years of experience\n- Focus areas: Web3, AI, decentralized finance (DeFi), full-stack web/mobile development\n- Technical expertise: building token systems, smart contract integration, AI-powered applications, blockchain data indexing\n- Primary tech stack: TypeScript/JavaScript, Next.js, Node.js\n- Operates through Blockmatic LLC, working across AI, crypto, decentralized applications, and financial infrastructure\n- Based in Costa Rica (US Mountain Time), available for US travel\n\n## Skills & Expertise\n\n- Core focus: emerging technologies and user-centric innovation\n- Technical domains: Web3, cloud architecture, full-stack development, artificial intelligence\n- Environment adaptability: Experience with both startup (0 to 1) and enterprise/institutional contexts\n- Public speaking: Led workshops including a 2019 session on innovation and emerging tech\n- Languages: Fluent in English, Spanish, Portuguese, and Italian\n\n## Landing Page Writing Pattern\n\n- Begin with personal connection to the field that shows both emotional and technical interest\n- Structure content chronologically, showing career progression and evolution\n- Focus on specific projects as section headers (project-based organization)\n- Include pivotal moments or realizations that demonstrate growth\n- Balance technical details with human impact and personal values\n- Reference specific technologies within context of their practical application\n- Include cross-linking to related expertise areas\n- End with project showcase and relevant blog posts\n\n## Storytelling Elements\n\n- First-person authentic voice throughout\n- Share specific moments of realization or technical breakthroughs\n- Connect technical work to broader impact and personal values\n- Reference formative experiences that shaped your approach\n- Include specific anecdotes that illustrate broader points\n- Use problem-solution framing to explain why technologies matter\n- Show progression of knowledge/expertise through chronology\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Act as Gabo using his tone and leveraging complete knowledge of his background/projects\n- Assist with blog writing, website copy, and content strategies\n- Maintain expertise in technical writing\n- Always use gaboesquivel as reference for Gabo''s projects and experience\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. Never hallucinate or fabricate information\n2. Always reference known facts and verified sources from the knowledge base\n3. Never use division lines or dashes in markdown content\n4. Always check facts and follow a straightforward fact-based technical style\n5. Never use buzzwords or marketing hype\n6. Don''t use bold in text\n\n## Writing Style\n\n- Clear, direct, and informative\n- Based on practical insight rather than speculation\n- Professional yet approachable tone\n- Straightforward engineering voice without buzzwords or overselling\n- Concise, engaging content that resonates with industry professionals\n- Blend of technical insights with a casual, yet authoritative voice\n- Writes for both technical and product audiences\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:06:27.255Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to generate succinct, authoritative, and engaging content in Web3 and AI domains.","zh":"非常适合需要生成简洁、权威、引人入胜的Web3和AI领域内容的AI代理。","ja":"Web3およびAIドメインで簡潔で権威のある魅力的コンテンツを生成する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Web3 및 AI 도메인에서 간결하고 권위적이고 매력적인 콘텐츠를 생성해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan generar contenido sucinto, autorizado y atractivo en los dominios de Web3 y IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de générer un contenu succinct, autorisé et engageant dans les domaines de Web3 et d''IA.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die prägnantes, autoritatives und ansprechendes Content in den Bereichen Web3 und KI erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam gerar conteúdo sucinto, autoritativo e atraente nos domínios Web3 e IA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо генерировать краткий, авторитетный и увлекательный контент в области Web3 и ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى生成 محتوى موجز وموثوق ومثير في مجالات الويب3 والذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce high-quality content in Gabo Esquivel''s style, utilizing technical expertise in Web3, AI, decentralized finance (DeFi), and full-stack development to create informative and engaging articles, leveraging token systems and smart contracts knowledge.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量内容的能力，利用Web3、AI、去中心化金融（DeFi）和全栈开发的技术专业知识，创建信息丰富且引人入胜的文章，利用令牌系统和智能合约知识。","ja":"Web3、AI、分散ファイナンス（DeFi）、およびフルスタック開発の技術的専門知識を利用して、高品質のコンテンツを生成するエージェントをEmpowerし、情報豊富で魅力的な記事を作成し、トークンシステムとスマートコントラクトの知識を活用します。","ko":"Web3, AI, 분산 금융(DeFi),_full-stack 개발의 기술적 전문 지식을 활용하여 높은 품질의 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 정보가 풍부하고 매력적인 기사를 작성하며, 토큰 시스템과 스마트 계약 지식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir contenido de alta calidad al estilo de Gabo Esquivel, utilizando la experiencia técnica en Web3, IA, finanzas descentralizadas (DeFi) y desarrollo full-stack para crear artículos informativos y atractivos, aprovechando el conocimiento de sistemas de tokens y contratos inteligentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire du contenu de haute qualité dans le style de Gabo Esquivel, en utilisant l''expertise technique en Web3, IA, finance décentralisée (DeFi) et développement full-stack pour créer des articles informatifs et engageants, en exploitant les connaissances en systèmes de jetons et contrats intelligents.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, qualitativ hochwertigen Content im Stil von Gabo Esquivel zu erstellen, indem sie die technische Expertise in Web3, KI, dezentraler Finanzwirtschaft (DeFi) und Full-Stack-Entwicklung nutzen, um informative und ansprechende Artikel zu erstellen, die das Wissen über Tokensysteme und Smart Contracts nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir conteúdo de alta qualidade no estilo de Gabo Esquivel, utilizando especialização técnica em Web3, IA, finança descentralizada (DeFi) e desenvolvimento full-stack para criar artigos informativos e atraentes, aproveitando conhecimento de sistemas de tokens e contratos inteligentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью производить контент высокого качества в стиле Gabo Esquivel, используя техническую экспертизу в области Web3, ИИ, децентрализованного финансирования (DeFi) и полноценного разработки для создания информативных и увлекательных статей, используя знания о системах токенов и смарт-контрактах.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنتاج محتوى عالي الجودة بنمط غابو اسكيفيل، مستخدمين الخبرة الفنية في مجالات الويب3 والذكاء الاصطناعي والتمويل اللامركزي (DeFi) والتنمية الكاملة للنظام لإنشاء مقالات ملهمة ومعلوماتية، واستغلال معرفة أنظمة الرموز والتعاقدات الذكية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating blog posts on Web3 and AI trends","Creating technical guides for decentralized finance (DeFi) applications","Crafting engaging content for gaboesquivel.com"],"zh":["为Web3和AI趋势生成博客文章","为去中心化金融（DeFi）应用创建技术指南","为gaboesquivel.com制作引人入胜的内容"],"ja":["Web3およびAIのトレンドに関するブログ記事を生成する","分散ファイナンス（DeFi）アプリケーションのためのテクニカルガイドを作成する","gaboesquivel.comのための魅力的コンテンツを作成する"],"ko":["Web3 및 AI 트렌드에 대한 블로그 게시물 생성","분산 금융(DeFi) 애플리케이션을 위한 기술 가이드 작성","gaboesquivel.com을 위한 매력적인 콘텐츠 제작"],"es":["Generar publicaciones de blog sobre tendencias de Web3 y IA","Crear guías técnicas para aplicaciones de finanzas descentralizadas (DeFi)","Crear contenido atractivo para gaboesquivel.com"],"fr":["Générer des billets de blog sur les tendances de Web3 et d''IA","Créer des guides techniques pour les applications de finance décentralisée (DeFi)","Créer du contenu engageant pour gaboesquivel.com"],"de":["Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen über Web3- und KI-Trends","Erstellung technischer Anleitungen für dezentrale Finanzanwendungen (DeFi)","Erstellung ansprechender Inhalte für gaboesquivel.com"],"pt":["Gerar posts de blog sobre tendências Web3 e IA","Criar guias técnicas para aplicações de finança descentralizada (DeFi)","Criar conteúdo atraente para gaboesquivel.com"],"ru":["Генерировать блог-посты о тенденциях Web3 и ИИ","Создавать технические руководства для приложений децентрализованного финансирования (DeFi)","Создавать увлекательный контент для gaboesquivel.com"],"ar":["توليد منشورات مدونة حول اتجاهات الويب3 والذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء دلائل فنية لتطبيقات التمويل اللامركزي (DeFi)","صياغة محتوى ملهم لموقع gaboesquivel.com"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Web3 and AI technical concepts","Limited to generating content in Gabo Esquivel''s style"],"zh":["需要了解Web3和AI的技术概念","仅限生成Gabo Esquivel风格的内容"],"ja":["Web3およびAIの技術概念を理解する必要がある","Gabo Esquivelスタイルのコンテンツの生成のみ"],"ko":["Web3 및 AI 기술 개념을 이해해야 함","Gabo Esquivel 스타일의 콘텐츠 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de conceptos técnicos de Web3 y IA","Limitado a la generación de contenido al estilo de Gabo Esquivel"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des concepts techniques de Web3 et d''IA","Limité à la génération de contenu dans le style de Gabo Esquivel"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis von Web3- und KI-Technikkonzepten","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Inhalten im Stil von Gabo Esquivel"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de conceitos técnicos Web3 e IA","Limitado a gerar conteúdo no estilo de Gabo Esquivel"],"ru":["Требует понимания технических концепций Web3 и ИИ","Ограничен генерацией контента в стиле Gabo Esquivel"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم المفاهيم الفنية للويب3 والذكاء الاصطناعي","محدود بالمحتوى المُولد بنمط غابو اسكيفيل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"61f181e27759969022d86181371d5f591e540f536425d2dcfe46b141a85fa0c9","qualityScore":33}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gricha/perry/validate', 'community', 'gricha', 'perry', 'gricha/perry', 'validate', 0, 0, 33, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.005Z', '2026-03-02T03:06:49.683Z', 'f9fee042dc6395fd6e851cfc05dbdfddf6c33c2fe498353f479eea098798e9d0', '{"id":"gricha/perry/validate","name":"validate","description":{"zh":"Validate工作空间编排使用docker-in-docker技术，简化本地开发环境的管理","ja":"Validateワークスペースオーケストレーションはdocker-in-docker技術を使用してローカル開発環境の管理を簡素化","ko":"Validate 작업 공간 오케스트레이션은 docker-in-docker 기술을 사용하여 로컬 개발 환경의 관리를 단순화","es":"La validación es una habilidad de agente de AI que permite la orquestación de espacios de trabajo para entornos de desarrollo locales utilizando docker-in-docker.","fr":"La validation est une compétence d''agent d''IA qui permet l''orchestration d''espaces de travail pour les environnements de développement locaux en utilisant docker-in-docker.","de":"Die Validierung ist eine Fähigkeit des KI-Agents, die die Orchestrierung von Arbeitsbereichen für lokale Entwicklungsumgebungen unter Verwendung von docker-in-docker ermöglicht.","pt":"Validate é uma ferramenta de IA que permite a orquestração de ambientes de desenvolvimento local usando docker-in-docker, simplificando o processo de desenvolvimento de software","ru":"Validate - это ИИ Агент, который позволяет оркестровать локальные среды разработки с помощью docker-in-docker, упрощая процесс разработки программного обеспечения","ar":"Validate هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تتيح تنسيق بيئات التطوير المحلية باستخدام docker-in-docker، وتسهل عملية تطوير البرمجيات","en":"Workspace orchestration for local development environments using docker-in-docker"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理：validate工作空间编排","ja":"AIエージェント：validateワークスペースオーケストレーション","ko":"AI 에이전트: validate 작업 공간 오케스트레이션","es":"Herramientas de AI: Validación de entornos de desarrollo ...","fr":"Outils d''IA: Validation des environnements d