설정","Validate 작업 공간 오케스트레이션 튜토리얼","Validate 작업 공간 오케스트레이션 대체","Validate 작업 공간 오케스트레이션과 docker 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo","validación de entornos de desarrollo","docker-in-docker","orquestación de espacios de trabajo","desarrollo de software","colaboración en equipo","automatización de tareas","instalación de docker","guía de configuración de docker"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","validation des environnements de développement","docker-in-docker","orchestration d''espaces de travail","développement de logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","automatisation des tâches","installation de docker","guide de configuration de docker"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Validierung von Entwicklungsumgebungen","docker-in-docker","Orchestrierung von Arbeitsbereichen","Software-Entwicklung","Teamzusammenarbeit","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Docker-Installation","Docker-Konfigurationsanleitung"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvimento","orquestração de ambientes de desenvolvimento","docker-in-docker","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","validate alternative","como usar validate","guia de instalação do validate"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для разработки","оркестровка локальных сред разработки","docker-in-docker","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","validate альтернатива","как использовать validate","руководство по установке validate"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات","تنسيق بيئات التطوير المحلية","docker-in-docker","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","بديل validate","كيفية استخدام validate","دليل تثبيت validate"]}},"owner":"gricha","repo":"perry","repoPath":"gricha/perry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.005Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"validate","description":"Run validation checks - determines whether to use fast (validate) or full (validate:full) based on changed files","bodyPreview":"# Validate Skill\n\nRun the appropriate validation for your changes.\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command | What it does | When to use |\n|---------|--------------|-------------|\n| `bun run check` | lint + format + typecheck | Quick syntax check |\n| `bun run validate` | check + build TS/worker + unit tests | Default for most changes |\n| `bun run validate:core` | validate + integration tests | Core behavior changes |\n\n## Decision Logic\n\n1. **Check what files changed** using `git status` or `git diff --name-only`","body":"# Validate Skill\n\nRun the appropriate validation for your changes.\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command | What it does | When to use |\n|---------|--------------|-------------|\n| `bun run check` | lint + format + typecheck | Quick syntax check |\n| `bun run validate` | check + build TS/worker + unit tests | Default for most changes |\n| `bun run validate:core` | validate + integration tests | Core behavior changes |\n\n## Decision Logic\n\n1. **Check what files changed** using `git status` or `git diff --name-only`\n\n2. **Use `bun run validate:core`** if changes touch:\n   - `src/agent/` (core agent behavior)\n   - `src/workspace/` (workspace lifecycle)\n   - `src/terminal/` (terminal/WebSocket)\n\n3. **Use `bun run validate`** for everything else\n\n4. **Run specific tests** relevant to your changes instead of full suites:\n   ```bash\n   bun test test/unit/relevant.test.ts\n   bun test test/integration/relevant.test.ts\n   bun test web/e2e/relevant.spec.ts\n   ```\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Check changed files:\n   ```bash\n   git diff --name-only HEAD\n   ```\n\n2. Run validation + relevant tests:\n   ```bash\n   bun run validate\n   # Then run specific tests for your changes\n   bun test test/unit/relevant.test.ts\n   ```\n\n3. If validation fails, fix issues and re-run\n\n4. Run warden to get code review feedback locally (security, react best practices, code simplification):\n   ```bash\n   warden -v\n   ```\n   The `-v` flag streams findings in real-time. Fix any issues warden finds before creating a PR.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `validate` is fast (~30s), `validate:core` adds integration tests (~1-2min)\n- CI runs full validation on PRs, so targeted tests are usually sufficient locally\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:06:49.683Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated code validation and testing in Docker environments.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Docker 环境中进行自动化代码验证和测试的开发智能体。","ja":"Docker環境における自動化されたコード検証とテストを必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Docker 환경에서 자동화된 코드 검증 및 테스트가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan validación y prueba de código automatizadas en entornos Docker.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une validation et des tests de code automatisés dans des environnements Docker.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Code-Validierung und -Testung in Docker-Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de validação e teste de código automatizados em ambientes Docker.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуются автоматизированная проверка и тестирование кода в средах Docker.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق والتجريب التلقائي للкод في بيئات Docker."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run comprehensive validation checks using bun run commands, including linting, formatting, type checking, and unit tests, ensuring code quality and reliability in docker-in-docker setups.","zh":"使智能体能够使用 bun run 命令运行全面的验证检查，包括代码检查（linting）、格式化、类型检查和单元测试，从而确保在 Docker-in-Docker 设置中的代码质量和可靠性。","ja":"linting、フォーマット、型チェック、単体テストを含む、bun run コマンドを使用した包括的な検証チェックを実行する機能をエージェントに提供し、Docker-in-Docker セットアップにおけるコード品質と信頼性を確保します。","ko":"linting, 형식 지정, 타입 확인 및 단위 테스트를 포함한 bun run 명령을 사용하여 포괄적인 검증 검사를 실행할 수 있도록 하여 docker-in-docker 설정에서 코드 품질과 신뢰성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar comprobaciones de validación integrales utilizando comandos bun run, incluyendo análisis de código, formato, comprobación de tipos y pruebas unitarias, garantizando la calidad y confiabilidad del código en configuraciones de docker-in-docker.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des vérifications de validation complètes en utilisant des commandes bun run, y compris le linting, la mise en forme, la vérification de types et les tests unitaires, garantissant la qualité et la fiabilité du code dans les configurations docker-in-docker.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, umfassende Validierungsprüfungen mit bun run-Befehlen durchzuführen, einschließlich Linting, Formatierung, Typprüfung und Unit-Tests, und stellt so die Codequalität und -zuverlässigkeit in docker-in-docker-Konfigurationen sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar verificações de validação abrangentes usando comandos bun run, incluindo linting, formatação, verificação de tipo e testes unitários, garantindo a qualidade e confiabilidade do código em configurações docker-in-docker.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять комплексные проверки с помощью команд bun run, включая linting, форматирование, проверку типов и модульные тесты, обеспечивая качество и надежность кода в настройках docker-in-docker.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تشغيل فحوصات التحقق الشاملة باستخدام أوامر bun run، بما في ذلك linting وتنسيق و فحص النوع واختبارات الوحدة، مما يضمن جودة وثبات الكود في إعدادات docker-in-docker."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating code syntax with `bun run check`","Running full validation with `bun run validate` for most code changes","Testing core behavior changes with `bun run validate:core`"],"zh":["使用 `bun run check` 验证代码语法","对大多数代码更改使用 `bun run validate` 运行完整验证","使用 `bun run validate:core` 测试核心行为更改"],"ja":["`bun run check` を使用したコード構文の検証","ほとんどのコード変更に対して `bun run validate` を使用した完全な検証の実行","`bun run validate:core` を使用したコア動作変更のテスト"],"ko":["`bun run check`를 사용한 코드 구문 검증","대부분의 코드 변경 사항에 대해 `bun run validate`를 사용한 전체 검증 실행","`bun run validate:core`를 사용한 핵심 동작 변경 사항 테스트"],"es":["Validar la sintaxis del código con `bun run check`","Ejecutar una validación completa con `bun run validate` para la mayoría de los cambios de código","Probar los cambios de comportamiento principal con `bun run validate:core`"],"fr":["Valider la syntaxe du code avec `bun run check`","Exécuter une validation complète avec `bun run validate` pour la plupart des modifications de code","Tester les modifications de comportement principal avec `bun run validate:core`"],"de":["Validieren der Codesyntax mit `bun run check`","Ausführen einer vollständigen Validierung mit `bun run validate` für die meisten Codeänderungen","Testen von Änderungen des Hauptverhaltens mit `bun run validate:core`"],"pt":["Validar sintaxe de código com `bun run check`","Executar validação completa com `bun run validate` para a maioria das alterações de código","Testar alterações de comportamento central com `bun run validate:core`"],"ru":["Проверить синтаксис кода с помощью `bun run check`","Выполнить полную проверку с помощью `bun run validate` для большинства изменений кода","Тестировать изменения основного поведения с помощью `bun run validate:core`"],"ar":["التحقق من بنية الكود باستخدام `bun run check`","تشغيل التحقق الكامل مع `bun run validate` لأغلب التغييرات في الكود","اختبار تغييرات السلوك الأساسي مع `bun run validate:core`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker environment","Dependent on bun run commands","Limited to specific test scenarios"],"zh":["需要 Docker 环境","依赖于 bun run 命令","仅限于特定的测试场景"],"ja":["Docker環境が必要","bun run コマンドに依存","特定のテストシナリオに限定される"],"ko":["Docker 환경 필요","bun run 명령에 의존","특정 테스트 시나리오로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Docker","Dependiente de los comandos bun run","Limitado a escenarios de prueba específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Docker","Dépendant des commandes bun run","Limité à des scénarios de test spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt eine Docker-Umgebung","Abhängig von bun run-Befehlen","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Testsszenarien"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Docker","Dependente de comandos bun run","Limitado a cenários de teste e