"cats-effect-io","أدوات الأجهزة الافتراضية الجافا","JVM","كيفية استخدام cats-effect-io","ما هي أدوات قاعدة البيانات cats-effect-io","بديلات أدوات قاعدة البيانات cats-effect-io","cats-effect-io مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت cats-effect-io","دليل إعداد cats-effect-io"]}},"owner":"funfix","repo":"database","repoPath":"funfix/database","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.008Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cats-effect-io","description":"Scala functional programming with Cats Effect IO and typeclasses. Use for wrapping side effects, modeling purity, choosing Sync/Async/Temporal/Concurrent, handling blocking I/O, and composing resources, fibers, and concurrency safely.","bodyPreview":"# Cats Effect IO (Scala)\n\n## Quick start\n- Treat every side effect as an effect value: return `IO[A]`, `SyncIO[A]`, or `F[A]` with `F[_]: Sync`/`Async`/`Temporal` as needed.\n- Wrap Java blocking calls with `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`).\n- Use `Resource` to acquire/release resources and `IOApp` for program entry points.\n- Prefer structured concurrency (`parTraverse`, `parMapN`, `background`, `Supervisor`) over manual fiber management.\n- Read `referenc","body":"# Cats Effect IO (Scala)\n\n## Quick start\n- Treat every side effect as an effect value: return `IO[A]`, `SyncIO[A]`, or `F[A]` with `F[_]: Sync`/`Async`/`Temporal` as needed.\n- Wrap Java blocking calls with `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`).\n- Use `Resource` to acquire/release resources and `IOApp` for program entry points.\n- Prefer structured concurrency (`parTraverse`, `parMapN`, `background`, `Supervisor`) over manual fiber management.\n- Read `references/cats-effect-io.md` for concepts, recipes, and FAQ guidance.\n- For deeper `Resource` guidance, use the `cats-effect-resource` skill (install: `npx skills add https://github.com/alexandru/skills --skill cats-effect-resource`).\n\n## Workflow\n1. Classify side effects and choose the effect type: `IO` directly or polymorphic `F[_]` with the smallest required Cats Effect typeclass (`Sync`, `Async`, `Temporal`, `Concurrent`).\n2. Wrap side-effectful code using `IO(...)`, `IO.blocking`, `IO.interruptible`, or `IO.async` (or their `Sync`/`Async` equivalents).\n3. Manage resources with `Resource` or `bracket` and keep acquisition/release inside effects.\n4. Compose effects with `flatMap`/for-comprehensions and collection combinators (`traverse`, `parTraverse`).\n5. Use concurrency primitives (`Ref`, `Deferred`, `Queue`, `Semaphore`, `Supervisor`) and structured concurrency to avoid fiber leaks.\n\n## Side-effect rules (apply to `IO`, `SyncIO`, and to `F[_]: Sync/Async`)\n- All side-effectful functions must return results wrapped in `IO` (or `F[_]` with Cats Effect typeclasses).\n- Side-effects include all non-determinism (call sites are not referentially transparent):\n  - Any I/O (files, sockets, console, databases).\n  - `Instant.now()`, `Random.nextInt()`.\n  - Any read from shared mutable state (the read itself is the side effect).\n  - Returning mutable data structures (for example, `Array[Int]`).\n\n## Blocking I/O rules\n- Java blocking methods must be wrapped in `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`) so they run on the blocking pool.\n- Prefer `IO.interruptible` for methods that may throw `InterruptedException` or `IOException`, but not for resource disposal.\n- Use `IO.blocking` for cleanup/disposal (`Closeable#close`, `AutoCloseable#close`).\n\n## Output expectations\n- Make side effects explicit in signatures (`IO`/`SyncIO` or `F[_]: Sync/Async`); the guidance here applies equally to concrete `IO` and polymorphic `F[_]`.\n- Use the smallest typeclass constraint that supports the needed operations.\n- Keep effects as values; do not execute effects in constructors or top-level vals.\n\n## References\n- Load `references/cats-effect-io.md` for documentation summary and patterns.\n- For concrete samples, read `references/cats-effect-io.md`.\n- Use the `cats-effect-resource` skill for Resource-specific workflows and patterns (install: `npx skills add https://github.com/alexandru/skills --skill cats-effect-resource`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:07:56.632Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for JVM-based Agents requiring efficient management of side effects and concurrency using Scala","zh":"适用于需要使用Scala高效管理副作用和并发的JVM-based Agents","ja":"Scalaを使用して副作用と並行性を効率的に管理する必要があるJVM-based Agentsに適している","ko":"Scala를 사용하여 부작용과 并行성을 효율적으로 관리하는必要가 있는 JVM 기반 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes basados en JVM que requieren un manejo eficiente de efectos laterales y concurrencia utilizando Scala","fr":"Idéal pour les agents basés sur JVM nécessitant une gestion efficace des effets secondaires et de la concurrence à l''aide de Scala","de":"Ideal für JVM-basierte Agenten, die eine effiziente Verwaltung von Nebeneffekten und Konkurrenz unter Verwendung von Scala erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes baseados em JVM que exigem gerenciamento eficiente de efeitos colaterais e concorrência usando Scala","ru":"Идеально для агентов на основе JVM, требующих эффективного управления побочными эффектами и параллелизмом с использованием Scala","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المبنيين على JVM الذين يتطلبون إدارة فعالة للآثار الجانبية والتزامن باستخدام Scala"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while leveraging structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor for robust resource management and error handling","zh":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while leveraging structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor for robust resource management and error handling","ja":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while leveraging structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor for robust resource management and error handling","ko":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while leveraging structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor for robust resource management and error handling","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar efectos laterales con IO[A], SyncIO[A] o F[A] utilizando las clases de tipo Sync, Async o Temporal, mientras aprovecha la concurrencia estructurada con parTraverse, parMapN y Supervisor para un manejo robusto de recursos y control de errores","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les effets secondaires avec IO[A], SyncIO[A] ou F[A] en utilisant les classes de type Sync, Async ou Temporal, tout en exploitant la concurrence structurée avec parTraverse, parMapN et Supervisor pour une gestion robuste des ressources et de traitement des erreurs","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Nebeneffekte mit IO[A], SyncIO[A] oder F[A] unter Verwendung der Typklassen Sync, Async oder Temporal zu verwalten, während sie die strukturierte Konkurrenz mit parTraverse, parMapN und Supervisor für eine robuste Ressourcenverwaltung und Fehlerbehandlung nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com efeitos colaterais com IO[A], SyncIO[A] ou F[A] usando as classes de tipo Sync, Async ou Temporal, aproveitando a concorrência estruturada com parTraverse, parMapN e Supervisor para gerenciamento robusto de recursos e tratamento de erros","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать побочные эффекты с помощью IO[A], SyncIO[A] или F[A] с использованием классов типов Sync, Async или Temporal, используя структурированный параллелизм с parTraverse, parMapN и Supervisor для надежного управления ресурсами и обработки ошибок","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التعامل مع الآثار الجانبية باستخدام IO[A]، SyncIO[A] أو F[A] باستخدام فئات النوع Sync، Async أو Temporal، واستخدام التزامن الهيكلي مع parTraverse، parMapN و Supervisor لإدارة موارد قوية ومعالجة الأخطاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for safe execution","Managing resources with Resource to ensure proper acquisition and release","Building concurrent programs with IOApp for structured entry points"],"zh":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for safe execution","Managing resources with Resource to ensure proper acquisition and release","Building concurrent programs with IOApp for structured entry points"],"ja":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for safe execution","Managing resources with Resource to ensure proper acquisition and release","Building concurrent programs with IOApp for structured entry points"],"ko":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for safe execution","Managing resources with Resource to ensure proper acquisition and release","Building concurrent programs with IOApp for structured entry points"],"es":["Envolver llamadas a bloqueos de Java con IO.blocking o IO.interruptible para una ejecución segura","Administrar recursos con Resource para garantizar la adquisición y liberación adecuadas","Crear programas concurrentes con IOApp para puntos de entrada estructurados"],"fr":["Envelopper les appels bloquants Java avec IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible pour une exécution sécurisée","Gérer les ressources avec Resource pour assurer l''acquisition et la libération appropriées","Créer des programmes concurrents avec IOApp pour des points d''entrée structurés"],"de":["Java-Blockieraufrufe mit IO.blocking oder IO.interruptible für eine sichere Ausführung umschließen","Ressourcen mit Resource verwalten, um eine ordnungsgemäße Beschaffung und Freigabe sicherzustellen","Erstellen von Konkurrenzprogrammen mit IOApp für strukturierte Einstiegspunkte"],"pt":["Envolver chamadas Java de bloqueio com IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible para execução segura","Gerenciar recursos com Resource para garantir aquisição e liberação adequadas","Construir programas concorrentes com IOApp para pontos de entrada estruturados"],"ru":["Обёртывание блокирующих вызовов Java с помощью IO.blocking или IO.interruptible для безопасного выполнения","Управление ресурсами с помощью Resource для обеспечения правильного получения и освобождения","Построение конкюрентных программ с помощью IOApp для структурированных точек входа"],"ar":["التغليف للمكالمات الجافا الحاصرة باستخدام IO.blocking أو IO.interruptible لتنفيذ آمن","إدارة الموارد باستخدام Resource لضمان الحصول والتحرير الصحيحين","بناء البرامج المتوازية باستخدام IOApp لنقاط الدخول الهيكلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Scala programming language","JVM-based environment necessary","Needs understanding of functional programming concepts like Sync, Async, and Temporal"],"zh":["Requires Scala programming language","JVM-based environment necessary","Needs understanding of functional programming concepts like Sync, Async, and Temporal"],"ja":["Requires Scala programming language","JVM-based environment necessary","Needs understanding of functional programming concepts like Sync, Async, and Temporal"],"ko":["Requires Scala programming language","JVM-based environment necessary","Needs understanding of functional programming concepts like Sync, Async, and Temporal"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Scala","Entorno basado en JVM necesario","Requiere comprensión de conceptos de programación funcional como Sync, Async y Temporal"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Scala","Environnement basé sur JVM nécessaire","Nécessite une compréhension des concepts de programmation fonctionnelle tels que Sync, Async et Temporal"],"de":["Erfordert die Programmiersprache Scala","JVM-basierte Umgebung erforderlich","Erfordert ein Verständnis von Funktionsprogrammierkonzepten wie Sync, Async und Temporal"],"pt":["Exige linguagem de programação Scala","Ambiente baseado em JVM necessário","Exige compreensão de conceitos de programação funcional como Sync, Async e Temporal"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Scala","Необходимо окружение на основе JVM","Требует понимания концепций функционального программирования, таких как Sync, Async и Temporal"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة برمجة Scala","بيئة مبنية على JVM ضرورية","يتطلب فهمًا لمفاهيم البرمجة الوظيفية مثل Sync، Async والزمني"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"15ec2b761ffb635bf0832379d39c0dc3eb703236060d04a2ac3ca10f07266384","qualityScore":33}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('iheanyi/tasuku/tasuku', 'community', 'iheanyi', 'tasuku', 'iheanyi/tasuku', 'tasuku', 0, 0, 33, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.015Z', '2026-03-02T03:10:00.674Z', '9cc7df6a181c5034480529cb86c332c6d11cf349b1feac7cb9df18a0b8852d49', '{"id":"iheanyi/tasuku/tasuku","name":"tasuku","description":{"zh":"Tasuku是一种轻量级多代理任务管理工具，促进代理知识捕获，适用于开发者","ja":"Tasukuは軽量級マルチエージェントタスク管理ツールであり、エージェント知識の捕獲を促進する","ko":"Tasuku는 경량级 다중 에이전트 작업 관리 도구로 에이전트 지식 캡처를 촉진하여 개발자에게 적합합니다","es":"tasuku es una herramienta ligera de gestión de tareas multiagente que promueve la captura de conocimiento de agentes","fr":"tasuku est un outil léger de gestion de tâches multi-agent qui favorise la capture des connaissances d''agent","de":"tasuku ist ein leichtgewichtiges Multi-Agenten-Aufgabenverwaltungstool, das die Erfassung von Agentenwissen fördert","pt":"Tasuku é uma ferramenta leve para gerenciamento de tarefas multi-agente que promove a captura de conhecimento agente.","ru":"Tasuku - это легкий инструмент для управления тасками multi-agent, который способствует захвату агентного знания.","ar":"Tasuku هو أداة خفيفة لإدارة المهام متعددة الوكيل التي تعزز إدارة المعرفة الوكيل.","en":"Lightweight multi-agent task management that promotes agentic knowledge capture "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tasuku AI智能代理 - 轻量级多代理任务管理","ja":"Tasuku AIエージェント - 軽量級マルチエージェントタスク管理","ko":"Tasuku AI 에이전트 - 경량级 다중 에이전트 작업 관리","es":"Herramientas de AI: tasuku, gestión de tareas multiagente","fr":"Outils d''IA : tasuku, gestion de tâches multi-agent","de":"KI-Tools: tasuku, leichtgewichtige Multi-Agenten-Aufgaben...","pt":"Tasuku: Ferramenta de Gerenciamento de Tarefas de AI","ru":"Tasuku: Инструмент для управления тасками AI","ar":"Tasuku: أداة إدارة المهام من AI","en":"tasuku"},"description":{"zh":"Tasuku是一种轻量级多代理任务管理工具，促进代理知识捕获，适用于开发者","ja":"Tasukuは軽量級マルチエージェントタスク管理ツールであり、エージェント知識の捕獲を促進する","ko":"Tasuku는 경량级 다중 에이전트 작업 관리 도구로 에이전트 지식 캡처를 촉진하여 개발자에게 적합합니다","es":"tasuku es una herramienta ligera de gestión de tareas multiagente que promueve la captura de conocimiento de agentes","fr":"tasuku est un outil léger de gestion de tâches multi-agent qui favorise la capture des connaissances d''agent","de":"tasuku ist ein leichtgewichtiges Multi-Agenten-Aufgabenverwaltungstool, das die Erfassung von Agentenwissen fördert","pt":"Tasuku é uma ferramenta leve para gerenciamento de tarefas multi-agente que promove a captura de conhecimento agente.","ru":"Tasuku - это легкий инструмент для управления тасками multi-agent, который способствует захвату агентного знания.","ar":"Tasuku هو أداة خفيفة لإدارة المهام متعددة الوكيل التي تعزز إدارة المعرفة الوكيل.","en":"Lightweight multi-agent task management that promotes agentic knowledge capture "},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight multi-agent task management that promotes agentic knowledge capture "},"features":{"zh":["轻量级多代理任务管理","代理知识捕获","开发效率提高","支持多种开发语言","CLI接口"],"ja":["軽量級マルチエージェントタスク管理","エージェント知識の捕獲","開発効率の向上","多種の開発言語をサポート","CLIインターフェース"],"ko":["경량级 다중 에이전트 작업 관리","에이전트 지식 캡처","개발 효율성 향상","다양한 개발 언어 지원","CLI 인터페이스"],"es":["Gestión de tareas multiagente","Captura de conocimiento de agentes","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI)","Compatibilidad con Python y Node.js"],"fr":["Gestion de tâches multi-agent","Capture des connaissances d''agent","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Interface de ligne de commande (CLI)","Compatibilité avec Python et Node.js"],"de":["Multi-Agenten-Aufgabenverwaltung","Erfassung von Agentenwissen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI)","Kompatibilität mit Python und Node.js"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de tarefas multi-agente","Captura de conhecimento agente","Ferramenta leve para gerenciamento de tarefas"],"ru":["Управление тасками multi-agent","Захват агентного знания","Легкий инструмент для управления тасками"],"ar":["إدارة المهام متعددة الوكيل","إدارة المعرفة الوكيل","أداة خفيفة لإدارة المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tasuku AI智能代理","轻量级多代理任务管理","代理知识捕获","开发效率提高","Tasuku安装","Tasuku设置指南","Tasuku替代品","Tasuku vs 其他AI工具"],"ja":["Tasuku AIエージェント","軽量級マルチエージェントタスク管理","エージェント知識の捕獲","開発効率の向上","Tasukuのインストール","Tasukuの設定ガイド","Tasukuの代替品","Tasuku vs 他のAIツール"],"ko":["Tasuku AI 에이전트","경량级 다중 에이전트 작업 관리","에이전트 지식 캡처","개발 효율성 향상","Tasuku 설치","Tasuku 설정 가이드","Tasuku 대체品","Tasuku vs 다른 AI 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI","gestión de tareas multiagente","captura de conocimiento de agentes","cómo usar tasuku","alternativas a tasuku","tasuku vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de tasuku","guía de configuración de tasuku"],"fr":["outils d''IA","gestion de tâches multi-agent","capture des connaissances d''agent","comment utiliser tasuku","alternatives à tasuku","tasuku vs autres outils d''IA","installation de tasuku","guide de configuration de tasuku"],"de":["KI-Tools","Multi-Agenten-Aufgabenverwaltung","Erfassung von Agentenwissen","wie man tasuku verwendet","Alternativen zu tasuku","tasuku im Vergleich zu anderen KI-Tools","Installation von tasuku","Konfigurationsanleitung für tasuku"],"pt":["Tasuku","Ferramenta de gerenciamento de tarefas","AI","Agentes de AI","Gerenciamento de tarefas multi-agente"],"ru":["Tasuku","Инструмент для управления тасками","ИИ","Агенты ИИ","Управление тасками multi-agent"],"ar":["Tasuku","أداة لإدارة المهام","AI","أدوات AI","إدارة المهام متعددة الوكيل"]}},"owner":"iheanyi","repo":"tasuku","repoPath":"iheanyi/tasuku","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.015Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tasuku","description":"Agent-first task management. Use when tracking multi-session work, recording learnings/decisions, managing task dependencies, or persisting context across sessions. Provides tk_list, tk_add, tk_done, tk_start, tk_learn, tk_decide, tk_note, tk_show, tk_find, tk_ready, tk_context, tk_stats, tk_block, tk_task, tk_metadata, tk_manage, tk_health, tk_suggest, tk_deps, and tk_help tools.","bodyPreview":"# Tasuku — Agent-First Task Management\n\nTasuku provides persistent, git-friendly task management designed for AI agents working on codebases.\n\n## When to Use Tasuku\n\n- **Multi-session work**: Tasks, learnings, and decisions persist across sessions\n- **Task dependencies**: Block/unblock tasks, track what''s ready to work on\n- **Knowledge capture**: Record learnings (\"Never X\", \"Always Y\") and architectural decisions\n- **Project context**: Get a summary of project state at any time\n\n## Quick Start","body":"# Tasuku — Agent-First Task Management\n\nTasuku provides persistent, git-friendly task management designed for AI agents working on codebases.\n\n## When to Use Tasuku\n\n- **Multi-session work**: Tasks, learnings, and decisions persist across sessions\n- **Task dependencies**: Block/unblock tasks, track what''s ready to work on\n- **Knowledge capture**: Record learnings (\"Never X\", \"Always Y\") and architectural decisions\n- **Project context**: Get a summary of project state at any time\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Check project state\nUse `tk_context` to get a full overview of tasks, learnings, and decisions.\n\n### Pick up work\nUse `tk_ready` to see tasks ready to work on, then `tk_start` to begin.\n\n### Track progress\n- `tk_add` — Create new tasks\n- `tk_note` — Add progress notes to tasks\n- `tk_done` — Mark tasks complete\n\n### Capture knowledge\n- `tk_learn` — Record insights, gotchas, rules (\"Never manually edit ANSI strings\")\n- `tk_decide` — Record architectural decisions with alternatives and reasoning\n\n## Task vs Session Scope\n\nUse Tasuku for **project-level** work that spans sessions:\n- Features, bugs, milestones\n- Architectural decisions\n- Cross-cutting learnings\n\nUse your editor''s built-in task list for **session-level** steps:\n- Implementation steps within a single session\n- Temporary checklists\n\n## Workflow Commands\n\n### Starting a Session\n1. `tk_context` — See project overview\n2. `tk_ready` — Find next task to work on\n3. `tk_start` — Begin working on a task\n\n### During Work\n- `tk_note` — Record progress, blockers, or findings\n- `tk_learn` — Capture insights as you discover them\n- `tk_block` — Mark tasks blocked by other tasks\n\n### Completing Work\n1. `tk_done` — Mark task complete\n2. `tk_learn` — Capture what you learned (don''t skip this!)\n3. `tk_ready` — See what''s unblocked and ready next\n\n### Finding Information\n- `tk_find` — Search across tasks, learnings, and decisions\n- `tk_show` — Get full details on a specific task\n- `tk_deps` — See task dependency graph\n- `tk_stats` — Project health metrics\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:10:00.674Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring persistent and git-friendly task management for collaborative codebase development.","zh":"适用于需要持久和git友好任务管理的AI代理进行协作代码库开发。","ja":"AIエージェントが持続的なタスク管理とgitに優しいタスク管理を必要とするコラボレーションコードベース開発に最適。","ko":"지속적이고 git 친화적인 작업 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트를 위한 협업 코드베이스 개발에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren una gestión de tareas persistente y compatible con git para el desarrollo de código colaborativo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant une gestion de tâches persistante et compatible avec git pour le développement de code collaboratif.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die eine persistente und git-freundliche Aufgabenverwaltung für die Entwicklung von Collaborative-Codebases benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requerem gerenciamento de tarefas persistente e compatível com git para desenvolvimento de código colaborativo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих постоянного и совместимого с git управления задачами для разработки кодовой базы.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يتطلب إدارة المهام المستدامة ومتوافقة مع جيت للتنمية التعاونية لقاعدة الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture knowledge and architectural decisions using lightweight multi-agent task management, promoting task dependencies and persistent learnings across sessions with git-friendly compatibility.","zh":"赋予代理捕获知识和架构决策的能力，使用轻量级多代理任务管理，促进任务依赖和会话间的持久学习，并具有git友好兼容性。","ja":"エージェントに知識とアーキテクチャの決定をキャプチャする能力を与え、軽量のマルチエージェントタスク管理を使用して、タスクの依存関係とセッション間の永続的な学習を促進し、gitに優しい互換性を提供する。","ko":"에이전트가 지식과 아키텍처 결정을 캡처할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 가벼운 멀티 에이전트 작업 관리를 사용하여 작업 의존성 및 세션 간의 지속적인 학습을 촉진하고 git 친화적인 호환성을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes capturar conocimientos y decisiones arquitectónicas utilizando una gestión de tareas de múltiples agentes ligera, promoviendo las dependencias de tareas y los aprendizajes persistentes en sesiones con compatibilidad con git.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer les connaissances et les décisions architecturales en utilisant une gestion de tâches multi-agents légère, promouvant les dépendances de tâches et les apprentissages persistants lors des sessions avec une compatibilité git.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Wissen und architektonische Entscheidungen mit einer leichten Multi-Agent-Aufgabenverwaltung zu erfassen, fördert Aufgabenabhängigkeiten und persistente Lernprozesse über Sitzungen hinweg mit git-freundlicher Kompatibilität.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar conhecimento e decisões arquitetônicas usando gerenciamento de tarefas leve de multi-agente, promovendo dependências de tarefas e aprendizados persistentes em várias sessões com compatibilidade com git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватить знания и архитектурные решения с помощью легкого управления задачами мультиагента, продвигая зависимости задач и постоянное обучение на протяжении сессий с совместимостью с git.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التقاط المعرفة والقرارات المعمارية باستخدام إدارة المهام الخفيفة متعددة الوكلاء، وتعزيز зависимости المهام والتعلم المستدام عبر الجلسات مع توافق جيت."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing multi-session work with persistent task tracking","Automating task dependency analysis for efficient workflow","Capturing and recording agentic knowledge for project context summaries"],"zh":["管理具有持久任务跟踪的多会话工作","自动执行任务依赖分析以实现高效的工作流程","捕获和记录代理知识以用于项目上下文摘要"],"ja":["永続的なタスク追跡を使用したマルチセッション作業の管理","効率的なワークフローを実現するためのタスク依存解析の自動化","プロジェクトコンテキストサマリー用のエージェント知識のキャプチャと記録"],"ko":["지속적인 작업 추적을 사용한 멀티 세션 작업 관리","효율적인 워크플로우를实现하기 위한 작업 의존성 분석의 자동화","프로젝트 컨텍스트 요약을 위한 에이전트 지식의 캡처 및 기록"],"es":["Gestión de trabajo en varias sesiones con seguimiento de tareas persistente","Automatización del análisis de dependencias de tareas para un flujo de trabajo eficiente","Captura y grabación del conocimiento de los agentes para resúmenes de contexto de proyecto"],"fr":["Gestion de travail en plusieurs sessions avec suivi de tâches persistant","Automatisation de l''analyse des dépendances de tâches pour un flux de travail efficace","Capturation et enregistrement des connaissances des agents pour des résumés de contexte de projet"],"de":["Verwaltung von Mehrsitzungsarbeiten mit persistenter Aufgabenverfolgung","Automatisierung der Aufgabenabhängigkeitsanalyse für einen effizienten Arbeitsablauf","Erfassung und Aufzeichnung des Wissens von Agents für Projektzusammenfassungen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de trabalho de várias sessões com rastreamento de tarefas persistente","Automatização da análise de dependência de tarefas para fluxo de trabalho eficiente","Captura e gravação do conhecimento agêntico para resumos de contexto de projeto"],"ru":["Управление работой в нескольких сессиях с постоянным отслеживанием задач","Автоматизация анализа зависимости задач для эффективного рабочего процесса","Захват и запись агентских знаний для сводок контекста проекта"],"ar":["إدارة عمل الجلسات المتعددة مع تتبع المهام المستدام","أتمتة تحليل зависимости المهام من أجل سير عمل فعال","التقاط وتسجيل المعرفة الوكيلية لأجل ملخصات سياق المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git compatibility for version control","Designed specifically for codebase development tasks"],"zh":["需要git兼容性以进行版本控制","专门为代码库开发任务设计"],"ja":["バージョン管理のためにgitの互換性が必要","コードベース開発タスク専用に設計"],"ko":["버전 관리를 위해 git 호환성이 필요","코드베이스 개발 작업専用로 설계"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con git para el control de versiones","Diseñado específicamente para tareas de desarrollo de código"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec git pour le contrôle de version","Conçu spécifiquement pour les tâches de développement de code"],"de":["Erfordert git-Kompatibilität für die Versionskontrolle","Speziell für Code-Entwicklungsaufgaben konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com git para controle de versão","Projetado especificamente para tarefas de desenvolvimento de código"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с git для контроля версий","Разработан специально для задач разработки кодовой базы"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع جيت للسيطرة على الإصدار","صمّم خصيصًا لمهام تطوير قاعدة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9cc7df6a181c5034480529cb86c332c6d11cf349b1feac7cb9df18a0b8852d49","qualityScore":33}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('eduardojvieira/ZPLC/zustand-state', 'community', 'eduardojvieira', 'ZPLC', 'eduardojvieira/ZPLC', 'zustand-state', 0, 0, 33, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.016Z', '2026-03-02T03:10:04.295Z', '82e215e941ba790c120e7710629f5b655edb0ff65bbc8c88a658506316d0b9af', '{"id":"eduardojvieira/ZPLC/zustand-state","name":"zustand-state","description":{"zh":"Zustand状态管理是一个强大的AI智能工具，提供高效的状态管理解决方案","ja":"zustand-stateは、AIエージェントのための状態管理ソリューションです","ko":"zustand-state는 AI 에이전트를 위한 상태 관리 솔루션입니다","es":"ZPLC es un núcleo de ejecución portable para PLCs basado en Zephyr RTOS. Proporciona una base robusta para gestionar estado en aplicaciones React, Node.js y sistemas embebidos, permitiendo una ejecución consistente en cualquier entorno de runtime.","fr":"ZPLC est un cœur d''exécution portable pour automates programmable, alimenté par Zephyr RTOS. Il offre une base robuste pour la gestion d''état dans les applications React, Node.js et systèmes embarqués, garantissant une exécution cohérente sur tout runtime.","de":"ZPLC ist eine portable Laufzeitumgebung für speicherprogrammierbare Steuerungen, betrieben von Zephyr RTOS. Es bietet eine robuste Grundlage für State Management in React, Node.js und Embedded-Anwendungen mit konsistenter Ausführung across any runtime.","pt":"O Zustand State é uma solução de gerenciamento de estado portátil e eficiente, impulsionada pelo Zephyr RTOS","ru":"Zustand State - это портативное и эффективное решение для управления состоянием, работающее на базе Zephyr RTOS","ar":"Zustand State هو حل قابل للنقل وكفء لإدارة الحالة ، مدعوم bởi Zephyr RTOS","en":"ZPLC - One Execution Core, Any Runtime. Portable PLC Runtime powered by Zephyr RTOS."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":" Zustand 状态管理 - AI智能工具","ja":"zustand-state - AIエージェントのための状態管理","ko":"zustand-state - AI 에이전트를 위한 상태 관리","es":"Zustand-State: Herramientas de IA para Estado React Portable","fr":"Zustand-State: Outils IA pour Gestion d''État Portable","de":"Zustand-State: KI-Tools für Portables React State Management","pt":"Ferramentas de AI: Zustand State com ZPLC","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Zustand State с ZPLC","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Zustand State مع ZPLC","en":"zustand-state"},"description":{"zh":"Zustand状态管理是一个强大的AI智能工具，提供高效的状态管理解决方案","ja":"zustand-stateは、AIエージェントのための状態管理ソリューションです","ko":"zustand-state는 AI 에이전트를 위한 상태 관리 솔루션입니다","es":"ZPLC es un núcleo de ejecución portable para PLCs basado en Zephyr RTOS. Proporciona una base robusta para gestionar estado en aplicaciones React, Node.js y ...","fr":"ZPLC est un cœur d''exécution portable pour automates programmable, alimenté par Zephyr RTOS. Il offre une base robuste pour la gestion d''état dans les applic...","de":"ZPLC ist eine portable Laufzeitumgebung für speicherprogrammierbare Steuerungen, betrieben von Zephyr RTOS. Es bietet eine robuste Grundlage für State Manage...","pt":"O Zustand State é uma solução de gerenciamento de estado portátil e eficiente, impulsionada pelo Zephyr RTOS","ru":"Zustand State - это портативное и эффективное решение для управления состоянием, работающее на базе Zephyr RTOS","ar":"Zustand State هو حل قابل للنقل وكفء لإدارة الحالة ، مدعوم bởi Zephyr RTOS","en":"ZPLC - One Execution Core, Any Runtime. Portable PLC Runtime powered by Zephyr RTOS."},"definition":{"en":"ZPLC - One Execution Core, Any Runtime. Portable PLC Runtime powered by Zephyr RTOS."},"features":{"zh":["高效的状态管理","支持多种运行时环境","基于Zephyr RTOS的可靠性","易于集成和使用","支持多种开发语言"],"ja":["効率的な状態管理","多くのランタイム環境をサポート","Zephyr RTOSによる信頼性","容易な統合と使用","多くの開発言語をサポート"],"ko":["고효율의 상태 관리","다수의 런타임 환경 지원","Zephyr RTOS에 의한 신뢰성","쉽게 통합하고 사용","다수의 개발 언어 지원"],"es":["Runtime PLC portable basado en Zephyr RTOS","Gestión de estado consistente para React y Node.js","Núcleo de ejecución único para múltiples entornos","Compatibilidad con sistemas embebidos y IoT","Arquitectura ligera y de alto rendimiento","Soporte para múltiples plataformas hardware"],"fr":["Runtime PLC portable alimenté par Zephyr RTOS","Gestion d''état cohérente pour React et Node.js","Cœur d''exécution unique pour multiples environnements","Compatibilité avec systèmes embarqués et IoT","Architecture légère et haute performance","Support multi-plateformes matérielles"],"de":["Portable PLC Runtime powered by Zephyr RTOS","Konsistentes State Management für React und Node.js","Single Execution Core für multiple Umgebungen","Kompatibilität mit Embedded-Systemen und IoT","Leichte und hochperformante Architektur","Unterstützung für multiple Hardware-Plattformen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado portátil","Compatibilidade com Zephyr RTOS","Melhoria da eficiência dos projetos de automação","Facilidade de uso e configuração","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de execução"],"ru":["Портативное управление состоянием","Совместимость с Zephyr RTOS","Улучшение эффективности проектов автоматизации","Легкость использования и настройки","Поддержка нескольких сред выполнения"],"ar":["إدارة حالة قابلة للنقل","التوافق مع Zephyr RTOS","تحسين كفاءة مشاريع الأتمتة","سهولة الاستخدام والتكوين","دعم بيئات تشغيل متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Zustand状态管理","什么是状态管理","Zustand状态管理替代品","Zustand状态管理与竞争对手的比较","Zustand状态管理安装","Zustand状态管理设置指南","AI智能工具状态管理","Zustand状态管理教程"],"ja":["zustand-stateの使用方法","状態管理とは","zustand-stateの代替","zustand-stateと競合の比較","zustand-stateのインストール","zustand-stateの設定ガイド","AIエージェントの状態管理","zustand-stateのチュートリアル"],"ko":["zustand-state 사용 방법","상태 관리란","zustand-state 대체品","zustand-state와 경쟁자의 비교","zustand-state 설치","zustand-state 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트의 상태 관리","zustand-state 튜토리얼"],"es":["zustand-state PLC runtime","gestión de estado portable React","Zephyr RTOS para desarrolladores","cómo usar zustand-state","zustand-state vs redux","instalar zustand-state","PLC runtime portable","herramientas de IA para estado","zustand-state embedded systems","guía setup zustand-state"],"fr":["zustand-state runtime PLC","gestion état portable React","Zephyr RTOS pour développeurs","comment utiliser zustand-state","zustand-state vs redux","installer zustand-state","runtime PLC portable","outils IA pour état","zustand-state systèmes embarqués","guide installation zustand-state"],"de":["zustand-state PLC runtime","portables state management React","Zephyr RTOS für Entwickler","wie verwendet man zustand-state","zustand-state vs redux","zustand-state installieren","portable PLC runtime","KI-Tools für State Management","zustand-state embedded systems","zustand-state setup guide"],"pt":["como usar Zustand State","o que é Zustand State","Zustand State vs outros gerenciadores de estado","instalar Zustand State","guia de configuração do Zustand State","Zustand State em projetos de automação","melhores práticas para usar Zustand State","Zustand State e Zephyr RTOS"],"ru":["как использовать Zustand State","что такое Zustand State","Zustand State vs другие менеджеры состояния","установить Zustand State","руководство по настройке Zustand State","Zustand State в проектах автоматизации","лучшие практики использования Zustand State","Zustand State и Zephyr RTOS"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Zustand State","ما هو Zustand State","Zustand State مقابل diğer أدوات إدارة الحالة","تثبيت Zustand State","دليل إعداد Zustand State","Zustand State في مشاريع الأتمتة","أفضل الممارسات لاستخدام Zustand State","Zustand State و Zephyr RTOS"]}},"owner":"eduardojvieira","repo":"ZPLC","repoPath":"eduardojvieira/ZPLC","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.016Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zustand-state","description":"Zustand state management for React and vanilla JavaScript. Use when creating stores, using selectors, persisting state to localStorage, integrating devtools, or managing global state without Redux complexity. Triggers on zustand, create(), createStore, useStore, persist, devtools, immer middleware.","bodyPreview":"# Zustand State Management\n\nMinimal state management - no providers, minimal boilerplate.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```typescript\nimport { create } from ''zustand''\n\ninterface BearState {\n  bears: number\n  increase: (by: number) => void\n}\n\nconst useBearStore = create<BearState>()((set) => ({\n  bears: 0,\n  increase: (by) => set((state) => ({ bears: state.bears + by })),\n}))\n\n// In component - select only what you need\nconst bears = useBearStore((state) => state.bears)\nconst increase = useBearStore((stat","body":"# Zustand State Management\n\nMinimal state management - no providers, minimal boilerplate.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```typescript\nimport { create } from ''zustand''\n\ninterface BearState {\n  bears: number\n  increase: (by: number) => void\n}\n\nconst useBearStore = create<BearState>()((set) => ({\n  bears: 0,\n  increase: (by) => set((state) => ({ bears: state.bears + by })),\n}))\n\n// In component - select only what you need\nconst bears = useBearStore((state) => state.bears)\nconst increase = useBearStore((state) => state.increase)\n```\n\n## State Updates\n\n```typescript\n// Flat updates (auto-merged at one level)\nset({ bears: 5 })\nset((state) => ({ bears: state.bears + 1 }))\n\n// Nested objects (manual spread required)\nset((state) => ({\n  nested: { ...state.nested, count: state.nested.count + 1 }\n}))\n\n// Replace entire state (no merge)\nset({ bears: 0 }, true)\n```\n\n## Selectors & Performance\n\n```typescript\n// Good - subscribes only to bears\nconst bears = useBearStore((state) => state.bears)\n\n// Bad - rerenders on any change\nconst state = useBearStore()\n\n// Multiple values with useShallow (prevents rerenders with shallow comparison)\nimport { useShallow } from ''zustand/react/shallow''\n\nconst { bears, fish } = useBearStore(\n  useShallow((state) => ({ bears: state.bears, fish: state.fish }))\n)\n\n// Array destructuring also works\nconst [bears, fish] = useBearStore(\n  useShallow((state) => [state.bears, state.fish])\n)\n```\n\n## Access Outside Components\n\n```typescript\n// Get current state (non-reactive)\nconst state = useBearStore.getState()\n\n// Update state\nuseBearStore.setState({ bears: 5 })\n\n// Subscribe to changes\nconst unsub = useBearStore.subscribe((state) => console.log(state))\nunsub() // unsubscribe\n```\n\n## Vanilla Store (No React)\n\n```typescript\nimport { createStore } from ''zustand/vanilla''\n\nconst store = createStore((set) => ({\n  bears: 0,\n  increase: (by) => set((state) => ({ bears: state.bears + by })),\n}))\n\nstore.getState().bears\nstore.setState({ bears: 10 })\nstore.subscribe((state) => console.log(state))\n```\n\n## Additional Documentation\n\n- **Middleware**: See [references/middleware.md](references/middleware.md) for persist, devtools, immer\n- **Patterns**: See [references/patterns.md](references/patterns.md) for slices, testing, best practices\n- **TypeScript**: See [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md) for advanced typing patterns\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n| Pattern | When to Use |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Single selector | One piece of state needed |\n| `useShallow` | Multiple values, avoid rerenders |\n| `getState()` | Outside React, event handlers |\n| `subscribe()` | External systems, logging |\n| Vanilla store | Non-React environments |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:10:04.295Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing minimal and efficient state management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要最小化且高效状态管理功能的前端Agent。","ja":"最小限かつ効率的な状態管理機能を必要とするフロントエンドAgentに最適です。","ko":"최소한이면서 효율적인 상태 관리 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 Agent에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades de gestión de estado mínimas y eficientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités de gestion d''état minimales et efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die minimale und effiziente State-Management-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de estado mínimas e eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Frontend-агентов, которым требуются минимальные и эффективные возможности управления состоянием.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات إدارة حالة بسيطة وفعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage state with minimal boilerplate using zustand, providing a lightweight and portable solution for state management. It leverages TypeScript interfaces like BearState to define state structures and uses zustand''s create function to initialize state management.","zh":"使Agent能够使用zustand以最少的样板代码管理状态，为状态管理提供了一个轻量级且可移植的解决方案。它利用TypeScript接口（如BearState）来定义状态结构，并使用zustand的create函数来初始化状态管理。","ja":"Agentがzustandを使用して最小限のボイラープレートで状態を管理できるようにし、状態管理のための軽量でポータブルなソリューションを提供します。BearStateのようなTypeScriptインターフェースを活用して状態構造を定義し、zustandのcreate関数を使用して状態管理を初期化します。","ko":"Agent가 zustand를 사용하여 최소한의 상용구 코드로 상태를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 상태 관리를 위한 경량화되고 이식 가능한 솔루션을 제공합니다. BearState와 같은 TypeScript 인터페이스를 활용하여 상태 구조를 정의하고, zustand의 create 함수를 사용하여 상태 관리를 초기화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar el estado con un boilerplate mínimo utilizando zustand, proporcionando una solución ligera y portable para la gestión de estado. Aprovecha interfaces de TypeScript como BearState para definir estructuras de estado y utiliza la función create de zustand para inicializar la gestión de estado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état avec un boilerplate minimal en utilisant zustand, fournissant une solution légère et portable pour la gestion d''état. Il tire parti des interfaces TypeScript comme BearState pour définir les structures d''état et utilise la fonction create de zustand pour initialiser la gestion d''état.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, State mit minimalem Boilerplate unter Verwendung von zustand zu verwalten, und bietet eine leichtgewichtige und portable Lösung für State Management. Es nutzt TypeScript-Schnittstellen wie BearState, um Zustandsstrukturen zu definieren, und verwendet die create-Funktion von zustand, um das State Management zu initialisieren.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerenciar o estado com código boilerplate mínimo usando zustand, fornecendo uma solução leve e portátil para gerenciamento de estado. Ele aproveita interfaces TypeScript, como BearState, para definir estruturas de estado e usa a função create do zustand para inicializar o gerenciamento de estado.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять состоянием с минимальным шаблонным кодом, используя zustand, предоставляя легкое и портативное решение для управления состоянием. Он использует интерфейсы TypeScript, такие как BearState, для определения структур состояния и применяет функцию create из zustand для инициализации управления состоянием.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة الحالة بأقل قدر من التعليمات البرمجية النمطية باستخدام zustand، مما يوفر حلًا خفيف الوزن ومحمولاً لإدارة الحالة. يستفيد من واجهات TypeScript مثل BearState لتحديد هياكل الحالة ويستخدم دالة create الخاصة بـ zustand لتهيئة إدارة الحالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing global state in React applications","Creating reusable state management components","Optimizing state updates with zustand''s set function"],"zh":["在React应用程序中管理全局状态","创建可重用的状态管理组件","使用zustand的set函数优化状态更新"],"ja":["Reactアプリケーションでのグローバル状態の管理","再利用可能な状態管理コンポーネントの作成","zustandのset関数を使用した状態更新の最適化"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션에서 전역 상태 관리","재사용 가능한 상태 관리 컴포넌트 생성","zustand의 set 함수를 사용한 상태 업데이트 최적화"],"es":["Gestión del estado global en aplicaciones React","Creación de componentes de gestión de estado reutilizables","Optimización de actualizaciones de estado con la función set de zustand"],"fr":["Gestion de l''état global dans les applications React","Création de composants de gestion d''état réutilisables","Optimisation des mises à jour d''état avec la fonction set de zustand"],"de":["Verwaltung von globalem State in React-Anwendungen","Erstellung wiederverwendbarer State-Management-Komponenten","Optimierung von State-Updates mit der set-Funktion von zustand"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado global em aplicações React","Criação de componentes reutilizáveis de gerenciamento de estado","Otimização de atualizações de estado com a função set do zustand"],"ru":["Управление глобальным состоянием в приложениях React","Создание переиспользуемых компонентов управления состоянием","Оптимизация обновлений состояния с помощью функции set из zustand"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة العامة في تطبيقات React","إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لإدارة الحالة","تحسين تحديثات الحالة باستخدام دالة set الخاصة بـ zustand"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript or JavaScript environment","Limited to frontend state management use cases"],"zh":["需要TypeScript或JavaScript环境","仅限于前端状态管理用例"],"ja":["TypeScriptまたはJavaScript環境が必要","フロントエンド状態管理のユースケースに限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript 또는 JavaScript 환경이 필요함","프론트엔드 상태 관리 사용 사례로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno TypeScript o JavaScript","Limitado a casos de uso de gestión de estado en frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript ou JavaScript","Limité aux cas d''usage de gestion d''état frontend"],"de":["Erfordert eine TypeScript- oder JavaScript-Umgebung","Beschränkt auf Frontend-State-Management-Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Requer um ambiente TypeScript ou JavaScript","Limitado a casos de uso de gerenciamento de estado no frontend"],"ru":["Требует среду TypeScript или JavaScript","Ограничено случаями использования управления состоянием во фронтенде"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript أو JavaScript","يقتصر على حالات استخدام إدارة الحالة في الواجهة الأمامية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"82e215e941ba790c120e7710629f5b655edb0ff65bbc8c88a658506316d0b9af","qualityScore":33}');
