к использовать ИИ архитектор","что такое ИИ архитектор","инструмент для проектирования веб-приложений для научного сообщества X-ray","проектирование веб-приложений для научного сообщества X-ray","ИИ архитектор для научного сообщества X-ray","инструмент для проектирования веб-приложений для научного сообщества X-ray"],"ar":["ما هو مصمم تصميم AI","أداة تصميم تطبيقات الوب لجماعة العلمية","مصمم تصميم AI لجماعة العلمية X-ray","كيف استخدام مصمم تصميم AI","ما هو مصمم تصميم AI","أداة تصميم تطبيقات الوب لجماعة العلمية X-ray","تصميم تطبيقات الوب لجماعة العلمية X-ray","مصمم تصميم AI لجماعة العلمية X-ray","أداة تصميم تطبيقات الوب لجماعة العلمية X-ray"]}},"owner":"WSU-Carbon-Lab","repo":"xray-atlas","repoPath":"WSU-Carbon-Lab/xray-atlas","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.030Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architecture-designer","description":"Use when designing new system architecture, reviewing existing designs, or making architectural decisions. Invoke for system design, architecture review, design patterns, ADRs, scalability planning.","bodyPreview":"# Architecture Designer\n\nSenior software architect specializing in system design, design patterns, and architectural decision-making.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a principal architect with 15+ years of experience designing scalable systems. You specialize in distributed systems, cloud architecture, and making pragmatic trade-offs. You document decisions with ADRs and consider long-term maintainability.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing new system architecture\n- Choosing between architectu","body":"# Architecture Designer\n\nSenior software architect specializing in system design, design patterns, and architectural decision-making.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a principal architect with 15+ years of experience designing scalable systems. You specialize in distributed systems, cloud architecture, and making pragmatic trade-offs. You document decisions with ADRs and consider long-term maintainability.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing new system architecture\n- Choosing between architectural patterns\n- Reviewing existing architecture\n- Creating Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)\n- Planning for scalability\n- Evaluating technology choices\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Understand requirements** - Functional, non-functional, constraints\n2. **Identify patterns** - Match requirements to architectural patterns\n3. **Design** - Create architecture with trade-offs documented\n4. **Document** - Write ADRs for key decisions\n5. **Review** - Validate with stakeholders\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Architecture Patterns | `references/architecture-patterns.md` | Choosing monolith vs microservices |\n| ADR Template | `references/adr-template.md` | Documenting decisions |\n| System Design | `references/system-design.md` | Full system design template |\n| Database Selection | `references/database-selection.md` | Choosing database technology |\n| NFR Checklist | `references/nfr-checklist.md` | Gathering non-functional requirements |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Document all significant decisions with ADRs\n- Consider non-functional requirements explicitly\n- Evaluate trade-offs, not just benefits\n- Plan for failure modes\n- Consider operational complexity\n- Review with stakeholders before finalizing\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Over-engineer for hypothetical scale\n- Choose technology without evaluating alternatives\n- Ignore operational costs\n- Design without understanding requirements\n- Skip security considerations\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen designing architecture, provide:\n1. Requirements summary (functional + non-functional)\n2. High-level architecture diagram\n3. Key decisions with trade-offs (ADR format)\n4. Technology recommendations with rationale\n5. Risks and mitigation strategies\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nDistributed systems, microservices, event-driven architecture, CQRS, DDD, CAP theorem, cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure), containers, Kubernetes, message queues, caching, database design\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - Implementing designs\n- **DevOps Engineer** - Infrastructure implementation\n- **Secure Code Guardian** - Security architecture\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:17:39.796Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced system design and architecture capabilities, such as Cursor or Windsurf.","zh":"适合需要高级系统设计和架构能力的AI代理，例如Cursor或Windsurf。","ja":"CursorやWindsurfなどの高度なシステム設計およびアーキテクチャ能力を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Cursor 또는 Windsurf와 같은 고급 시스템 설계 및 아키텍처 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de diseño y arquitectura de sistemas avanzados, como Cursor o Windsurf.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités de conception et d''architecture de systèmes avancées, comme Cursor ou Windsurf.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Systemdesign- und Architektur-Fähigkeiten benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor oder Windsurf.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de capacidades avançadas de design e arquitetura de sistemas, como Cursor ou Windsurf.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются передовые возможности проектирования и архитектуры системы, такие как Cursor или Windsurf.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تصميم وتخطيط نظام متقدمة، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable systems, making pragmatic trade-offs and documenting decisions with ADRs, utilizing distributed systems, cloud architecture, and design patterns.","zh":"赋予代理设计可扩展系统的能力，做出务实的权衡，并使用ADR记录决策，利用分布式系统、云架构和设计模式。","ja":"エージェントに拡張可能なシステムを設計する能力を与え、実用的なトレードオフを行い、ADRを使用して決定を文書化し、分散システム、クラウドアーキテクチャ、設計パターンを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능한 시스템을 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 실용적인 트레이드 오프를 انجام하며, ADR을 사용하여 결정 사항을 문서화하고, 분산 시스템, 클라우드 아키텍처 및 디자인 패턴을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar sistemas escalables, tomando decisiones pragmáticas y documentando decisiones con ADRs, utilizando sistemas distribuidos, arquitectura en la nube y patrones de diseño.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des systèmes évolutifs, en faisant des compromis pragmatiques et en documentant les décisions avec des ADR, en utilisant des systèmes distribués, une architecture cloud et des modèles de conception.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, skalierbare Systeme zu entwerfen, pragmatische Kompromisse einzugehen und Entscheidungen mit ADRs zu dokumentieren, unter Verwendung von verteilten Systemen, Cloud-Architektur und Designmustern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar sistemas escaláveis, fazendo escolhas práticas e documentando decisões com ADRs, utilizando sistemas distribuídos, arquitetura de nuvem e padrões de design.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать масштабируемые системы, принимать прагматические решения и документировать решения с помощью ADR, используя распределенные системы, облачную архитектуру и шаблоны проектирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم أنظمة قابلة للتوسعة، وإتخاذ اختيارات عملية وتوثيق القرارات باستخدام ADRs، واستخدام أنظمة موزعة وعمارة سحابية وأنماط تصميم."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new system architecture","Choosing between architectures","Optimizing existing system design for maintainability"],"zh":["设计新的系统架构","在架构之间进行选择","优化现有系统设计以提高可维护性"],"ja":["新しいシステムアーキテクチャを設計する","アーキテクチャの選択","既存のシステム設計をメンテナンス性の向上のために最適化する"],"ko":["새로운 시스템 아키텍처 설계","아키텍처 사이의 선택","기존 시스템 설계를 유지 보수성 향상을 위해 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar una nueva arquitectura de sistema","Elegir entre arquitecturas","Optimizar el diseño de sistema existente para mantenerlo"],"fr":["Concevoir une nouvelle architecture de système","Choisir entre les architectures","Optimiser la conception de système existante pour la maintenabilité"],"de":["Entwerfen einer neuen Systemarchitektur","Wählen zwischen Architekturen","Optimieren der bestehenden Systemdesigns für Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Projeto de nova arquitetura de sistema","Escolha entre arquiteturas","Otimização do design do sistema existente para manutenção"],"ru":["Проектирование новой архитектуры системы","Выбор между архитектурами","Оптимизация существующего дизайна системы для поддержки"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة نظام جديدة","اختيار بين الهياكل","تحسين تصميم النظام الحالي للصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in system design and architecture","Limited to distributed systems, cloud architecture, and design patterns"],"zh":["需要系统设计和架构的专业知识","仅限于分布式系统、云架构和设计模式"],"ja":["システム設計およびアーキテクチャの専門知識が必要","分散システム、クラウドアーキテクチャ、設計パターンに限定される"],"ko":["시스템 설계 및 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","분산 시스템, 클라우드 아키텍처 및 디자인 패턴으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en diseño y arquitectura de sistemas","Limitado a sistemas distribuidos, arquitectura en la nube y patrones de diseño"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en conception et architecture de systèmes","Limité aux systèmes distribués, à l''architecture cloud et aux modèles de conception"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen im Systemdesign und in der Architektur","Begrenzt auf verteilte Systeme, Cloud-Architektur und Designmuster"],"pt":["Requer expertise em design e arquitetura de sistemas","Limitado a sistemas distribuídos, arquitetura de nuvem e padrões de design"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в области проектирования и архитектуры системы","Ограничен распределенными системами, облачной архитектурой и шаблонами проектирования"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في تصميم وتخطيط النظام","محدود لأنظمة موزعة وعمارة سحابية وأنماط تصميم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"02f0cb714cd2a39d09c91a58994e58d9aeefd84e63c29a809161cb2a7d42558f","qualityScore":33}');
