 personalizadas de Claude para CLI"],"fr":["Portes de qualité pour le développement B2B SaaS","Respect de TypeScript","Conseiller de multi-LLM","Outils de code personnalisés de Claude pour CLI"],"de":["Qualitäts- und Compliance-Tore für die B2B-SaaS-Entwicklung","TypeScript-Compliance","Multi-LLM-Berater","Benutzerdefinierte Claude-Code-Tools für CLI"],"pt":["Portas de qualidade para garantir a consistência do código","Enforcement de TypeScript para melhorar a manutenção do código","Multi-LLM advisor para tomar decisões informadas","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares"],"ru":["Контроль качества для обеспечения согласованности кода","Принудительное использование TypeScript для улучшения поддержки кода","Много-LLM-советник для принятия обоснованных решений","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки"],"ar":["بوابات الجودة لضمان الاتساق في الكود","التنفيذ بالنوع لتحسين صيانة الكود","مستشار متعدد LLM لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 ui-freeze","什么是 ui-freeze","ui-freeze 替代方案","ui-freeze 与竞争对手比较","ui-freeze 安装","ui-freeze 设置指南","B2B SaaS 开发工具","AI 智能代理","TypeScript 强制"],"ja":["ui-freeze の使用方法","ui-freeze とは","ui-freeze の代替","ui-freeze と競合の比較","ui-freeze のインストール","ui-freeze の設定ガイド","B2B SaaS 開発ツール","AI エージェント","TypeScript 強制"],"ko":["ui-freeze 사용 방법","ui-freeze是什么","ui-freeze 대체","ui-freeze와 경쟁자의 비교","ui-freeze 설치","ui-freeze 설정 가이드","B2B SaaS 개발 도구","AI 에이전트","TypeScript 강제"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo","ui-freeze","desarrollo B2B SaaS","cómo usar ui-freeze","alternativas a ui-freeze","instalación de ui-freeze","guía de configuración de ui-freeze"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","ui-freeze","développement B2B SaaS","comment utiliser ui-freeze","alternatives à ui-freeze","installation de ui-freeze","guide de configuration de ui-freeze"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","ui-freeze","B2B-SaaS-Entwicklung","wie man ui-freeze verwendet","Alternativen zu ui-freeze","Installation von ui-freeze","Konfigurationsleitfaden für ui-freeze"],"pt":["como usar ui-freeze","o que é ui-freeze","ui-freeze vs outras ferramentas","guias de instalação do ui-freeze","configuração do ui-freeze","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento SaaS","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de software","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web"],"ru":["как использовать ui-freeze","что такое ui-freeze","ui-freeze vs другие инструменты","руководства по установке ui-freeze","настройка ui-freeze","лучшие практики разработки B2B SaaS","инструменты разработки программного обеспечения","разработка веб-приложений"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ui-freeze","ما هو ui-freeze","ui-freeze مقابل أدوات أخرى","دلائل تثبيت ui-freeze","إعداد ui-freeze","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير السaaS التجاري","أدوات تطوير البرمجيات","تطوير تطبيقات الويب"]}},"owner":"Svenja-dev","repo":"claude-code-skills","repoPath":"Svenja-dev/claude-code-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.148Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-freeze","description":"Protects design and theme files from unintended changes. Locks tailwind.config, global CSS, and theme variables. Requires explicit confirmation before modifying UI components. Activate on changes to CSS, theme config, or layout components.","bodyPreview":"# UI Freeze\n\n> Skill to protect design and theme files from unintended changes\n\n## Trigger\n\nThis skill activates automatically on changes to:\n\n### Critical Theme Files (LOCKED)\n\n- `tailwind.config.*` - Tailwind configuration\n- `**/index.css` - Global styles\n- `**/globals.css` - Global CSS variables\n- `**/theme.css` - Theme variables\n- `**/variables.css` - CSS custom properties\n\n### Important UI Components (WARNING)\n\n- `**/Header.*` - Navigation & Branding\n- `**/Footer.*` - Footer & Legal Links\n-","body":"# UI Freeze\n\n> Skill to protect design and theme files from unintended changes\n\n## Trigger\n\nThis skill activates automatically on changes to:\n\n### Critical Theme Files (LOCKED)\n\n- `tailwind.config.*` - Tailwind configuration\n- `**/index.css` - Global styles\n- `**/globals.css` - Global CSS variables\n- `**/theme.css` - Theme variables\n- `**/variables.css` - CSS custom properties\n\n### Important UI Components (WARNING)\n\n- `**/Header.*` - Navigation & Branding\n- `**/Footer.*` - Footer & Legal Links\n- `**/App.*` - Root Layout & Theme Provider\n- `**/Layout.*` - Main Layout wrapper\n\n## Rules\n\n### On Changes to LOCKED Files:\n\n1. **STOP** - Don''t automatically make changes\n2. **SHOW** - Display exactly what would change\n3. **JUSTIFY** - Why is this change needed?\n4. **IMPACT** - Which components are affected?\n5. **PREVIEW** - If possible, show visual diff\n6. **CONFIRM** - Explicit \"Yes, change design\"\n\n### On Changes to WARNING Files:\n\n1. **NOTE** - \"This file affects the UI\"\n2. **JUSTIFY** - Brief explanation of change\n3. **PROCEED** - Can continue without explicit confirmation\n\n## Example Dialog\n\n**User:** \"Change the background color to gray\"\n\n**Claude (with this skill):**\n\n```\nUI FREEZE ACTIVE\n\nYou want to modify a theme file. This affects:\n- File: tailwind.config.ts\n- Change: backgroundColor from #0f172a to #374151\n- Affected pages: ALL (global style)\n\nLast stable version: v1.0-stable-ui\n\nPreview:\n- Before: Dark blue background (#0f172a)\n- After: Gray background (#374151)\n\nShould I proceed? (Answer with \"Yes, change design\")\nAlternative: \"Show me a before/after screenshot\"\n```\n\n## Golden Screenshots (Reference)\n\nDefine baseline screenshots for visual regression:\n\n| Page | File | Last Check |\n|------|------|------------|\n| Login | `tests/screenshots/login-baseline.png` | - |\n| Dashboard | `tests/screenshots/dashboard-baseline.png` | - |\n| Settings | `tests/screenshots/settings-baseline.png` | - |\n\n## CSS Variables (Single Source of Truth)\n\nAll colors must be defined via CSS Variables:\n\n```css\n/* CORRECT - in theme.css or tailwind.config */\n--color-primary: #3B82F6;\n--color-background: #0f172a;\n\n/* WRONG - hard values in components */\nbackground-color: #0f172a; /* Not allowed */\nclassName=\"bg-[#0f172a]\"   /* Not allowed */\n```\n\n## Integration with Visual Regression\n\nAfter every approved design change:\n\n1. Run `npx playwright test --update-snapshots`\n2. Commit new baseline screenshots\n3. Update release tag (e.g., `v1.1-ui-gray-theme`)\n\n## Emergency Rollback\n\nIf design was accidentally changed:\n\n```bash\n# Restore last stable state\ngit checkout <last-stable-tag> -- tailwind.config.ts src/index.css\n\n# Or: Reset all theme files\ngit checkout <last-stable-tag> -- $(git diff --name-only HEAD <last-stable-tag> | grep -E ''\\.(css|config)'')\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nAdd to your CLAUDE.md:\n\n```markdown\n### UI Protection\n\nLocked Files:\n- tailwind.config.*\n- src/index.css\n- src/globals.css\n\nLast Stable UI Tag: v1.0-stable-ui\n\nDesign System:\n- Primary: #3B82F6\n- Background: #0f172a\n- Use CSS variables only\n```\n\n---\n\n## Origin\n\nOriginally developed for [fabrikIQ](https://fabrikiq.com) - AI-powered manufacturing data analysis.\n\n## License\n\nMIT - Free to use and modify\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:27.119Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring precise control over design and theme files in B2B SaaS development","zh":"适用于需要对设计和主题文件进行精确控制的前端代理的B2B SaaS开发","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがデザインとテーマファイルを正確に制御する必要があるB2B SaaS開発に適しています","ko":"디자인 및 테마 파일에 대한 정확한 제어가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트를 위한 B2B SaaS 개발에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que requieren un control preciso sobre los archivos de diseño y tema en el desarrollo de SaaS B2B","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Frontend nécessitant un contrôle précis sur les fichiers de conception et de thème dans le développement de SaaS B2B","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine präzise Kontrolle über Design- und Theme-Dateien in der B2B-SaaS-Entwicklung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que exigem controle preciso sobre arquivos de design e tema no desenvolvimento de B2B SaaS","ru":"Идеально подходит для Frontend Agents, требующих точного контроля над файлами дизайна и темы в разработке B2B SaaS","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يتطلبون تحكمًا دقيقًا في ملفات التصميم والسمات في تطوير B2B SaaS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to protect critical theme files like tailwind.config and global CSS variables from unintended changes, ensuring consistency and enforcing TypeScript standards across multi-LLM advisors","zh":"赋予代理保护关键主题文件（如tailwind.config和全局CSS变量）免受意外更改的能力，确保一致性并在多LLM顾问中执行TypeScript标准","ja":"エージェントがtailwind.configやグローバルCSS変数などの重要なテーマファイルを意図しない変更から保護する能力を付与し、一貫性を確保し、複数のLLMアドバイザーでTypeScriptの規範を適用します","ko":"에이전트가 tailwind.config 및 전역 CSS 변수와 같은 중요한 테마 파일을 의도하지 않은 변경으로부터 보호할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 일관성을 보장하고 여러 LLM 자문을 통해 TypeScript 표준을 적용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proteger archivos de tema críticos como tailwind.config y variables CSS globales de cambios no intencionados, garantizando la consistencia y aplicando los estándares de TypeScript en varios asesores de LLM","fr":"Permet aux agents de protéger des fichiers de thème critiques comme tailwind.config et des variables CSS globales contre des modifications non intentionnelles, garantissant la cohérence et imposant les normes de TypeScript à travers plusieurs conseillers LLM","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, kritische Theme-Dateien wie tailwind.config und globale CSS-Variablen vor unbeabsichtigten Änderungen zu schützen, um Konsistenz sicherzustellen und TypeScript-Standards über mehrere LLM-Berater hinweg durchzusetzen","pt":"Capacita os agentes a proteger arquivos de tema críticos como tailwind.config e variáveis CSS globais de alterações não intencionais, garantindo consistência e aplicando padrões TypeScript em múltiplos assessores LLM","ru":"Позволяет агентам защищать критические файлы тем, такие как tailwind.config и глобальные переменные CSS, от непреднамеренных изменений, обеспечивая согласованность и соблюдение стандартов TypeScript в нескольких LLM-советниках","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من حماية ملفات السمات الحرجة مثل tailwind.config ومتغيرات CSS العامة من التغييرات غير المقصودة، مما يضمن الاتساق ويفرض معايير TypeScript عبر مستشاري LLM المتعددين"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating quality gates for Tailwind configuration files","Preventing unauthorized changes to global CSS variables","Enforcing design consistency across Header and Footer components"],"zh":["自动化Tailwind配置文件的质量门","防止对全局CSS变量的未经授权的更改","在头部和底部组件中强制执行设计的一致性"],"ja":["Tailwind設定ファイルの品質ゲートの自動化","グローバルCSS変数への未承認変更の防止","ヘッダーとフッターのコンポーネントでデザインの一貫性を強制する"],"ko":["Tailwind 구성 파일의 품질 게이트 자동화","전역 CSS 변수에 대한 승인되지 않은 변경 방지","헤더 및 푸터 구성 요소에서 디자인 일관성을 적용"],"es":["Automatizar las puertas de calidad para los archivos de configuración de Tailwind","Prevenir cambios no autorizados en las variables CSS globales","Garantizar la coherencia del diseño en los componentes de Encabezado y Pie de página"],"fr":["Automatiser les portes de qualité pour les fichiers de configuration de Tailwind","Empêcher les modifications non autorisées des variables CSS globales","Assurer la cohérence de la conception dans les composants d''En-tête et de Pied de page"],"de":["Automatisierung der Qualitätsschleusen für Tailwind-Konfigurationsdateien","Verhindern nicht autorisierter Änderungen an globalen CSS-Variablen","Durchsetzung der Designkonsistenz in Header- und Footer-Komponenten"],"pt":["Automatização de portões de qualidade para arquivos de configuração do Tailwind","Impedindo alterações não autorizadas em variáveis CSS globais","Impondo consistência de design nos componentes Header e Footer"],"ru":["Автоматизация контроля качества для файлов конфигурации Tailwind","Предотвращение несанкционированных изменений глобальных переменных CSS","Обеспечение согласованности дизайна в компонентах Header и Footer"],"ar":["أتمتة بوابات الجودة لملفات تكوين Tailwind","منع التغييرات غير المصرح بها في متغيرات CSS العامة","فرض اتساق التصميم عبر مكونات Header و Footer"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to specific file types like index.css and theme.css","Limited to monitoring changes in designated critical theme files and important UI components"],"zh":["需要访问特定的文件类型，如index.css和theme.css","仅限于监控指定的关键主题文件和重要UI组件的更改"],"ja":["index.cssやtheme.cssなどの特定のファイルタイプへのアクセスが必要","指定された重要なテーマファイルや重要なUIコンポーネントの変更の監視に限定"],"ko":["index.css 및 theme.css와 같은 특정 파일 유형에 대한 액세스가 필요","지정된 중요한 테마 파일 및 중요한 UI 구성 요소의 변경 내용을 모니터링하는 것만 허용"],"es":["Requiere acceso a tipos de archivos específicos como index.css y theme.css","Limitado a la supervisión de cambios en archivos de tema críticos designados y componentes de UI importantes"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des types de fichiers spécifiques comme index.css et theme.css","Limité à la surveillance des modifications dans les fichiers de thème critiques désignés et les composants UI importants"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf bestimmte Dateitypen wie index.css und theme.css","Begrenzt auf die Überwachung von Änderungen in bestimmten kritischen Theme-Dateien und wichtigen UI-Komponenten"],"pt":["Requer acesso a tipos específicos de arquivo, como index.css e theme.css","Limitado ao monitoramento de alterações em arquivos de tema críticos designados e componentes importantes da UI"],"ru":["Требует доступа к определенным типам файлов, таким как index.css и theme.css","Ограничено мониторингом изменений в назначенных критических файлах тем и важных компонентах пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أنواع ملفات محددة مثل index.css و theme.css","يقتصر على مراقبة التغييرات في ملفات السمات الحرجة المحددة ومكونات واجهة المستخدم المهمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ebc0c8be172e63cb7f1c9a5cf90192dd2e9b1a13e149c218b2bda87223d73d65","qualityScore":33}');
