استخدام Deslop","ما هو Deslop","بديل Deslop","Deslop مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Deslop","دليل إعداد Deslop","Deslop للمطورين","Deslop لآلات الإي الأجنت"]}},"owner":"heyAyushh","repo":"gloves","repoPath":"heyAyushh/gloves","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T13:08:04.220Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deslop","description":"Remove AI-generated code slop and improve code quality. Use when you need to clean up AI-written code, remove unnecessary defensive patterns, eliminate inconsistent comments, or align code style with the rest of the codebase.","bodyPreview":"# Remove AI Code Slop\n\nCheck the diff against main and remove AI-generated slop from this branch.\n\nIf the diff is empty and on main/master, scan the entire codebase for AI slop.\n\n## What to Remove\n\n- Extra comments that a human wouldn''t add or inconsistent with the file\n- Unnecessary defensive checks or try/catch blocks abnormal for that codebase area (especially if called by trusted/validated codepaths)\n- Casts to `any` to work around type issues\n- Any style inconsistent with the file\n\n## Outpu","body":"# Remove AI Code Slop\n\nCheck the diff against main and remove AI-generated slop from this branch.\n\nIf the diff is empty and on main/master, scan the entire codebase for AI slop.\n\n## What to Remove\n\n- Extra comments that a human wouldn''t add or inconsistent with the file\n- Unnecessary defensive checks or try/catch blocks abnormal for that codebase area (especially if called by trusted/validated codepaths)\n- Casts to `any` to work around type issues\n- Any style inconsistent with the file\n\n## Output\n\nReport with only a 1-3 sentence summary of what was changed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T14:10:46.930Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced AI-generated code cleanup capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 AI 生成代码清理功能的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー エージェントが高度な AI 生成コードのクリーンアップ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 AI 생성 코드 정리 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de limpieza de código generadas por IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des capacités de nettoyage de code avancées générées par l''IA.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die erweiterte AI-generierte Code-Reinigungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de limpeza de código gerado por IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности очистки кода, сгенерированного ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتنظيف الكود الذي تم إنشاؤه بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to remove AI-generated slop from codebases using OpenCLAW credentials and password audits, by eliminating extra comments, unnecessary defensive checks, and inconsistent coding styles, ensuring consistency with the file''s style and improving overall code quality.","zh":"赋予代理使用 OpenCLAW 凭证和密码审计，从代码库中删除 AI 生成的杂乱代码，通过消除额外的注释、不必要的防御性检查和不一致的编码风格，确保与文件风格的一致性并提高整体代码质量。","ja":"OpenCLAW 資格情報とパスワード監査を使用して、コードベースから AI 生成の不要なコードを削除し、余分なコメント、不要な防御的チェック、不一致なコーディングスタイルを排除し、ファイルのスタイルとの一致性を確保し、全体的なコード品質を向上させることで、エージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"OpenCLAW 자격 정보와 비밀번호 감사를 사용하여 코드베이스에서 AI 생성된 불필요한 코드를 제거하고,额外한 주석, 불필요한 방어적 확인, 일관되지 않은 코딩 스타일을 제거하여 파일의 스타일과 일관성을 보장하고, 전체적인 코드 품질을 향상 시켜 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a eliminar la porquería generada por la IA de los conjuntos de código utilizando credenciales de OpenCLAW y auditorías de contraseñas, eliminando comentarios adicionales, comprobaciones defensivas innecesarias y estilos de codificación inconsistentes, garantizando la coherencia con el estilo del archivo y mejorando la calidad general del código.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''éliminer les saletés générées par l''IA des bases de code en utilisant les informations d''identification OpenCLAW et les audits 