ry-analyzer 대체품","query-analyzer vs ClickHouse","query-analyzer 설치","query-analyzer 설정 가이드","ClickHouse 데이터베이스 최적화","AI 에이전트 도구"],"es":["herramienta de análisis de consultas","optimizar base de datos ClickHouse","mejorar rendimiento de base de datos","alternativa a ClickHouse","cómo usar herramienta de análisis de consultas","guía de instalación de herramienta de análisis de consultas","ClickHouse vs otros"],"fr":["outil d''analyse de requêtes","optimiser base de données ClickHouse","améliorer les performances de la base de données","alternative à ClickHouse","comment utiliser l''outil d''analyse de requêtes","guide d''installation de l''outil d''analyse de requêtes","ClickHouse vs autres"],"de":["Abfrageanalyse-Tool","ClickHouse-Datenbank optimieren","Datenbankleistung verbessern","Alternative zu ClickHouse","wie man das Abfrageanalyse-Tool verwendet","Installationsanleitung für das Abfrageanalyse-Tool","ClickHouse vs andere"],"pt":["ferramenta de análise de consultas","otimização de banco de dados ClickHouse","gerenciamento de banco de dados","monitoramento de desempenho de consultas","como usar ferramenta de análise de consultas","ferramenta de análise de consultas alternative","instalar ferramenta de análise de consultas"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для анализа запросов","оптимизация базы данных ClickHouse","управление базой данных","мониторинг производительности запросов","как использовать ИИ Агент для анализа запросов","ИИ Агент для анализа запросов альтернатива","установка ИИ Агента для анализа запросов"],"ar":["أداة تحليل الاستعلامات","تحسين قاعدة بيانات ClickHouse","إدارة قاعدة بيانات","مراقبة أداء الاستعلامات","كيفية استخدام أداة تحليل الاستعلامات","أداة تحليل الاستعلامات بديلة","تثبيت أداة تحليل الاستعلامات"]}},"owner":"rahmatrdn","repo":"go-ch-manager","repoPath":"rahmatrdn/go-ch-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.944Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"query-analyzer","description":"Skill for analyzing and optimizing ClickHouse queries in go-ch-manager.","bodyPreview":"# ClickHouse Query Analyzer Skill\n\nThis skill provides a structured workflow for analyzing and optimizing ClickHouse queries. When a user provides a query for analysis, follow these steps:\n\n## Step 1: Schema Assessment\nReview the table definition to understand the physical data layout.\n- **Tools**: `SHOW CREATE TABLE {table}` or `DESCRIBE TABLE {table}`.\n- **Checklist**:\n    - Identify **Partition Key**: Is the query filtering by it?\n    - Identify **Sorting Key (Primary Key)**: Is the query lev","body":"# ClickHouse Query Analyzer Skill\n\nThis skill provides a structured workflow for analyzing and optimizing ClickHouse queries. When a user provides a query for analysis, follow these steps:\n\n## Step 1: Schema Assessment\nReview the table definition to understand the physical data layout.\n- **Tools**: `SHOW CREATE TABLE {table}` or `DESCRIBE TABLE {table}`.\n- **Checklist**:\n    - Identify **Partition Key**: Is the query filtering by it?\n    - Identify **Sorting Key (Primary Key)**: Is the query leveraging the prefix of the sorting key in `WHERE`/`PREWHERE`?\n    - Check **Data Types**: Are there `LowCardinality` strings or `Nullable` columns that could be optimized?\n\n## Step 2: Query Plan Analysis\nUse ClickHouse''s built-in `EXPLAIN` to see how the engine intends to execute the query.\n- **Commands**:\n    - `EXPLAIN indexes=1 {query}`: Check if any marks/parts are being skipped by indexes.\n    - `EXPLAIN actions=1 {query}`: See the detailed execution steps.\n    - `EXPLAIN PIPELINE {query}`: Check the level of parallelism.\n\n## Step 3: Runtime Performance Audit\nIf the query has been run, analyze its actual resource consumption.\n- **Source**: `system.query_log`.\n- **Key Metrics to Inspect**:\n    - `read_rows` vs `result_rows`: High ratio indicates inefficient filtering.\n    - `read_bytes`: Total I/O overhead.\n    - `memory_usage`: Peak memory consumed (crucial for large JOINs or Aggregations).\n    - `query_duration_ms`: Total latency.\n\n## Step 4: Common Optimization Strategies\nApply these patterns to improve performance:\n1. **Leverage PREWHERE**: Move filters on primary key columns or small columns to `PREWHERE` to prune data before reading large columns.\n2. **Avoid SELECT ***: Specify only necessary columns to minimize I/O in the columnar storage.\n3. **Optimize Joins**: ClickHouse prefers `JOIN`s where the right-side table fits in memory. Consider using `Dictionaries` for high-performance lookups.\n4. **Partition Pruning**: Ensure filters on partition keys (usually time-based) are present to avoid scanning all data parts.\n5. **Function Pushdown**: Avoid wrapping columns in functions in the `WHERE` clause (e.g., use `date >= ''2023-01-01''` instead of `toYear(date) = 2023`).\n\n## Analysis Report Format\nWhen providing your analysis, structure it as follows:\n1. **Summary**: High-level assessment (e.g., \"I/O bound\", \"Memory intensive\").\n2. **Schema Audit**: Insights from table definition.\n3. **Execution Plan**: Insights from `EXPLAIN`.\n4. **Bottlenecks**: Specific causes of slowness.\n5. **Recommendations**: Numbered list of actionable SQL changes or schema improvements.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:40:44.967Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Database Analysis Agents needing advanced ClickHouse query optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级ClickHouse查询优化能力的数据库分析代理。","ja":"ClickHouseの高度なクエリ最適化機能が必要なデータベース分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 ClickHouse 쿼리 최적화 기능을 필요로 하는 데이터베이스 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Base de Datos que necesitan capacidades de optimización de consultas de ClickHouse avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de base de données nécessitant des capacités d''optimisation de requêtes ClickHouse avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Datenbankanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte ClickHouse-Abfrage-Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Banco de Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de consultas ClickHouse.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа баз данных, которым необходимы расширенные возможности оптимизации запросов ClickHouse.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل قاعدة البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين استفسارات ClickHouse."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and optimize ClickHouse queries with deep performance visibility, utilizing tools like SHOW CREATE TABLE and DESCRIBE TABLE for schema assessment and identifying partition keys and sorting keys.","zh":"赋予代理分析和优化ClickHouse查询的能力，具有深入的性能可见性，利用如SHOW CREATE TABLE和DESCRIBE TABLE等工具进行模式评估和识别分区键和排序键。","ja":"エージェントがClickHouseクエリを分析および最適化する機能を提供します。深いパフォーマンスの可視性を持ち、SHOW CREATE TABLEやDESCRIBE TABLEなどのツールを使用してスキーマを評価し、パーティションキーとソートキーを識別します。","ko":"에이전트가 ClickHouse 쿼리를 분석하고 최적화하는 기능을 제공하며, 깊은 성능 가시성을 제공하고 SHOW CREATE TABLE 및 DESCRIBE TABLEなどの 도구를 사용하여 스키마를 평가하고 파티션 키 및 정렬 키를 식별합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar y optimizar las consultas de ClickHouse con una visibilidad profunda del rendimiento, utilizando herramientas como SHOW CREATE TABLE y DESCRIBE TABLE para la evaluación del esquema y la identificación de claves de partición y claves de clasificación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et d''optimiser les requêtes ClickHouse avec une visibilité approfondie des performances, en utilisant des outils tels que SHOW CREATE TABLE et DESCRIBE TABLE pour l''évaluation du schéma et l''identification des clés de partition et des clés de tri.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, ClickHouse-Abfragen mit tiefer Leistungsverfolgung zu analysieren und zu optimieren, unter Verwendung von Tools wie SHOW CREATE TABLE und DESCRIBE TABLE für die Bewertung des Schemas und die Identifizierung von Partitionsschlüsseln und Sortierschlüsseln.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar e otimizar as consultas ClickHouse com visibilidade profunda de desempenho, utilizando ferramentas como SHOW CREATE TABLE e DESCRIBE TABLE para avaliação de esquema e identificação de chaves de partição e chaves de ordenação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать и оптимизировать запросы ClickHouse с глубокой видимостью производительности, используя инструменты как SHOW CREATE TABLE и DESCRIBE TABLE для оценки схемы и определения ключей раздела и ключей сортировки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تحليل و تحسين استفسارات ClickHouse مع رؤية أعمق للأداء، باستخدام أدوات مثل SHOW CREATE TABLE و DESCRIBE TABLE لتقييم مخطط قاعدة البيانات وتحديد مفاتيح التقسيم ومفاتيح الترتيب."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing query performance bottlenecks","Optimizing ClickHouse database schema for improved query efficiency","Identifying and leveraging partition keys for faster query execution"],"zh":["分析查询性能瓶颈","优化ClickHouse数据库模式以提高查询效率","识别和利用分区键以加快查询执行"],"ja":["クエリパフォーマンスのボトルネックを分析する","ClickHouseデータベーススキーマを最適化してクエリ効率を向上させる","パーティションキーを識別して利用し、クエリの実行を高速化する"],"ko":["쿼리 성능 병목현상을 분석하는こと","ClickHouse 데이터베이스 스키마를 최적화하여 쿼리 효율성을 개선하는 것","파티션 키를 식별하고 활용하여 쿼리 실행을 가속하는 것"],"es":["Analizar cuellos de botella de rendimiento de la consulta","Optimizar el esquema de la base de datos ClickHouse para una mayor eficiencia de la consulta","Identificar y aprovechar las claves de partición para una ejecución de consultas más rápida"],"fr":["Analyser les goulots d''étranglement des performances de la requête","Optimiser le schéma de la base de données ClickHouse pour une meilleure efficacité des requêtes","Identifier et exploiter les clés de partition pour une exécution de requêtes plus rapide"],"de":["Analyse von Leistungsengpässen bei Abfragen","Optimierung des ClickHouse-Datenbankschemas für eine verbesserte Abfrageeffizienz","Identifizierung und Nutzung von Partitionsschlüsseln für eine schnellere Abfrageausführung"],"pt":["Analisar gargalos de desempenho de consultas","Otimizar o esquema do banco de dados ClickHouse para melhor eficiência de consulta","Identificar e usar chaves de partição para execução de consultas mais rápida"],"ru":["Анализировать узкие места производительности запросов","Оптимизировать схему базы данных ClickHouse для улучшения эффективности запросов","Определить и использовать ключи раздела для более быстрого выполнения запросов"],"ar":["تحليل أعطال أداء الاستفسارات","تحسين مخطط قاعدة البيانات ClickHouse لتحسين كفاءة الاستفسار","تحديد واستخدام مفاتيح التقسيم للتشغيل السريع للاستفسارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ClickHouse database","Limited to ClickHouse query analysis"],"zh":["需要访问ClickHouse数据库","仅限ClickHouse查询分析"],"ja":["ClickHouseデータベースへのアクセスが必要","ClickHouseクエリ分析のみに限定される"],"ko":["ClickHouse 데이터베이스에 접근할 수 있어야 함","ClickHouse 쿼리 분석에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de datos ClickHouse","Limitado al análisis de consultas de ClickHouse"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de données ClickHouse","Limité à l''analyse des requêtes ClickHouse"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die ClickHouse-Datenbank","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von ClickHouse-Abfragen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao banco de dados ClickHouse","Limitado à análise de consultas ClickHouse"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе данных ClickHouse","Ограничен только анализом запросов ClickHouse"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات ClickHouse","محدود فقط بتحليل استفسارات ClickHouse"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c8364fd9334abe28036c6270c13e9c044d3c1b81da816c38a5ea58f9deda5ada","qualityScore":32}');
