astery","Alternativen zu mcp_mastery","mcp_mastery vs andere KI-Agenten","Installation von mcp_mastery","Konfigurationsanleitung für mcp_mastery","Entwicklung von KI-Agenten","Integration von KI-Technologien"],"pt":["agentes de IA","infraestrutura souverana","orquestração de vida","negócios e tecnologia","autônomos","mcp_mastery","A''Space OS","como usar mcp_mastery","o que é mcp_mastery"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","суверенная инфраструктура","оркестровка жизни","бизнеса и технологий","автономные агенты","mcp_mastery","A''Space OS","как использовать mcp_mastery","что такое mcp_mastery"],"ar":["وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بنية تحتية حكومية","تنسيق الحياة","الأعمال والتكنولوجيا","وكلاء ذاتيين","mcp_mastery","A''Space OS","كيفية استخدام mcp_mastery","ما هو mcp_mastery"]}},"owner":"Amdkn","repo":"aspace_amiral","repoPath":"Amdkn/aspace_amiral","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.088Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp_mastery","description":"Maîtrise des serveurs MCP (Filesystem, Docker, Browser) pour les agents ASpace OS.","bodyPreview":"---\ndescription: Maîtrise des serveurs MCP (Filesystem, Docker, n8n) pour les agents A''Space OS.\nname: mcp_mastery\n---\n\n# MCP Mastery Skill\n\n## 📡 ANTIGRAVITY MCP PROTOCOL\n1. **Discovery**: Always check for available MCP tools using `list_tools` (or equivalent) at the start of a task.\n2. **Connectivity**: For `n8n`, prioritize the native MCP server over Webhooks/APIs.\n3. **Configuration**:\n   - URL: `http://localhost:5678` (Internal R1)\n   - Auth: Bearer Token (Personal Access Token from n8n Set","body":"---\ndescription: Maîtrise des serveurs MCP (Filesystem, Docker, n8n) pour les agents A''Space OS.\nname: mcp_mastery\n---\n\n# MCP Mastery Skill\n\n## 📡 ANTIGRAVITY MCP PROTOCOL\n1. **Discovery**: Always check for available MCP tools using `list_tools` (or equivalent) at the start of a task.\n2. **Connectivity**: For `n8n`, prioritize the native MCP server over Webhooks/APIs.\n3. **Configuration**:\n   - URL: `http://localhost:5678` (Internal R1)\n   - Auth: Bearer Token (Personal Access Token from n8n Settings).\n4. **Resilience**: If an MCP tool fails, fallback to Shell commands only if explicitly allowed by the Manager.\n\n## 🛠️ N8N MCP MASTER-CLASS\n- **Exhibition**: Every workflow must have the \"Enable MCP access\" toggle ON in n8n.\n- **Triggers**: Use `Webhook` or `Chat` triggers to expose functionality to the AI.\n- **Validation**: Test persistence using the `agent_signals` table audit after each MCP execution.\n\n## ⚖️ GOUVERNANCE\n- Never invent tools.\n- Log raw technical errors in `tracks.md`.\n- Adhere to the Universal File Resolution Protocol for all file operations.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:30:26.841Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents needing mastery over MCP servers with Filesystem, Docker, and n8n integration.","zh":"适用于需要掌握MCP服务器的文件系统、Docker和n8n集成的自治代理。","ja":"MCPサーバーのファイルシステム、Docker、およびn8n統合のマスターが必要な自律エージェントに最適。","ko":"MCP 서버의 파일 시스템, Docker 및 n8n 통합을 마스터해야 하는 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Autónomos que necesitan dominar los servidores MCP con Filesystem, Docker y integración de n8n.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Autonomes ayant besoin de maîtriser les serveurs MCP avec Filesystem, Docker et intégration de n8n.","de":"Perfekt für autonome Agenten, die die MCP-Server mit Filesystem, Docker und n8n-Integration beherrschen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos que necessitam de domínio sobre servidores MCP com Filesystem, Docker e integração com n8n.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, которым требуется мастерство над серверами MCP с Filesystem, Docker и интеграцией с n8n.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المستقلة التي تحتاج إلى إتقان الخواديم MCP مع Filesystem و Docker و n8n التكامل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate Life OS, Business OS, and Kernel via autonomous agents using ANTIGRAVITY MCP protocol, prioritizing native MCP server connectivity over Webhooks/APIs, and leveraging Bearer Token authentication for secure configuration.","zh":"赋予代理使用ANTIGRAVITY MCP协议编排Life OS、Business OS和Kernel的能力，优先使用本机MCP服务器连接而不是Webhooks/API，并利用Bearer Token身份验证进行安全配置。","ja":"ANTIGRAVITY MCPプロトコルを使用してLife OS、Business OS、Kernelをオーケストレーションするためにエージェントに権限を与え、Webhooks/APIよりもネイティブMCPサーバー接続を優先し、セキュアな構成のためにBearer Token認証を利用します。","ko":"ANTIGRAVITY MCP 프로토콜을 사용하여 Life OS, Business OS 및 Kernel을 오케스트레이션 할 수있는 에이전트를 강화하여 웹 훅 / API보다 네이티브 MCP 서버 연결을 우선시키고 보안 구성의 경우 베어러 토큰 인증을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a orquestar Life OS, Business OS y Kernel a través de agentes autónomos utilizando el protocolo ANTIGRAVITY MCP, priorizando la conectividad nativa del servidor MCP sobre Webhooks/API y aprovechando la autenticación de Bearer Token para una configuración segura.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer Life OS, Business OS et Kernel via des agents autonomes utilisant le protocole ANTIGRAVITY MCP, en donnant la priorité à la connectivité native du serveur MCP sur les Webhooks/API et en exploitant l''authentification par jeton Bearer pour une configuration sécurisée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Life OS, Business OS und Kernel über autonome Agenten mit dem ANTIGRAVITY-MCP-Protokoll zu orchestrieren, wobei die native MCP-Server-Verbindung gegenüber Webhooks/API priorisiert und die Bearer-Token-Authentifizierung für eine sichere Konfiguration genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a orquestrar Life OS, Business OS e Kernel por meio de agentes autônomos usando o protocolo ANTIGRAVITY MCP, priorizando a conectividade nativa do servidor MCP sobre Webhooks/APIs e utilizando autenticação de Bearer Token para configuração segura.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать Life OS, Business OS и Kernel посредством автономных агентов с использованием протокола ANTIGRAVITY MCP, отдающих приоритет родной подключенности сервера MCP над Webhooks/API и используя аутентификацию Bearer Token для безопасной конфигурации.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة ع