ner":"jabez007","repo":"johnny-decimal-zettelkasten","repoPath":"jabez007/johnny-decimal-zettelkasten","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.093Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"librarian-vault-manager","description":"Knowledge steward for Johnny Decimal/Zettelkasten Obsidian vaults. Use when managing vault structure, auditing links, cleaning up notes, constructing new vault sections, reviewing daily notes, or generating flashcards. Responds to keywords like organize my vault, check my index, review daily notes, audit links, cleanup notes, create new vault section, generate flashcards, Johnny Decimal, Zettelkasten.","bodyPreview":"# **Librarian Vault Manager**\n\n## **Overview**\n\nThis skill enables Gemini CLI to act as a knowledge steward for Obsidian vaults structured using the Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies. It helps maintain the vault''s structural integrity and discoverability by guiding the user through various maintenance and knowledge development tasks.\n\n## **Core Mandates**\n\nThe Librarian always prioritizes the preservation of knowledge and the structural integrity of the vault. Gemini CLI, when acting","body":"# **Librarian Vault Manager**\n\n## **Overview**\n\nThis skill enables Gemini CLI to act as a knowledge steward for Obsidian vaults structured using the Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies. It helps maintain the vault''s structural integrity and discoverability by guiding the user through various maintenance and knowledge development tasks.\n\n## **Core Mandates**\n\nThe Librarian always prioritizes the preservation of knowledge and the structural integrity of the vault. Gemini CLI, when acting as the Librarian, must adhere strictly to the following:\n\n* **Read-Only Analysis and Proposals:** Gemini CLI **MUST NEVER** create, modify, or delete files directly without a preceding proposal phase. All actions must be presented as concrete, specific proposals for user confirmation.  \n* **Explicit User Approval:** Always await explicit user approval before executing any file operations.  \n* **Respect ACID Notation:** All proposals concerning note identifiers, titles, and locations must strictly follow the `SYS.AC.ID` format (Area, Category, ID).  \n* **Adherence to Vault Guidelines:** Consult and follow the guidelines in `references/copilot-instructions.md` for identity format, atomicity, titles, links, and hierarchy.  \n* **Maintain JDex Integrity:**  \n  * The `00.00.md` root index must exist and link to the root base file.  \n  * Every system must have a `SYS.00.00.md` index linking back to root.  \n  * `_SYS/` folder stores all configuration (`.base`) files.\n\n## **Multi-Vault Architecture**\n\nThis project contains multiple Obsidian vaults in the `vaults/` directory.\n\n### **Vault Selection**\n\n* When a user request lacks explicit vault context, ask: \"Which vault should I work with?\"  \n* Accepted vault identifiers: `[vault-name]` from `vaults/[vault-name]/`  \n* Always confirm vault scope before proposing structural changes\n\n### **Path Resolution**\n\n* All `SYS.AC.ID` references and file paths are **vault-relative**  \n* Translate user intent into paths like: `vaults/[vault-name]/SYS/A0-Area/...`  \n* Never propose paths outside the selected vault''s boundaries\n\n### **Reference Document Lookup**\n\n* All workflow and reference documents are located at the project root: `.gemini/skills/librarian-vault-manager/references/`  \n* This includes vault guidelines (`copilot-instructions.md`), workflows (`audit-links.md`, `cleanup.md`, etc.), and methodologies.\n\n## **Multi-Vault Guardrails**\n\n* **Do not** modify notes in multiple vaults without explicit per-vault confirmation  \n* **Do not** create cross-vault links without user acknowledgment  \n* **Do not** propose structural changes that assume a single JDex  \n* **Always** confirm vault scope before proposing file operations\n\n## **Using the Librarian Skill**\n\nThis skill is designed to guide you through various vault management tasks. Based on the user''s request, you should identify the most relevant workflow.\n\n### **Workflow Selection**\n\nWhen a user''s request matches one of the following, read the corresponding workflow document for detailed instructions:\n\n* **Auditing Links / Strengthening Knowledge Graph**: If the user asks to \"audit links\", \"check for orphaned notes\", \"strengthen connections\", or similar, read `references/workflows/audit-links.md`.  \n* **Cleaning Up / Maintaining Hygiene**: If the user asks to \"clean up vault\", \"detect duplicates\", \"flag naming issues\", \"relocate notes\", or similar, read `references/workflows/cleanup.md`.  \n* **Constructing New Vault Sections**: If the user asks to \"scaffold a new vault\", \"create a new system/area/category\", or \"construct vault structure\", read `references/workflows/construct-vault.md`.  \n* **Daily Review / Extracting Durable Knowledge**: If the user asks to \"review daily notes\", \"extract concepts from daily notes\", or \"identify recurring themes\", read `references/workflows/daily-review.md`.  \n* **Generating Flashcards**: If the user asks to \"generate flashcards\" for a note, read `references/workflows/flashcards.md`.\n\n### **General Reference**\n\nFor general understanding of the vault''s underlying methodologies and specific rules, consult the following documents as needed:\n\n* **Johnny Decimal System**: `references/johnny-decimal.md`  \n* **Zettelkasten Method**: `references/zettelkasten.md`  \n* **Vault Philosophy**: `references/philosophy.md`  \n* **Copilot Instructions (Vault Guidelines)**: `references/copilot-instructions.md`\n\n## **Available Tools**\n\nThe primary tools for this skill are `read_file`, `list_directory`, `search_file_content` for analysis, and `write_file` (or `replace`) to execute changes after user confirmation.\n\n## **Example Scenario**\n\n**User Request:** \"Create a new vault for my Personal Finance.\"  \n**Gemini CLI Action:**\n\n1. Recognize \"Create a new vault\" intent.  \n2. `read_file` `references/workflows/construct-vault.md`.  \n3. Analyze the prompt to discover the system (\"FIN\" or \"MONEY\").  \n4. Follow the discovery workflow to define Areas (Banking, Taxes) and Categories.  \n5. Propose the full structure including `00.00.md` and `_SYS/`.  \n6. Upon \"Approve\", use `write_file` to generate the folders, indexes, and `.base` files.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:32:05.016Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Knowledge Management Agents seeking to organize and maintain complex information systems using Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies.","zh":"适合于知识管理代理寻求使用Johnny Decimal和Zettelkasten方法论组织和维护复杂信息系统。","ja":"Johnny DecimalとZettelkastenの方法論を使用して複雑な情報システムを整理して維持しようとするナレッジマネジメントエージェントに最適。","ko":"Johnny Decimal과 Zettelkasten 방법론을 사용하여 복잡한 정보 시스템을 구성하고 유지하려는 지식 관리 에이전트에게 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Gestión del Conocimiento que buscan organizar y mantener sistemas de información complejos utilizando las metodologías Johnny Decimal y Zettelkasten.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion des connaissances cherchant à organiser et à maintenir des systèmes d''information complexes en utilisant les méthodologies Johnny Decimal et Zettelkasten.","de":"Ideal für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die komplexe Informationssysteme mithilfe der Johnny Decimal- und Zettelkasten-Methoden organisieren und warten möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que buscam organizar e manter sistemas de informação complexos usando metodologias Johnny Decimal e Zettelkasten.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления знаниями, стремящихся организовать и поддерживать сложные информационные системы, используя методологии Johnny Decimal и Zettelkasten.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء لإدارة المعرفة الذين يسعون إلى تنظيم ونظام المعلومات المعقدة باستخدام منهجيات Johnny Decimal و Zettelkasten."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple Obsidian vaults, ensuring structural integrity and discoverability through AI-augmented maintenance tasks, utilizing Gemini CLI for guided knowledge development and preservation of knowledge.","zh":"赋予代理管理多个Obsidian保险库的能力，通过AI增强的维护任务确保结构完整性和可发现性，并利用Gemini CLI进行指导性的知识开发和保存。","ja":"エージェントが複数のObsidianボールトを管理できるようにし、Gemini CLIを使用したガイド付きのナレッジ開発とナレッジの保存を通じて、構造的完全性と発見可能性を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 여러 Obsidian 보관소를 관리할 수 있도록 하여 Gemini CLI를 사용한 유지 보수 작업을 통해 구조적 완전성과 발견 가능성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar múltiples vaults de Obsidian, garantizando la integridad estructural y la capacidad de descubrimiento a través de tareas de mantenimiento mejoradas con inteligencia artificial, utilizando Gemini CLI para el desarrollo y la preservación guiados del conocimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs vaults Obsidian, en garantissant l''intégrité structurelle et la découverte grâce à des tâches de maintenance améliorées par l''intelligence artificielle, en utilisant Gemini CLI pour le développement et la préservation guidés des connaissances.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehrere Obsidian-Vaults zu verwalten und so die strukturelle Integrität und die Auffindbarkeit durch künstlich intelligente Wartungsaufgaben sicherzustellen, die Gemini CLI für die gesteuerte Wissensentwicklung und -erhaltung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar várias vaults do Obsidian, garantindo a integridade estrutural e a descoberta por meio de tarefas de manutenção aumentadas por IA, utilizando o Gemini CLI para o desenvolvimento e preservação guiados do conhecimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять несколькими хранилищами Obsidian, обеспечивая структуру целостности и обнаружения посредством задач обслуживания, усиленных ИИ, используя Gemini CLI для руководства развитием и сохранением знаний.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة Several Obsidian vaults، مما يضمن السلامة الهيكلية والاكتشاف من خلال مهام الصيانة المعززة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، باستخدام Gemini CLI لتطوير المعرفة والحفاظ عليها بتقديم إرشادات."},"useCases":{"en":["Maintaining Obsidian vaults with Johnny Decimal for structural organization","Augmenting knowledge systems with Zettelkasten for emergent meaning","Guiding users through maintenance and knowledge development tasks using Gemini CLI"],"zh":["使用Johnny Decimal对Obsidian保险库进行结构组织","使用Zettelkasten增强知识系统以实现新兴意义","使用Gemini CLI指导用户完成维护和知识开发任务"],"ja":["Johnny Decimalを使用してObsidianボールトの構造を整理する","Zettelkastenを使用してナレッジシステムを強化して新しい意味を生み出す","Gemini CLIを使用してユーザーをガイド付きの維持とナレッジ開発タスクに導く"],"ko":["Johnny Decimal을 사용하여 Obsidian 보관소의 구조적 구성","Zettelkasten을 사용하여 지식 시스템을 강화하여 새로운 의미를 생성하는 것","Gemini CLI를 사용하여 사용자를 유지 보수 및 지식 개발 작업으로 안내하는 것"],"es":["Mantener vaults de Obsidian con Johnny Decimal para la organización estructural","Ampliar sistemas de conocimiento con Zettelkasten para el significado emergente","Guiar a los usuarios a través de tareas de mantenimiento y desarrollo del conocimiento con Gemini CLI"],"fr":["Maintenir des vaults Obsidian avec Johnny Decimal pour l''organisation structurelle","Améliorer les systèmes de connaissances avec Zettelkasten pour le sens émergent","Guider les utilisateurs à travers les tâches de maintenance et de développement des connaissances avec Gemini CLI"],"de":["Obsidian-Vaults mit Johnny Decimal für strukturelle Organisation warten","Wissenssysteme mit Zettelkasten für emergentes Verständnis erweitern","Benutzer durch Wartungs- und Wissensentwicklungsaufgaben mit Gemini CLI führen"],"pt":["Manter vaults do Obsidian com Johnny Decimal para organização estrutural","Aumentar sistemas de conhecimento com Zettelkasten para significado emergente","Orientar usuários por meio de tarefas de manutenção e desenvolvimento de conhecimento usando Gemini CLI"],"ru":["Поддерживать хранилища Obsidian с Johnny Decimal для структуризации","Усиливать системы знаний с Zettelkasten для появления смысла","Направлять пользователей через задачи обслуживания и развития знаний, используя Gemini CLI"],"ar":["صيانة مستودعات Obsidian مع Johnny Decimal من أجل التنظيم الهيكلي","تعزيز أنظمة المعرفة مع Zettelkasten من أجل المعنى الناشئ","توجيه المستخدمين من خلال مهام الصيانة وتطوير المعرفة باستخدام Gemini CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gemini CLI compatibility","Limited to Obsidian vaults","Dependent on AI librarian agents for maintenance"],"zh":["需要Gemini CLI兼容性","仅限于Obsidian保险库","依赖于AI图书馆代理进行维护"],"ja":["Gemini CLIの互換性が必要","Obsidianボールトのみ","メンテナンスのためにAIライブラリエージェントに依存"],"ko":["Gemini CLI 호환성이 필요함","Obsidian 보관소에만 제한됨","유지 보수를 위해 AI 도서관 에이전트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Gemini CLI","Limitado a vaults de Obsidian","Dependiente de agentes bibliotecarios de inteligencia artificial para el mantenimiento"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Gemini CLI","Limité aux vaults Obsidian","Dépendant des agents bibliothécaires d''intelligence artificielle pour la maintenance"],"de":["Benötigt Gemini-CLI-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf Obsidian-Vaults","Von künstlich intelligenten Bibliotheksagenten für die Wartung abhängig"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Gemini CLI","Limitado a vaults do Obsidian","Dependente de agentes bibliotecários de IA para manutenção"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Gemini CLI","Ограничен хранилищами Obsidian","Зависит от агентов-библиотекарей ИИ для обслуживания"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Gemini CLI","محدود بمستودعات Obsidian","يعتمد على وكلاء المكتبات الاصطناعية للصيانة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b41e724937c3db5f59ef84cdff6ef037248e705efdb40fd3b28555baf7cbf884","qualityScore":32}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('udecode/plate/lfg', 'community', 'udecode', 'plate', 'udecode/plate', 'lfg', 15967, 953, 31, '2026-02-28T00:47:18Z', '2026-02-28T12:48:05.891Z', '9ab08fa53db637559144777db9918a5c9af0273824aa93a6524f90da924a5dfd', '{"id":"udecode/plate/lfg","name":"lfg","description":{"zh":"lfg是一款基于AI的富文本编辑器，集成了MCP和shadcn/ui，支持React和TypeScript","ja":"lfgはAIエージェントを搭載したリッチテキストエディターで、MCPとshadcn/uiを統合しています","ko":"lfg는 AI 에이전트를 탑재한 리치 텍스트 편집기로서 MCP 및 shadcn/ui를 통합하였습니다","es":"lfg es un editor de texto enriquecido (WYSIWYG) de código abierto para React, construido con Slate.js y TypeScript. Integra capacidades de IA a través de MCP y utiliza los componentes de shadcn/ui para una interfaz moderna y accesible.","fr":"lfg est un éditeur de texte enrichi (WYSIWYG) open source pour React, construit avec Slate.js et TypeScript. Il intègre des capacités d''IA via MCP et utilise les composants shadcn/ui pour une interface moderne et accessible.","de":"lfg ist ein Open-Source Rich-Text Editor (WYSIWYG) für React, erbaut mit Slate.js und TypeScript. Es integriert KI-Fähigkeiten über MCP und nutzt shadcn/ui Komponenten für eine moderne und zugängliche Oberfläche.","pt":"O lfg é um editor de texto rico com recursos de IA, MCP e shadcn/ui, permitindo uma edição avançada.","ru":"Lfg - это редактор с ИИ, MCP и shadcn/ui, обеспечивающий продвинутую редакцию.","ar":"lfg هو محرر نص غني مع ميزات الذكاء الاصطناعي، MCP، و shadcn/ui، مما يسمح بالتحرير المتقدم.","en":"Rich-text editor with AI, MCP, and shadcn/ui"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能编辑器lfg - 集成MCP和shadcn/ui","ja":"AIエージェント lfg - MCPとshadcn/uiを搭載したリッチテキストエディター","ko":"AI 에이전트 lfg - MCP 및 shadcn/ui가 통합된 리치 텍스트 편집기","es":"lfg: Editor de texto enriquecido con IA y MCP para React","fr":"lfg: Éditeur de texte enrichi avec IA et MCP pour React","de":"lfg: Rich-Text Editor mit KI und MCP für React","pt":