رأس","en":"tunit"},"description":{"zh":"Tunit 是一个 Headless Blazor 组件库，用于简化开发流程和提高开发效率。","ja":"Tunit は Headless Blazor コンポーネント ライブラリで、開発プロセスを簡素化し、開発効率を向上させます。","ko":"Tunit은 Headless Blazor 컴포넌트 라이브러리로 개발 프로세스를 단순화하고 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"tunit es una biblioteca de componentes Blazor headless para desarrolladores. Ofrece una forma eficiente de crear interfaces de usuario","fr":"tunit est une bibliothèque de composants Blazor headless pour les développeurs. Elle offre un moyen efficace de créer des interfaces utilisateur","de":"tunit ist eine Headless-Blazor-Komponentenbibliothek für Entwickler. Sie bietet eine effiziente Möglichkeit, Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen","pt":"Tunit é uma biblioteca de componentes headless Blazor que permite criar aplicações web escaláveis e personalizadas","ru":"Tunit - библиотека безголовых компонентов Blazor, которая позволяет создавать масштабируемые и настраиваемые веб-приложения","ar":"Tunit هي مكتبة مكونات Blazor بدون رأس تسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتحجيم ومتوافقة","en":"A headless blazor component library"},"definition":{"en":"A headless blazor component library"},"features":{"zh":["Headless Blazor 组件","AI 智能工具集成","简化开发流程","提高开发效率","支持多种开发框架"],"ja":["Headless Blazor コンポーネント","AI エージェント統合","開発プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上","多種の開発フレームワークをサポート"],"ko":["Headless Blazor 컴포넌트","AI 에이전트 통합","개발 프로세스 단순화","개발 효율성 향상","다양한 개발 프레임워크 지원"],"es":["Biblioteca de componentes Blazor headless","Crea interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Integração con otras herramientas de desarrollo","Optimizado para rendimiento y escalabilidad","Facil de usar y personalizar"],"fr":["Bibliothèque de composants Blazor headless","Créez des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Intégration avec d''autres outils de développement","Optimisé pour les performances et la scalabilité","Facile à utiliser et à personnaliser"],"de":["Headless-Blazor-Komponentenbibliothek","Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen","Integration mit anderen Entwicklungstools","Optimiert für Leistung und Skalierbarkeit","Einfach zu verwenden und anzupassen"],"pt":["Componentes headless personalizáveis","Suporte a aplicativos web escaláveis","Integração com Blazor","Desenvolvimento rápido e eficiente","Compatibilidade com diferentes navegadores"],"ru":["Настраиваемые безголовые компоненты","Поддержка масштабируемых веб-приложений","Интеграция с Blazor","Быстрое и эффективное развитие","Совместимость с разными браузерами"],"ar":["مكونات بدون رأس قابلة للتخصيص","دعم التطبيقات الويب القابلة للتحجيم","الاندماج مع Blazor","التطوير السريع والفعال","التوافق مع متصفحات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tunit","Headless Blazor","AI 智能工具","如何使用 Tunit","Tunit 安装指南","Tunit 与其它库的比较"],"ja":["Tunit","Headless Blazor","AI エージェント","Tunit の使い方","Tunit のセットアップ ガイド","Tunit と他のライブラリの比較"],"ko":["Tunit","Headless Blazor","AI 에이전트","Tunit 사용법","Tunit 설치 가이드","Tunit과 다른 라이브러리의 비교"],"es":["tunit","biblioteca de componentes Blazor","herramientas de AI","desarrollo de interfaces de usuario","Blazor headless","cómo usar tunit","tunit vs otras bibliotecas","instalar tunit","guía de configuración de tunit"],"fr":["tunit","bibliothèque de composants Blazor","outils d''IA","développement d''interfaces utilisateur","Blazor headless","comment utiliser tunit","tunit vs autres bibliothèques","installer tunit","guide de configuration de tunit"],"de":["tunit","Headless-Blazor-Komponentenbibliothek","KI-Tools","Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächen","Blazor headless","wie man tunit verwendet","tunit vs andere Bibliotheken","tunit installieren","Konfigurationsanleitung für tunit"],"pt":["Tunit","Biblioteca de componentes headless Blazor","Desenvolvimento web escalável","Como usar Tunit","Tunit vs Blazor","Instalar Tunit","Guia de configuração do Tunit","Alternativas ao Tunit","Tunit para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Tunit","Библиотека безголовых компонентов Blazor","Масштабируемое веб-разработка","Как использовать Tunit","Tunit vs Blazor","Установка Tunit","Руководство по настройке Tunit","Альтернативы Tunit","Tunit для разработчиков"],"ar":["Tunit","مكتبة مكونات Blazor بدون رأس","تطوير ويب قابلة للتحجيم","كيفية استخدام Tunit","Tunit مقابل Blazor","تثبيت Tunit","دليل إعداد Tunit","بديل Tunit","Tunit للطورين"]}},"owner":"AndreHogberg","repo":"summit-ui","repoPath":"AndreHogberg/summit-ui","stars":5,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-11T18:28:11Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tunit","description":"Run TUnit tests with Playwright. Use when user asks to run tests, execute tests, or check if tests pass.","bodyPreview":"# Running TUnit Tests\n\nThis project uses TUnit with Playwright for testing. Tests are located in `tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright/`.\n\n## Run All Tests\n\n```bash\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright\n```\n\n## Run Tests with Limited Parallelism (Recommended)\n\nTo prevent system overload when running Playwright tests, limit parallel test execution:\n\n```bash\n# Run with maximum 1 parallel test (sequential)\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --maximum-parallel-tests 1","body":"# Running TUnit Tests\n\nThis project uses TUnit with Playwright for testing. Tests are located in `tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright/`.\n\n## Run All Tests\n\n```bash\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright\n```\n\n## Run Tests with Limited Parallelism (Recommended)\n\nTo prevent system overload when running Playwright tests, limit parallel test execution:\n\n```bash\n# Run with maximum 1 parallel test (sequential)\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --maximum-parallel-tests 1\n\n# Run with maximum 8 parallel tests\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --maximum-parallel-tests 8\n```\n## Run Tests with Filters\n\nTUnit uses `--treenode-filter` with path pattern: `/assembly/namespace/class/test`\n\nFilter by class name:\n```bash\ndotnet run --project SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --treenode-filter ''/*/*/ClassName/*''\n```\n\nFilter by exact test name:\n```bash\ndotnet run --project SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --treenode-filter ''/*/*/*/TestName''\n```\n\nExamples:\n```bash\n# Run all Select accessibility tests\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --treenode-filter ''/*/*/SelectAccessibilityTests/*''\n\n# Run specific test by name\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --treenode-filter ''/*/*/*/Trigger_ShouldHave_RoleCombobox''\n\n# Run tests matching pattern (wildcard in test name)\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --treenode-filter ''/*/*/*/Keyboard*''\n\n# Run all tests in namespace\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --treenode-filter ''/*/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright/*/*''\n```\n\n## Run Tests in Debug Mode\n\nWhen a debugger is attached, Playwright will run in debug mode (`PWDEBUG=1`) automatically via the `Hooks.cs` setup.\n\n## View Test Output\n\nAdd `--report` flags for different output formats:\n```bash\n# Console output with details\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --output-format console-detailed\n\n# Generate TRX report\ndotnet run --project tests/SummitUI.Tests.Playwright -- --report-trx\n```\n\n## Flakiness Mitigation\n\nThe test project includes several features to reduce flakiness:\n\n1. **Automatic Retries**: Tests are automatically retried up to 2 times on failure (`[Retry(2)]` in GlobalSetup.cs)\n2. **Fully Sequential Execution**: All tests run sequentially via `[assembly: NotInParallel]` in GlobalSetup.cs\n3. **Server Readiness Check**: `Hooks.cs` waits for the Blazor server to be fully ready before tests start\n4. **Extended Timeouts**: Configured via `tunit.json` for longer test and hook timeouts\n\n## Project Structure\n\n- `GlobalSetup.cs` - Assembly-level test configuration (retries, parallelism)\n- `Hooks.cs` - Test session setup/teardown (starts Blazor server)\n- `BlazorWebApplicationFactory.cs` - WebApplicationFactory for hosting the test server\n- `tunit.json` - TUnit configuration file\n- `*AccessibilityTests.cs` - Accessibility test classes inheriting from `PageTest`\n\n## Test Conventions\n\n- Tests inherit from `TUnit.Playwright.PageTest` to get `Page` access\n- Use `[Before(Test)]` for per-test setup\n- Use `[Before(TestSession)]` / `[After(TestSession)]` for session-wide setup\n- Access the running server via `Hooks.ServerUrl`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:36:56.964Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for .NET Agents needing comprehensive unit testing capabilities with Playwright","zh":"适用于需要使用Playwright进行综合单元测试的.NET Agents","ja":".NETエージェントがPlaywrightを使用した包括的なユニットテスト機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"Playwright를 사용한 포괄적인 단위 테스트 기능이 필요한 .NET 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes .NET que necesitan capacidades de prueba unitaria comprehensiva con Playwright","fr":"Parfait pour les agents .NET ayant besoin de capacités de test unitaire complètes avec Playwright","de":"Perfekt für .NET-Agents, die umfassende Einheitstestfunktionen mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes .NET que precisam de capacidades de teste unitário abrangentes com Playwright","ru":"Идеально для агентов .NET, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности модульного тестирования с Playwright","ar":"مثالي لعميل .NET الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار الوحدة الشاملة مع Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run TUnit tests with limited parallelism, utilizing Playwright for efficient testing, and execute tests sequentially using dotnet run commands","zh":"赋予代理运行TUnit测试的能力，使用Playwright进行高效测试，利用dotnet run命令顺序执行测试","ja":"エージェントがTUnitテストを実行する機能を付与し、Playwrightを使用した効率的なテストを実行し、dotnet runコマンドを使用してテストを順序的に実行する","ko":"에이전트가 TUnit 테스트를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고 Playwright를 사용하여 효율적인 테스트를 수행하며 dotnet run 명령을 사용하여 테스트를 순차적으로 실행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas TUnit con paralelismo limitado, utilizando Playwright para pruebas eficientes y ejecutar pruebas secuencialmente utilizando comandos dotnet run","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests TUnit avec un parallélisme limité, en utilisant Playwright pour des tests efficaces et exécuter des tests de manière séquentielle à l''aide de commandes dotnet run","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, TUnit-Tests mit begrenztem Parallelismus auszuführen, indem Playwright für effiziente Tests verwendet wird und Tests sequenziell mithilfe von dotnet run-Befehlen ausgeführt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes TUnit com paralelismo limitado, utilizando Playwright para testes eficientes e executar testes sequencialmente usando comandos dotnet run","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать тесты TUnit с ограниченным параллелизмом, используя Playwright для эффективного тестирования, и выполнять тесты последовательно с помощью команд dotnet run","ar":"يمكّن العميل من تشغيل اختبارات TUnit بتوازي محدود، و باستخدام Playwright لاختبارات فعالة، وتنفيذ الاختبارات على التوالي باستخدام أوامر dotnet run"},"useCases":{"en":["Running headless Blazor component library tests","Executing Playwright tests with maximum parallelism control","Debugging SummitUI component interactions"],"zh":["运行无头Blazor组件库测试","使用Playwright执行最大并行控制测试","调试SummitUI组件交互"],"ja":["ヘッドレスBlazorコンポーネントライブラリテストの実行","Playwrightを使用した最大並列制御テストの実行","SummitUIコンポーネントの相互作用のデバッグ"],"ko":["헤드리스 Blazor 컴포넌트 라이브러리 테스트 실행","Playwright를 사용한 최대 병렬 제어 테스트 실행","SummitUI 컴포넌트 상호 작용 디버깅"],"es":["Ejecutar pruebas de biblioteca de componentes Blazor sin cabeza","Ejecutar pruebas Playwright con control de paralelismo máximo","Depurar interacciones de componentes SummitUI"],"fr":["Exécuter des tests de bibliothèque de composants Blazor sans tête","Exécuter des tests Playwright avec un contrôle de parallélisme maximum","Déboguer les interactions de composants SummitUI"],"de":["Headless-Tests für Blazor-Componentenbibliotheken ausführen","Playwright-Tests mit maximaler Parallelismuskontrolle ausführen","Interaktionen von SummitUI-Komponenten debuggen"],"pt":["Execução de testes de bibliotecas de componentes Blazor headless","Execução de testes Playwright com controle de paralelismo máximo","Depuração de interações de componentes SummitUI"],"ru":["Выполнение тестов библиотек компонентов Blazor в headless-режиме","Выполнение тестов Playwright с максимальным контролем параллелизма","Отладка взаимодействий компонентов SummitUI"],"ar":["تشغيل اختبارات مكتبات مكونات Blazor بدون رأس","تشغيل اختبارات Playwright مع التحكم الأقصى في التوازي","تصحيح أخطاء تفاعلات مكونات SummitUI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET environment","Dependent on Playwright for testing","Limited to Blazor component library testing"],"zh":[".NET环境要求","依赖Playwright进行测试","仅限Blazor组件库测试"],"ja":[".NET環境の要件","Playwrightに依存したテスト","Blazorコンポーネントライブラリテストのみ"],"ko":[".NET 환경 요구 사항","Playwright에 의존한 테스트","Blazor 컴포넌트 라이브러리 테스트만"],"es":["Requiere entorno .NET","Dependiente de Playwright para pruebas","Limitado a pruebas de biblioteca de componentes Blazor"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement .NET","Dépend de Playwright pour les tests","Limité aux tests de bibliothèque de composants Blazor"],"de":["Benötigt .NET-Umgebung","Von Playwright für Tests abhängig","Begrenzt auf Blazor-Componentenbibliothek-Tests"],"pt":["Requer ambiente .NET","Dependente do Playwright para testes","Limitado a testes de bibliotecas de componentes Blazor"],"ru":["Требует среды .NET","Зависит от Playwright для тестирования","Ограничен тестированием библиотек компонентов Blazor"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة .NET","يعتمد على Playwright للاختبارات","محدود باختبارات مكتبات مكونات Blazor"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b9248a14cde1fcc12414b042837c4574103a30bcc57048bd3eee99f2d1c124ab","qualityScore":31}');
