"otimização de desenvolvimento","como usar close-build","o que é close-build","alternative ao close-build","close-build vs outros"],"ru":["инструменты ии","close-build","lifeos programme","разработка программ","оптимизация разработки","как использовать close-build","что такое close-build","альтернатива close-build","close-build vs другие"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","close-build","برنامج lifeos","تطوير البرامج","تحسين التطوير","كيفية استخدام close-build","ما هي close-build","بديل close-build","close-build مقابل autres"]}},"owner":"marcusglee11","repo":"LifeOS","repoPath":"marcusglee11/LifeOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T22:32:57Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"close-build","description":"Use when a branch is ready to close. Closure gates (tests, doc stewardship) are enforced automatically by the PreToolUse hook on git merge/push. This skill handles merge orchestration, cleanup, and the final report.","bodyPreview":"# Close Build\n\nMerge to main and clean up. Closure gates run automatically via the PreToolUse hook.\n\n## Default behavior\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/closure_pack.py\n```\n\nThis runs:\n- squash merge to `main`,\n- local cleanup (branch delete + active context clear).\n\nNote: targeted closure tests and doc stewardship are enforced by the\n`.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` PreToolUse hook on `git merge`/`git push`.\nThey no longer need to be invoked manually.\n\n## Dry run (gates only)\n\n```bash\npyth","body":"# Close Build\n\nMerge to main and clean up. Closure gates run automatically via the PreToolUse hook.\n\n## Default behavior\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/closure_pack.py\n```\n\nThis runs:\n- squash merge to `main`,\n- local cleanup (branch delete + active context clear).\n\nNote: targeted closure tests and doc stewardship are enforced by the\n`.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` PreToolUse hook on `git merge`/`git push`.\nThey no longer need to be invoked manually.\n\n## Dry run (gates only)\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/closure_gate.py\n```\n\nUse to check gate status without merge/cleanup. Returns JSON verdict.\n\n## No cleanup mode\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/closure_pack.py --no-cleanup\n```\n\nUse when you need to keep branch/context after merge.\n\n## Git worktree constraint\n\nRun `closure_pack.py` from the **worktree directory**, not the primary repo.\n\nWhen `main` is already checked out in the primary worktree, the script\ndetects this automatically (via `git branch --show-current` on the repo root)\nand skips the `checkout main` step. The merge proceeds against the primary\nworktree''s `main` directly.\n\nIf you accidentally run from the primary repo, it will refuse (\"Switch to a\nfeature/build branch before running close-build\"). Switch to the worktree and\nretry.\n\n## Report contract (strict)\n\nOutput must use this section order:\n\n1. `Branch`\n2. `Commits`\n3. `Test Results`\n4. `What Was Done`\n5. `What Remains`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:09:13.886Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Git-Based Agents needing automated merge and cleanup capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动合并和清理功能的 Git-Based 代理。","ja":"Git ベースのエージェントが自動マージとクリーンアップ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 병합 및 청소 기능이 필요한 Git-Based 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en Git que necesitan capacidades de fusión y limpieza automatizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents basés sur Git nécessitant des capacités de fusion et de nettoyage automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Git-basierte Agenten, die automatisierte Merge- und Bereinigungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Baseados em Git que precisam de capacidades de mesclagem e limpeza automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов на основе Git, которым необходимы автоматические возможности слияния и очистки.","ar":"مثالي لويكيلاء القائمين على Git الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات دمج وتنظيف آلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate squash merges to the main branch, enforce targeted closure tests, and maintain documentation stewardship via the PreToolUse hook and scripts like closure_pack.py, utilizing Python 3 and Git protocols.","zh":"赋予代理自动化压缩合并到主分支的能力，执行目标关闭测试，并通过 PreToolUse hook 和类似 closure_pack.py 的脚本维护文档管理，利用 Python 3 和 Git 协议。","ja":"エージェントに、メインブランチへの自動スッッシュマージを実行し、ターゲットクローズテストを実施し、PreToolUse hook と closure_pack.py のようなスクリプトを使用して文書管理を維持する機能を提供し、Python 3 と Git プロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트에 메인 브랜치로의 자동 스쿼시 머지 실행, 대상 닫기 테스트 수행 및 PreToolUse hook 및 closure_pack.py와 같은 스크립트를 사용하여 문서 관리 유지 등을 제공하며, Python 3 및 Git 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar fusiones squash a la rama principal, hacer cumplir pruebas de cierre dirigidas y mantener la tutoría de la documentación a través del hook PreToolUse y scripts como closure_pack.py, utilizando Python 3 y protocolos Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les fusions squash vers la branche principale, de faire respecter les tests de fermeture ciblés et de maintenir la gestion de la documentation via le hook PreToolUse et des scripts comme closure_pack.py, en utilisant Python 3 et les protocoles Git.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Squash-Merges zum Hauptbranch zu automatisieren, gezielte Abnahmetests durchzusetzen und die Dokumentationsbetreuung über den PreToolUse-Hook und Skripte wie closure_pack.py zu pflegen, unter Verwendung von Python 3 und Git-Protokollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar mesclagens de squashing para o branch principal, impor testes de fechamento direcionados e manter a gestão de documentação via o hook PreToolUse e scripts como closure_pack.py, utilizando Python 3 e protocolos Git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции слияния в основную ветку, обеспечивать проведение нацеленных тестов на закрытие и поддерживать управление документацией посредством хука PreToolUse и скриптов типа closure_pack.py, используя Python 3 и протоколы Git.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على ت.Automation دمج Squash إلى الفرع الرئيسي ، وفرض اختبارات الإغلاق المستهدفة ، والمحافظة على إدارة الوثائق عبر hook PreToolUse وبرامج نصية مثل closure_pack.py ، باستخدام Python 3 وبروتوكولات Git."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating branch cleanup after merge","Enforcing closure tests on git push","Streamlining documentation updates with hooks"],"zh":["自动化合并后分支清理","强制 git push 时的关闭测试","使用 hook 流线化文档更新"],"ja":["マージ後のブランチクリーンアップの自動化","git push 時のクローズテストの強制","フックを使用したドキュメント更新のストリーミング"],"ko":["병합 후 분기 청소 자동화","git push 시 닫기 테스트 강제","hook를 사용한 문서 업데이트 스트리밍"],"es":["Automatizar la limpieza de ramas después de la fusión","Hacer cumplir las pruebas de cierre en git push","Optimizar las actualizaciones de documentación con hooks"],"fr":["Automatiser le nettoyage de branches après fusion","Faire respecter les tests de fermeture lors de la poussée Git","Optimiser les mises à jour de documentation avec des hooks"],"de":["Automatisieren der Bereinigung von Zweigen nach dem Merge","Durchsetzen von Abnahmetests bei Git-Push","Optimieren von Dokumentenaktualisierungen mit Hooks"],"pt":["Automatizar limpeza de branch após mesclagem","Impor testes de fechamento no push Git","Otimizar atualizações de documentação com ganchos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать очистку ветки после слияния","Обеспечивать проведение тестов на закрытие при пуше в Git","Оптимизировать обновления документации с помощью хуков"],"ar":["توفير تنظيف الفرع بعد الدمج","فرض اختبارات الإغلاق عند دفع Git","تبسيط تحديثات الوثائق باستخدام Hooks"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3 execution environment","Git repository access needed","Limited to squash merge strategy"],"zh":["需要 Python 3 执行环境","需要 Git 仓库访问","仅限于压缩合并策略"],"ja":["Python 3 実行環境が必要","Git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","スッッシュマージ戦略のみに限定"],"ko":["Python 3 실행 환경 필요","Git 저장소 액세스 필요","스쿼시 머지 전략만 해당"],"es":["Requiere entorno de ejecución Python 3","Se necesita acceso al repositorio Git","Limitado a la estrategia de fusión squash"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''exécution Python 3","L''accès au référentiel Git est nécessaire","Limité à la stratégie de fusion squash"],"de":["Benötigt Python-3-Ausführungsumgebung","Zugriff auf Git-Repository erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Squash-Merge-Strategie"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de execução Python 3","Acesso ao repositório Git necessário","Limitado à estratégia de mesclagem de squashing"],"ru":["Требуется среда выполнения Python 3","Необходим доступ к репозиторию Git","Ограниченная стратегия слияния с squash"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تشغيل Python 3","مطلوب الوصول إلى مستودع Git","محدود استراتيجية دمج Squash"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6e465eb53d2029ceca243e780a22d765060368aff843b517ce4d8559522e97d7","qualityScore":31}');
